<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">RRK02.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">OKURUGA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Musa Ekya Kabiri Ekirikwetwa Okuruga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Okuruga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kur</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA MUSA EKYA KABIRI EKIRIKWETWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">OKURUGA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Okukanya kw'Abaisraeli omuri Misri, n'okubonabonesibwa kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:8">Kut 46:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aga nigo maziina ga batabani ba Israeli abaizire omuri Misri na Yakobo, buri muntu n'eka ye. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Reubeeni, Simeoni, Leevi, Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakaari, Zebuluuni, Benyamiini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Daani, Nafutaali, Gaadi na Asheri. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Abantu boona abaarugire omunda ya Yakobo bakaba bari makumi mushanju kwonka Yosefu we akashangwa ari omuri Misri. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Bwanyima Yosefu yaafa na beene ishe boona, n'ab'omu busingye obwo boona.<verse eid="EXO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 105:24">Zab 105:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baazaara, baayeyongyera munonga, baakanya, baaba ab'amaani maingi munonga; n'ahabw'ekyo baijura ensi. <verse eid="EXO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Bwanyima haayema omugabe musya omuri Misri, owaabaire atarikumanya Yosefu. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Yaagira abantu be ati: Reeba, Abaisraeli ni baingi kandi n'ab'amaani okutukira; <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:19">Byak 7:19</ref>. </char></note> mwije tubacwere obwengye, barekye kukanya; nyentsya tukiguubwaho orugamba, bakeeteerana n'abazigu baitu, bakaturwanisa, bakacwa, bakaruga omuri egi nsi. <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo baabateereireho abanyampara, ngu babareebese enaku nibabeekoreza emitwaro erikuremeera. Baayombekyera Faraho endembo z'okuhunikamu, Pisomu na Ramaseesi. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Kwonka ei baagarukiire kubabonabonesa, nabo niyo baagarukiire kukanya n'okubuga hoona. Ekyo kyareetera Abanyamisri kugira obwoba bwingi ahabw'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Abanyamisri baakoresa Abaisraeli emirimo y'amaani; <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Kur 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:21">22:21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:19">Byak 7:19</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:34">34</ref>. </char></note> baabatamisa amagara gaabo ahabw'okubakoresa emirimo y'obuhuuku, nibabakaatisa obudongo n'okubabumbisa amatafaari, kandi baabakoresa emirimo y'emiringo yoona omu misiri; buri murimo gwona ogu baabaire babakoresa, baagubakoresa n'amaani.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Misri yaagambira abazaarisa b'Abaheburaayo, omwe orikwetwa Shifira, n'ondiijo orikwetwa Pua; <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />naagira ati: Ku muraabe nimuzaarisa Abaheburaayokazi, mwareeba bari aha butebe oburikuzaarirwaho, haazaarwa omwojo, mumwite; ku araabe ari omwishiki, agumeho. <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:16">Dan 3:16</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 3:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:29">Byak 5:29</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abazaarisa baatiina Ruhanga, tibaakora nk'oku omugabe wa Misri abaragiire, baaguma kureka abaana b'aboojo bahuriire. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Omugabe wa Misri yaayeta abazaarisa, yaababuuza ati: Ahabw'enki mukozire muti okureka abaana b'aboojo bakagumaho? <verse eid="EXO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:4">Yos 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Abazaarisa baagarukamu Faraho bati: Manya Abaheburaayokazi tibari nk'Abanyamisrikazi, ahakuba baine amaani, omuzaarisa ku aza kwija, ashanga baazaire. <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:12">Mub 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:27">2 Sam 7:27</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:38">1 Bag 11:38</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Ruhanga yaakorera gye abo bazaarisa; eihanga ry'Abahaheburaayo ryakanya, ryaba ery'amaani maingi. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Kandi abo bazaarisa ahabw'okutiina Ruhanga, yaabaha oruzaaro, baarugwamu enganda. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Bwanyima Faraho yaaragiira abantu be boona ati: Buri mwojo weena oraazaarwe Omuheburaayokazi, mumunagye omu mugyera; kwonka omwishiki weena agumeho.<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:20">Kur 6:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ow'omu ruganda rwa Leevi akagyenda, yaashwera omwishiki w'omu Baleevi. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:23">Heb 11:23</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi ogwo yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo; ku yaareebire ari omwana murungi, yaamushereka okumara ameezi ashatu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Bwanyima ku yaareebire atakibaasa kuguma amusherekire, yaareeta akagozi k'omubimbiri k'okumutamu, yaakasiiga eibumba na koroto, yaamutamu; ako kagozi yaakata ahagati y'ebifunjo omu nkungu y'omugyera; <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:59">Kub 26:59</ref>. </char></note> munyaanya yaayemerera hangahari kureeba ekiraamubeho.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:21">Byak 7:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhara wa Faraho yaashuuma aha mugyera kwoga, abazaana be baagyendagyenda aha rubaju rw'omugyera; ku yaareebire akagozi ahagati y'ebifunjo, yaatuma omuzaana kukareeta. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Ku yaakafundwire, yaashangamu omwana, ogwo mwana yaarira. Yaamugirira esaasi, yaagira ati: Ogu n'omwe aha baana b'Abaheburaayo. <verse eid="EXO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Ahonaaho munyaanya yaabuuza muhara wa Faraho ati: Nze kukwetera omurezi omu bakazi b'Abaheburaayo, akurerere ogu mwana? <verse eid="EXO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Muhara wa Faraho yaamugira ati: Irooko. Omwishiki yaagyenda, yaayeta nyina. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Muhara wa Faraho yaamugira ati: Twara omwana ogu, omunderere, ndyakuha ebihembo. Omukazi nikwo kutwara omwana, akamurera. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Bwanyima omwana ku yaakuzire, nyina yaamureetera muhara wa Faraho, yaaba omwana we. Yaamweta Musa, naagira ati: Ahabw'okuba nkamwiha omu maizi.<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okusaasibwa beene waabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:24-26">Heb 11:24-26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba rimwe Musa, ku yaakuzire, yaaza kureeba beene waabo, yaareeba obuhuuku obu barimu; kandi yaareeba Omunyamisri naateera Omuheburaayo, omwe ahari beene waabo. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Yaamagamaga; ku yaareebire hataine oriho, yaita ogwo Munyamisri, yaashereka omutumbi gwe omu musheenyi. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Ku bwaseesire, yaagarukayo, yaashanga Abaheburaayo babiri nibarwana, yaagambira owaashaagiza mugyenzi we ati: Ahabw'enki nooteera mugyenzi waawe? <verse eid="EXO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Onu ati: N'oha owaakuhaire obushoboorozi bw'okututegyeka n'okutucwera emanja? Nooyenda kunkuratsa Omunyamisri ou oitsire? Musa yaatiina, yaagira ati: Buzima eki nkozire kimanyirwe. <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:2">Kut 29:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Faraho ku yaakihuriire, yaasherura oku araite Musa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="EXO 2:15">Okuhunga kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Kwonka Musa yaahunga Faraho, yaaza omu nsi ya Midiani; ku yaahikireyo, yaashutama aha rubaju rw'eiziba. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">Kur 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Hakaba hariyo omunyamurwa wa Midiani, aine bahara be mushanju; baija, baataha amaizi, baijuza amaato kweshera obusyo bwa ishebo. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Haija abariisa, baababinga, kwonka Musa yaimuka, yaabarwanaho, yaayeshera obusyo bwabo. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Ku baataahire, Reueli ishebo yaagira ati: Byaba bita eri izooba? Ka mwarahukayo! <verse eid="EXO 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Baagarukamu bati: Omunyamisri niwe yaatujuna abariisa, akatutahira amaizi, kandi akatwesherera n'obusyo. <verse eid="EXO 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Yaabuuza bahara be ati: Mbwenu shi ogwo mushaija arahi? Ahabw'enki mwamutsigayo? Mumwete, tumufungurire. <verse eid="EXO 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Okuruga aho Musa yaasiima kuguma n'ogwo mushaija; bwanyima omushaija ogwo yaamuhingira muhara we Zipora. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:13">Heb 11:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, ishe yaamweta Gereshomu; ahakuba akagira ati: Nkashuhuukira omu nsi etari yaitu.<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okutaka kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Zab 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:20">Kut 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro bingi, omugabe wa Misri yaafa. Abaisraeli baatsinda ahabw'emirimo y'obuhuuku, baataka, n'okutaka kwabo ahabw'obuhuuku kwahika ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:5">Kur 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaahurira okutsinda kwabo, Ruhanga yaijuka endagaano ei yaaragaine na Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Ruhanga yaareeba Abaisraeli, Ruhanga yaamanya oku bari.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutuma Musa kuza kwiha Abaisraeli omuri Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:8">1 Bag 19:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Musa akaba naariisa obusyo bwa ishezaara Yesero omunyamurwa wa Midiani; yaatwara obusyo aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba bw'eihamba, yaahika aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga orurikwetwa Horebu. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:9">Isa 63:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:30">Byak 7:30</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaamweyorekyera omu rurimi rw'omuriro nigunaga enkobe ahagati y'orushaka; yaayetegyereza, yaareeba orushaka nirwaka, kwonka rutarikusya. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa yaagira ati: Ka nkiikame, ndeebe eri ihano, orushaka okwaka rutasye. <verse eid="EXO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />MUKAMA ku yaareebire yaakiikama kureeba, Ruhanga yaamweta naayema ahagati omu rushaka, naagira ati: Musa, Musa! Yaamwetaba ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="EXO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:15">Yos 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Otairira haihi; juura enkaito omu bigyere byawe, ahakuba omwanya ogu oyemereiremu n'ogurikwera. <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:26">Mak 12:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaagira ati: Ndi Ruhanga wa sho, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Yakobo. Musa yaayekwata aha maisho, ahakuba akatiina kureeba Ruhanga.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Buzimazima ndeebire okubonabonesibwa kw'abantu bangye abari omuri Misri, naahurira okutaka kwabo oku barikutakisibwa abanyampara; ahabw'okuba nimmanya obusaasi bwabo, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:27">Kub 13:27</ref>. </char></note> kandi naashuuma kubajuna, kubaiha omu mikono y'Abanyamisri, barugye omu nsi egyo, mbatware omu nsi enungi kandi egarami, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki, ensi ey'Abanyakanaani, ey'Abahiiti, ey'Abaamori, ey'Abaperizi, ey'abahiivi n'ey'Abayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Na mbwenu reeba, okutaka kw'Abaisraeli kumpikireho, kandi ndeebire okuhatwa oku Abanyamisri barikubahata. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo ija, nkutume ahari Faraho, oihe abantu bangye Abaisraeli omuri Misri.<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:5">Isa 6:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:6">Yer 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaagira Ruhanga ati: Niinye oha kuturukirira Faraho nkaiha Abaisraeli omuri Misri? <verse eid="EXO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yos 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:2">Isa 43:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Buzimazima ndyaba nkwine. Akamanyiso akarihamya ku niinye naakutumire n'aka; ku oriba waihire abantu omuri Misri, muryaheerereza Ruhanga aha rushozi oru. <verse eid="EXO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Musa yaagarukamu Ruhanga ati: Ku ndihika Abaisraeli, naabagira nti: Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe abantumireho; bambuuza bati: Eiziina rye n'oha? Ndyabagarukamu nta? <verse eid="EXO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:3">Kur 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:8">Heb 13:8</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira Musa ati: Ndi MBAHO; kandi yaagira ati: Oku nikwo origambira Abaisraeli, oti: MBAHO niwe abantumireho. <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Kandi Ruhanga yaagambira Musa ati: Oku nikwo origambira Abaisraeli, oti: MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaaka, Ruhanga wa Yakobo niwe abantumireho; eryo niryo iziina ryangye ebiro byona, kandi okwo nikwo nshemereire kwijukwa obusingye bwona. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:68">Luk 1:68</ref>. </char></note> Irooko oteeranire hamwe abakuru b'Abaisraeli, obagire oti: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo akanyeyoreka naagira ati: Mbareebire, naareeba n'okubarikubagira omuri Misri; <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />mbwenu nindaganisa okubaiha omu kubonabona kwa Misri, mbatware omu nsi y'Abanyakanaani, ey'Abahiiti, ey'Abaamori, ey'Abaperizi, ey'Abahiivi kandi n'ey'Abayebusi, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki. <verse eid="EXO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />Nabo baryakuhurira; bwanyima oryagyenda n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli ow'omugabe wa Misri mumugire muti: MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo atutaayaayiire; mbwenu nitukweshengyereza, orekye tugyende orugyendo rw'ebiro bishatu omu ihamba tutambiririreyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Kandi nimmanya ku omugabe wa Misri ataribaikiriza kugyenda, kureka yaagyemwa omukono gw'amaani. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Byak 7:36</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ndyabanga omukono gwangye, nteere Misri n'eby'okutangaaza byangye byona, ebi ndigikoreramu; bwanyima aryabarekura. <verse eid="EXO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:35">Kur 12:35</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:7">Enf 16:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aba bantu ndyabaha okukundwa Abanyamisri; n'ahabw'ekyo ku muriba nimurugayo, timurirugayo ngaro nsha; <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:10">Ezk 39:10</ref>. </char></note> kureka buri mukazi aryashaba mutaahi we, ashabe n'oriba acumbikire omu nju ye, ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu, n'ebijwaro, mubijwekye abaana baanyu b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki; okwo nikwo murinyaga Abanyamisri.<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okworeka Musa oku arikora eby'okutangaaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Musa yaagarukamu naagira ati: Kwonka nimmanya ngu tibariinyikiriza, n'obu kwakuba okumpurira; ahakuba baryagira bati: MUKAMA tarakweyorekire. <verse eid="EXO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Ekyo eki oine omu ngaro niki? Onu ati: N'enkoni. <verse eid="EXO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ginagye ahansi. Yaaginaga ahansi; enkoni yaahinduka enjoka; Musa yaagihunga. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Tayo omukono gwawe, ogikwate omukira, (yaatayo omukono, yaagikwata, yaagaruka yaahinduka enkoni omu ngaro ze): <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:9">Kur 19:9</ref>. </char></note> okwo nikwo orikora, bakabona kwikiriza ku MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaaka, kandi Ruhanga wa Yakobo, yaakweyorekire.<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 12:10">Kub 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Ta omukono gwawe omu kifuba. Yaagutamu; ku yaagwihiremu, yaashanga gubembire nigwera nk'orubaare. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:3">Mat 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Garura omukono gwawe omu kifuba. Yaagugaruramu; ku yaagwihiremu, yaashanga guri nk'omubiri gwe ogundi. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Ku bariba batakwikiriize, n'obu kwakuba okwikiririsibwa akamanyiso k'okubanza, baryaikiririsibwa aka kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Kandi ku bariba bataikiririsiibwe obwo bumanyiso bwombi, n'obu kwakuba okuhurira ebi orikubagambira, oryatwara aha maizi g'omu mugyera, ogashukye hansi; amaizi ago agu oritaha omu mugyera, garyahinduka eshagama ahari eryo itaka.<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arooni okutumwa kukora na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:6">Yer 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaagira MUKAMA ati: Mukama wangye, na ira ryona omwiru waawe nshangwa ntaba mugambi murungi, nangwa n'ahu waatandikira kugamba naanye, ahabw'okuba nyetwara omu kugamba, n'orurimi rwangye runaamuuka. <verse eid="EXO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: N'oha owaahangire akanwa k'omuntu? Nari n'oha ohindura omuntu ekiteta, nari ekifamatu, nari shi n'oha omureebesa, nari omuhumya? Tiinye MUKAMA? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:4">Isa 50:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo irooko ogyende, ndyaba ndi hamwe n'akanwa kaawe, nkuhabure ebi origamba. <verse eid="EXO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:3">Yon 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, ninkweshengyereza, ou orikwenda kutuma, mutume. <verse eid="EXO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />MUKAMA yaagirira Musa ekiniga kingi, yaagira ati: Arooni mwene sho Omuleevi tariho? Nimmanya we ku arikubaasa kugamba gye. Kandi reeba, hati naija kukubugana; ku araakureebe, naija kwesiimira aha mutima. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Bir 18:18</ref>. </char></note> Oryaguma omugambire, ote ebigambo omu kanwa ke; naanye ndyaba ndi hamwe n'akanwa kaawe n'ake, mbahabure ebi murikora. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:1">Kur 7:1</ref>. </char></note> Aryaba ow'okukugambirira abantu, abe akanwa kaawe, naiwe omubeere nka Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Kandi oryaguma otware enkoni egi omu ngaro, ei orikoresa obumanyiso.<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okugaruka Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Musa yaagaruka ahari Yesero ishezaara, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, reka ngyende, ngarukye ahari beene waitu abari omuri Misri, ndeebe ku baraabe bakibaho. Yesero yaagira Musa ati: Gyenda n'obusingye. <verse eid="EXO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:20">Mat 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa akiri omuri Midiani ati: Irooko ogarukye Misri, ahabw'okuba abaabaire nibenda kukwita bafiire. <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:9">Kur 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:8">Kub 20:8</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaatwara omukazi we n'abatabani, yaabata aha ndogoya, yaagaruka omu nsi ya Misri; kandi yaatwara egyo nkoni ya Ruhanga omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="EXO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:14-23">Rom 9:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:13-17">Yak 1:13-17</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Ku oraagarukye Misri, otarireka kukorera omu maisho ga Faraho eby'okutangaaza byona ebi nkuhaire kukora; kwonka ndyagangaaza omutima gwe, tarireka bantu kugyenda. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Kor 6:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oryagambira Faraho oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, naagira ati: Israeli n'omwana wangye w'omujigaijo; <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />kandi ninkugambira nti: Reka omwana wangye agyende, ampeereze; ku oraayangye kumurekura, niinyija kwita omwana waawe ow'omujigaijo.<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:14">Kut 17:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakigyenda, baahika omu icumbi, MUKAMA yaamushangamu, yaayenda kumwita. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Zipora yaakwata eibaare ry'obwogi, yaashara ekishushu ky'omubiri gw'omwana we, yaakinaga aha bigyere bya Musa, yaamugira ati: Wampindukira omugore orikujwisa eshagama. <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />MUKAMA nikwo kumureka. Zipora akagira ati: Ori omugore orikujwisa eshagama! Ahabw'okushara.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />MUKAMA yaagambira Arooni ati: Irooko oze kubugana Musa omu ihamba. Yaagyenda, yaamubugana aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga, yaamunywegyera. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Musa yaagambira Arooni ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA yaamutumire, n'obumanyiso bwona obu yaamuragiire kukora. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Musa na Arooni baagyenda, baateeranira hamwe abakuru b'Abaisraeli boona, <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Arooni yaabagambira ebigambo byona, ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa, kandi yaakorera obwo bumanyiso omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Abantu baikiriza; kandi ku baahuriire ngu MUKAMA ataayaayiire Abaisraeli, yaareeba okubonabonesibwa kwabo, bainika emitwe yaabo, baaramya.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Faraho okwongyera kubonabonesa Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Bwanyima Musa na Arooni baija ahari Faraho, baamugira bati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reka abantu bangye bagyende omu ihamba, bankorereyo obugyenyi. <verse eid="EXO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:35">2 Bag 18:35</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:15">Yob 21:15</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaabagira ati: MUKAMA niwe oha, ou nyowe nshemereire kuhurira, nkarekura Abaisraeli bakagyenda? MUKAMA ogwo tindikumumanya; kandi n'ekindi tindikwija kubarekura, bakagyenda. <verse eid="EXO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Baagira bati: Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo atutaayaayiire; mbwenu nitukweshengyereza, orekye tugyende orugyendo rw'ebiro bishatu omu ihamba, tutambirireyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebitambo, atakaatwitsa orufu nari rurara. <verse eid="EXO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Omugabe wa Misri yaabagira ati: Iwe Musa na Arooni, ahabw'enki nimwiha abantu aha mirimo yaabo? Mwirooko mugarukye aha mirimo yaanyu. <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Faraho yaagaruka yaagira ati: Reeba, abantu bakanyire omu nsi; haza imwe nimwenda kubaiha omu buhuuku bwabo. <verse eid="EXO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Eizooba eryo Faraho yaaragiira abanyampara b'abantu n'abatware baabo, naagira ati: <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />Mutagaruka kuha abantu embuba z'engano z'okukoresa amatafaari nka ira; murekye bagyende bazeesherurire. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Omubaro gw'amatafaari, ogu baabaire nibabumba n'okuhitsya hati, mube nigwo mwabagumyaho; mutagutuubyaho na kakye; ahakuba n'abeeremwa; nikyo kirikubatakisa nibagira bati: Ka tuze kutambira Ruhanga waitu ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Abashaija abo mubahe emirimo erikukiraho amaani, bagikore; barekye kuta omutima aha bigambo by'ebishuba.<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Abanyampara b'abantu n'abatware baabo nikwo kushohora, bakagambira abantu bati: Oku nikwo Faraho arikugamba naagira ati: Tindibaha mbuba z'engano; <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />mwirooko mugyende, muzeesherurire ahu muraazishangye hoona, mumanye ngu omurimo gwanyu tiguricuubwaho na kakye. <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo abantu baabugibwa omu nsi yoona eya Misri kutorotoora ebitsintsi by'engano omu mwanya gw'embuba zaazo. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Abanyampara baabeezirikisa munonga nibagira bati: Muhitsye emirimo yaanyu eya buri izooba, nk'oku mubaire nimugikora mwine embuba z'engano. <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Abanyampara b'Abaisraeli, abatairweho abanyampara ba Faraho, baaterwa, kandi baabuuzibwa bati: N'enki ekibazibiire kuhitsya omubaro gw'amatafaari, ogu mucwereirwe nyomwabazyo n'eri izooba, nk'oku mubaire nimukora?<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Bwanyima abanyampara b'Abaisraeli baija ahari Faraho kwetonganira nibagira bati: Ahabw'enki otukozire oti, itwe abairu baawe? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Tibakituha mbuba z'engano; kandi bagarukire batugira bati: Mubumbe amatafaari; haza obwo bwona itwe abairu baawe nituteerwa, kandi orubanja ruri orw'abantu baawe. <verse eid="EXO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Kwonka yaagarukamu ati: Muri abeeremwa; muri abeeremwa! Nikyo kirikubagirisa muti: Ka tugyende tutambire MUKAMA ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Mwirooko mugarukye aha mirimo yaanyu, mukore; ahakuba timurigaruka kuheebwa mbuba z'engano, kandi mugume muhitsye omubaro gw'amatafaari ogu mwacwereirwe. <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Ku baagambiirwe ngu tibaricwerwaho mubaro gw'amatafaari ogwa buri izooba na kakye, abanyampara b'Abaisraeli baamanya ku bagwereirwe akagwe. <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Ku baabaire nibaruga owa Faraho, baashanga Musa na Arooni beemereire omu muhanda; <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:4">1 Sam 13:4</ref>. </char></note> baabagira bati: MUKAMA abareebe, kandi abacwere orubanja, ahabw'okuba niimwe mureeteire Faraho n'abashaija be kutwangira kimwe, n'okukwata rurara kutwita. <verse eid="EXO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:11">Kub 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 30:6">1 Sam 30:6</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagaruka ahari MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Ai bambe MUKAMA, abantu aba abakoreire ki kubi? Okaba wantumira ki? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:31">Mat 14:31</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba kwiha naaza owa Faraho kugamba omu iziina ryawe, akozire kubi aba bantu; kandi naiwe tiwaajuna bantu baawe na kakye.<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugumya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Hati noija kureeba oku ndaagire Faraho; ahakuba, ahabw'okugyemwa omukono gw'amaani, aryabarekura, nangwa n'okubabinga ababingye omu nsi ye ahabw'ogwo mukono. <verse eid="EXO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Ruhanga yaagamba na Musa naamugira ati: Niinye Yehova. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:4">Zab 68:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nkeeyoreka Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo, ndi Ruhanga Ow'obushoboorozi bwona; kwonka tindabeemanyiise mu iziina ryangye erya Yehova. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:8">Kut 17:8</ref>. </char></note> Nkahamya endagaano yangye nabo, ku ndibaha ensi ya Kanaani, ensi ei baatwiremu nk'abashuhuuki. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Kandi mpuriire okutsinda kw'Abaisraeli, abu Abanyamisri baagizire abahuuku; naanye naijuka endagaano yangye. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:21">1 Bus 17:21</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:10">Neh 1:10</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo gambira Abaisraeli ku ndi Yehova, kandi ku ndibatuura emitwaro ei Abanyamisri baabakoreire, nkabaiha omu buhuuku bwabo, nkabacunguza omukono gubangire n'ebifubiro by'amaani. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Bwanyima ndyabeetwarira mube abantu bangye, kandi naanye mbe Ruhanga waanyu; aho niho murimanyira ku ndi Yehova Ruhanga waanyu, obatwire emitwaro ei Abanyamisri baabeekoreize; <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />kandi ndyabatwara omu nsi, ei naimukiize omukono kuha Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo; ngibahe kuba obuhunguzi bwanyu. Nyowe Yehova.<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa yaagambira Abaisraeli ebigambo ebyo; kwonka baayanga kumuhurira ahabw'obusaasi bw'omu mitima yaabo, n'ahabw'obuhuuku bubi. <verse eid="EXO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />Za owa Faraho omugabe wa Misri, omugambire arekye Abaisraeli barugye omu nsi ye. <verse eid="EXO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:6">Yer 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ati: Reeba, Abaisraeli tibampuriire; mbwenu Faraho we naabaasa ata kumpurira, nyowe ow'eminwa etashazirwe? <verse eid="EXO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni, naabatuma aha Baisraeli n'ahari Faraho omugabe wa Misri, kwiha Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baishenkuru ba Musa na Arooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Aba nibo bakuru b'emiryango ya baishenkurubo; Batabani ba Reubeeni omujigaijo gwa Israeli, ni Hanoki, Palu, Hezirooni na Karumi; egyo niyo miryango ya Reubeeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Batabani ba Simeoni ni Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Zohari, na Shauli omutabani, ow'Omunyakanaanikazi; egyo niyo miryango ya Simeoni. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Kandi aga nigo maziina ga batabani ba Leevi, nk'oku baagyenzire nibakuratana omu kuzaara; Gereshoni, Kohasi na Merari. Emyaka ei Leevi yaahikize ekaba eri igana na makumi ashatu na mushanju. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Batabani ba Gereshoni ni Libuni na Shimei, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri; <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />n'abatabani ba Kohasi ni Amuraamu, Izuhaari, Heburooni, na Uzieli; kandi emyaka ei Kohasi yaahikize ekaba eri igana na makumi ashatu n'eshatu; <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />kandi n'abatabani ba Merari ni Mahili na Muushi. Egyo niyo miryango y'Abaleevi nk'oku baagyenzire nibakuratana omu kuzaara. <verse eid="EXO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:1">Kur 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Amuraamu yaashwera Yokebedi ishenkazi, yaamuzaarira Arooni na Musa; emyaka ei Amuraamu yaahikize ekaba eri igana na makumi ashatu na mushanju. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Batabani ba Izuhaari ni Koora, Nefegi na Zikiri. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Batabani ba Uzieli ni Mishaeli, Elizafani na Zitiri. <verse eid="EXO 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Arooni yaashwera Elisheba, muhara wa Aminadabu, munyaanya wa Nahashooni; yaamuzaarira Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazaari na Itamaari. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Batabani ba Koora ni Asiri, Elukaana na Abiasaafu; egyo niyo miryango y'aba Koora. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazaari mwene Arooni yaashwera omwe ahari bahara ba Putieli; yaamuzaarira Finehaasi. Abo nibo bakuru b'emiryango ya baishenkuru b'Abaleevi nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. <verse eid="EXO 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:1">Kub 33:1</ref>. </char></note> Abo nibo ba Arooni na Musa abu MUKAMA yaagambiire kwiha Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri, nk'oku amahe gaabo gaabaire gari. <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Abo nibo baagambiire Faraho omugabe wa Misri eby'okwiha Abaisraeli omuri Misri; abo nibo Musa na Arooni bari.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Aha izooba eri MUKAMA yaagambiriireho Musa omu nsi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />akamugira ati: Niinye MUKAMA; gambira Faraho omugabe wa Misri ebigambo byona ebi ndikukugambira. <verse eid="EXO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ati: Nyowe ndi omuntu w'eminwa etashazirwe; Faraho aryabaasa ata kumpurira?<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okukorera eby'okutangaaza omu maisho ga Faraho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:10">Yer 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Reeba, naakugira nka Ruhanga ahari Faraho, na mukuru waawe Arooni naija kuba nabi waawe. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Oryagamba byona ebi ndikuragiira; na mukuru waawe Arooni abigambire Faraho, naamuragiira kureka Abaisraeli kuruga omu nsi ye. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Kwonka ndyagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, nkanyise obumanyiso bwangye n'eby'okutangaaza byangye omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Faraho taribahurira; haza nyowe mbone kuta omukono gwangye ahari Misri, nyiheyo amahe gangye, nibo bantu bangye Abaisraeli, nimbajuna Abanyamisri n'ebifubiro by'amaani. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Zab 9:16</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndibanga omukono gwangye ahari Misri, naiha Abaisraeli omuribo, obwo nibwo Abanyamisri barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa na Arooni baakora batyo; nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaragiire, baaba nikwo baakora. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:2">Bir 31:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:23">Byak 7:23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Obwo Musa akaba ahikize emyaka makumi munaana, kandi mukuru we Arooni akaba aine emyaka makumi munaana n'eshatu, obu baagamba na Faraho. <verse eid="EXO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:18">Yoh 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Faraho ku araabagire ati: Mukore eky'okutangaaza ky'okubahamya, obwo ogire Arooni oti: Twara enkoni yaawe, oginagye ahansi omu maisho ga Faraho, ehindukye enjoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Batyo Musa na Arooni baataaha owa Faraho, baakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaragiira; Arooni yaanaga enkoni ye ahansi omu maisho ga Faraho n'abaheereza be, yaahinduka enjoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:22">Kur 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 8:7">8:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 8:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:13">2 Kor 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:14">Kush 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Faraho nawe yaayeta abanyabwengye n'abarogi, kandi n'abafumu ba Misri, baakora batyo n'oburogo bwabo; <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />ahakuba nabo bakanaga ahansi, buri muntu enkoni ye zaahinduka enjoka; kwonka enkoni ya Arooni yaamira ezaabo. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaabahurira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso ky'okubanza.</para>
  <para style="s1">Amaizi okuhinduka eshagama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 8:15">Kur 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 10:20">10:20</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 10:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Omutima gwa Faraho gugangaire, ayangire kurekura abantu. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Omu kasheeshe oze owa Faraho; naija kuba naaza aha mugyera; iwe oyemerere aha nkungu y'omugyera, akushangyeho; kandi n'enkoni eyaahindukire enjoka ogigyendane; <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />omugire oti: MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo akuntumireho, naagira ati: Reka abantu bangye bagyende, bampeerereze omu ihamba; kandi n'okuhitsya hati oyangire kuhurira. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:17">Ezk 25:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:4">Kush 16:4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, naagira ati: Aha niho oraamanyire ku ndi MUKAMA; niinyija kuteera amaizi g'omu mugyera n'enkoni ei nyine omu ngaro, gahindukye eshagama; <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />eby'enyanja by'omu mugyera bife, omugyera gunuukye ekijunde; Abanyamisri banugye amaizi g'omuri ogwo mugyera, bangye kuganywa.<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: “Gambira Arooni oti, banga enkoni yaawe, obangye omukono gwawe ahaiguru y'amaizi g'omuri Misri, emigyera yaabo n'otugyera twabo n'ebiyanja byabo n'ahu amaizi gateeraniire hoona, gahindukye eshagama; kandi omu nsi ya Misri yoona omu bintu byabo eby'ebiti n'eby'amabaare nihaija kubamu eshagama.” <verse eid="EXO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:5">Kur 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:44">Zab 78:44</ref>. </char></note> Musa na Arooni baakora nk'oku MUKAMA abaragiire; yaimutsya egyo nkoni, yaateera amaizi g'omu mugyera omu maisho ga Faraho n'abaheereza be; amaizi goona ag'omu mugyera gaahinduka eshagama. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Eby'enyanja ebyabaire biri omu mugyera byafa; omugyera gwanuuka ekijunde, Abanyamisri tibaabaasa kunywa maizi gaagwo; haabaho eshagama omu nsi ya Misri yoona. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Abafumu ba Misri baakora batyo n'oburogo bwabo; omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaabahurira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Faraho yaarugayo, yaagaruka omuka, n'ekyo tiyaakyetaho. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Abanyamisri boona baatimba haihi n'omugyera, ngu batungye amaizi g'okunywa; ahakuba tibarabaasize kunywa ha maizi g'omuri ogwo mugyera. <verse eid="EXO 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Haahinguraho ebiro mushanju, MUKAMA aherize kuteera ogwo mugyera.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya kabiri, ensi okwijura ebikyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Za owa Faraho, omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reka abantu bangye bagyende, bampeereze. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:13">Kush 16:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku oraayangye kubarekura, reeba niinyija kuteeza ensi yaawe yoona ebikyere; <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />omugyera nigwija kwijura ebikyere, biinamukye, bitaahe omu ka yaawe, bize omu kishengye eki oraaramu, bihikye n'aha kitabo kyawe, n'omu nju z'abaheereza baawe n'abantu baawe, bihikye n'omu mateekyero gaawe n'omu bintu byawe eby'okugoyeramu emigaati; <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />kandi ebikyere bikutembe, bitembe abantu baawe n'abaheereza baawe boona. <verse eid="EXO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Gambira Arooni oti: Banga omukono gwawe ogukwaitse enkoni aha migyera n'otugyera n'ebiyanja, ebikyere biinamukye, bibugye ensi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:30">Zab 105:30</ref>. </char></note> Arooni yaabanga omukono gwe aha maizi ga Misri; ebikyere byainamuka, byashweka ensi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Abafumu nabo baakora batyo n'oburogo bwabo, bainamura ebikyere aha nsi omuri Misri.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 13:6">1 Bag 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:24">Byak 8:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Faraho yaatuma kweta Musa na Arooni; ku baizire, yaabagira ati: Mweshengyereze MUKAMA anyiheho ebikyere, abiihe n'aha bantu bangye; naanye naaza kureka abantu be, bagyende bamutambire ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa yaagira Faraho ati: Obe niiwe waanyegambirira obunaku obu ndaayeshengyererezemu MUKAMA iwe n'abaheereza baawe n'abantu baawe, ebikyere bikacwekyerezibwa bikakurugaho, bikahwa n'omu maju gaawe, bikatsigara omu mugyera gwonka. <verse eid="EXO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:6">Yer 10:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 10:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaamugarukamu ati: Nyencakare. Nawe ati: Kibe nk'oku waagamba, obone kumanya ku hatariho orikushushana na MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Ebikyere nibiija kukurugaho, birugye n'omu maju gaawe, n'aha baheereza baawe n'aha bantu baawe, bitsigare omu mugyera gwonka. <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11">Kur 32:11</ref>. </char></note> Musa na Arooni baaruga owa Faraho; Musa yaatakira MUKAMA ahabw'ebikyere, nk'oku aikirizaine na Faraho. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />MUKAMA yaakora nk'oku Musa agambire; ebikyere byafeera omu maju n'omu bibuga n'omu misiri, byahwaho. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Baabirunda emituumo n'emituumo; ensi yaanuuka ekijunde. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:11">Mub 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Faraho ku yaareebire byabaho gye, yaagangaaza omutima gwe, tiyaabahurira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya kashatu, okuteerwa enda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Gambira Arooni oti: Banga enkoni yaawe, oteere omucuucu gw'ahansi, guhindukye enda omu nsi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Baakora batyo; Arooni yaabanga omukono gwe ogukwaitse enkoni ye, yaateera omucuucu gw'ahansi; enda zaanyiga aha bantu n'aha matungo; omucuucu gwona ogw'omu nsi ya Misri gwahinduka enda. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kur 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:8">2 Tim 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 3:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Abafumu nabo baateeraho kureeta enda n'oburogo bwabo, tibaabaasa; enda zaanyiga aha bantu n'aha matungo. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:3">1 Sam 6:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:20">Luk 11:20</ref>. </char></note> Abo bafumu baagira Faraho bati: Mbwenu ho oru n'orukumu rwa Ruhanga. Omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaabahurira nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya kana, okuteerwa eshohera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Ogurukye kare omu kasheeshe, oyemerere omu maisho ga Faraho, naija kuba naaza aha mugyera, omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reka abantu bangye bagyende, bampeereze. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Ku oraabe otabarekwire, niinyija kukuteeza emizinga y'eshohera, iwe n'abaheereza baawe n'abantu baawe, zitaahe n'omu maju gaawe; kandi n'amaju g'Abanyamisri nigaija kwijura n'emizinga y'eshohera, zishwekye n'omwanya ogubarimu. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:4">Kur 9:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 9:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 9:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba eryo niinyija kutsiga ekyanga kya Gosheni, eki abantu bangye batwiremu, emizinga y'eshohera erekye kuhikayo, obone kumanya ku ndi MUKAMA ori ahagati y'ensi. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Niinyija kuta omutaano ahagati y'abantu bangye n'abantu baawe; nyencakare ako kamanyiso nikaija kubaho. <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />MUKAMA yaakora atyo; emizinga mingi y'eshohera yaataaha omu nju ya Faraho n'omu maju g'abaheereza be n'omu nsi yoona eya Misri; ensi yaasiisikara ahabw'egyo mizinga y'eshohera.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Faraho yaatuma ahari Musa na Arooni, yaagira ati: Mugyende mutambire Ruhanga waanyu ebitambo omu nsi egi. <verse eid="EXO 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Musa yaagira ati: Tikihikire kukora tutyo; ahakuba nitwija kutambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebitambo ebirikuzira aha Banyamisri. Mbwenu ku turaatambire ebitambo omu maisho g'Abanyamisri ebi barikuzira, tibarikwija kututeera amabaare? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Kureka tushemereire kugyenda orugyendo rw'ebiro bishatu omu ihamba, tutambire MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebitambo, nk'oku arikuturagiira. <verse eid="EXO 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:11">Kur 10:11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 10:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:6">1 Bag 13:6</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaagira ati: Niinyija kubareka mugyende, mutambire MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebitambo omu ihamba; kwonka mutaza hare munonga; kandi munyeshengyerereze MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa yaagira ati: Reeba naaza kuruga omu maisho gaawe, nze kweshengyereza MUKAMA, emizinga y'eshohera erugye ahari Faraho n'abaheereza be n'aha bantu be nyencakare; kwonka Faraho atagaruka kugobya obundi, okutareka bantu kuza kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Musa yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho, yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />MUKAMA yaakora nk'oku Musa yaagamba, yaiha emizinga y'eshohera ahari Faraho n'aha baheereza be n'aha bantu be; tihaatsigaraho shohera n'emwe. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:17-23">Rom 9:17-23</ref>. </char></note> N'obwo nabwo Faraho yaagangaaza omutima gwe, tiyaareka bantu kugyenda.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya kataano; okujumikirwa omubyamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Za owa Faraho, omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo arikugamba naagira ati: Reka abangu bangye bagyende, bampeereze. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:5">Rom 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku oraayangye kubarekura, waabagumya, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:3">1 Sam 6:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 6:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:11">Byak 13:11</ref>. </char></note> reeba omukono gwa MUKAMA gwaza kureeta omubyamo mubi ogw'amaani aha matungo gaawe ag'omu mariisizo, aha mbaraasi n'endogoya n'engamira n'aha masyo g'ente n'ag'entaama. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />MUKAMA naija kworeka omutaano ahagati y'amatungo g'Abaisraeli n'ag'Abanyamisri; aha matungo g'Abaisraeli goona tiharifaho na rimwe. <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />MUKAMA yaataho obunaku, naagira ati: Nyencakare MUKAMA naija kukora ekyo omu nsi. <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Ku bwaseesire, MUKAMA yaakikora; amatungo g'Abanyamisri goona gaafa; kwonka aha matungo g'Abaisraeli tihaafaho na rimwe. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Faraho yaatuma kubuuza, baashanga aha matungo g'Abaisraeli hatafiireho na rimwe. Kwonka omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaareka bantu kugyenda.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya mukaaga, abantu okurwara ebizimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: Mutware amagaro g'eiju rya kashenda ery'omu tanuuru, Musa arimiishe ahaiguru omu maisho ga Faraho; <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:2">Kush 16:2</ref>. </char></note> niriija kuhinduka omucuucu, gubugye ensi yoona eya Misri, gurwaze abantu n'enyamaishwa ebizimba birugyemu ebironda omu nsi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:27">Bir 28:27</ref>. </char></note> Baatwara eiju ry'omu tanuuru, baayemerera omu maisho ga Faraho; Musa yaarimiisha ahaiguru, ryarwaza abantu n'enyamaishwa ebizimba ebirikurugamu ebironda. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Abafumu bari tibaabaasa kwemerera omu maisho ga Musa ahabw'ebizimba; ahakuba ebyo bizimba bikarwaza abo bafumu n'Abanyamisri boona. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:30">Bir 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:17">Isa 63:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA yaagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, tiyaabahurira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya mushanju, ensi okuteerwa orubaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Ogurukye kare omu kasheeshe, oyemerere omu maisho ga Faraho, omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo arikugamba naagira ati: Reka abantu bangye bagyende bampeereze; <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:22">2 Sam 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:5-25">Isa 45:5-25</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba aha murundi ogu niinyija kukureetera ebibonaboneso byangye byona, bihikye aha mutima gwawe n'aha baheereza baawe n'aha bantu baawe, obone kumanya ku hatariho orikushushana naanye omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Ahabw'okuba hati nkaabangire omukono gwangye, nkuteeza orufu n'abantu baawe, ohwerekyerera, oruga omu nsi; <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:4">Enf 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:17">Rom 9:17</ref>. </char></note> kwonka buzima, eki nkurekyeireho n'okukworeka amaani gangye, ngu eiziina ryangye ribone kugambwa omu nsi zoona. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Mbwenu na hati nookyehimbisiza aha bantu bangye, oyangire kubarekura. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Reeba, nyencakare nk'aga magingo niinyija kugwisa orubaare rwingi munonga, orutakagwaga muri Misri okwiha obu ensi egyo yaabaho n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo otume bataasye amatungo gaawe n'ebi oine omu ishwa byona; ahakuba omuntu weena n'eitungo ryona ekiraashangwe omu ishwa, kitakataahire, nikiija kuteerwa orubaare, kife. <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Bwanyima weena owaatiinire ekigambo kya MUKAMA aha baheereza ba Faraho, yaahungiza abairu be n'amatungo ge omu maju; <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />kwonka otareetaire ha kigambo kya MUKAMA, yaareka abairu be n'amatungo ge omu ishwa.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 16:21">Kush 16:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Imutsya omukono gwawe, ogworekye ahaiguru, orubaare rugwe omu nsi ya Misri yoona, aha bantu n'amatungo n'aha bimezire byona omu nsi ya Misri yoona. <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38:22</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaimutsya enkoni ye, agyorekire ahaiguru; MUKAMA yaahindisa eiguru, yaagwisa orubaare, omuriro gwashuuma ahansi; MUKAMA yaagwisa atyo orubaare omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Haagwa orubaare, n'omuriro gwaguma nigutyankana ahagati yaarwo, orubaare rwingi munonga, orutakagwaga mu nsi ya Misri yoona okwiha obu yaaba eihanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Orwo rubaare rwaita byona ebyabaire biri omu ishwa, abantu n'amatungo, omu nsi ya Misri yoona; kandi rwateera ebimezire byona, rwahendagura n'emiti yoona, eby'omu ishwa; <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:18">Isa 32:18</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 32:19">19</ref>. </char></note> kureka omu kyaro kya Gosheni kyonka, eki Abaisraeli baabaire batwiremu, nimwo orubaare rutarahikire.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:6">2 Bus 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Faraho yaatuma kweta Musa na Arooni; ku baizire, yaabagira ati: Aha murundi ogu nsiisire; MUKAMA niwe ahikiriire, nyowe n'abantu bangye turi babi. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:24">Byak 8:24</ref>. </char></note> Mweshengyereze MUKAMA, ahakuba okuhinda oku okw'amaani n'orubaare nibimara; naaza kubareka mugyende, timukiguma aha. <verse eid="EXO 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Zab 24:1</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaamugira ati: Ku ndaarugye omu rurembo, ahonaaho niinyija kutega MUKAMA emikono, okuhinda nikwija kuhwaho, kandi n'orubaare tirurigaruka kubaho, obone kumanya ku ensi eri eya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:10">Isa 26:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka iwe n'abaheereza baawe, nimmanya ku murikwija kuba mutakitiina MUKAMA Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />(Ahabw'orubaare orwo furakisi na sayiri bikafa, ahabw'okuba sayiri ekaba eri obushiisha, kandi furakisi ekaba neerabya. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Kwonka engano na kusemeti tibirateirwe, ahakuba bikaba bitakamezire.) <verse eid="EXO 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Musa yaaruga ahari Faraho omu rurembo, yaatega MUKAMA emikono; okuhinda n'orubaare byahwaho, n'enjura tiyaagaruka kugwa. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Faraho ku yaareebire enjura n'orubaare n'okuhinda byahwaho, yaayeyongyera kushiisha, yaagangaaza omutima gwe, we n'abaheereza be. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaareka Baisraeli kugyenda, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa kugamba.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya munaana, okuteerwa enzigye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoh 12:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Za owa Faraho; ahakuba ngangaize omutima gwe n'emitima y'abaheereza be, ngu mbone kworeka obumanyiso bwangye obu ahagati yaabo, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 71:18">Zab 71:18</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:3">Yoel 1:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu naiwe obone kubiteekyerereza omwana waawe na mwijukuru waawe, bahurire ebi naakozire omuri Misri, n'obumanyiso obu naakoreire omuribo; mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:27">2 Bus 34:27</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:6">1 Pet 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Musa na Arooni baaza owa Faraho, baamugira bati: oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga w'Abaheburaayo arikugamba naagira ati: Oryahitsya hi okwanga kwecureeza omu maisho gangye? Reka abantu bangye bagyende, bampeereze. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:3">Kush 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Ku oraayangye kubarekura, reeba, nyencakare niinyija kureeta enzigye omu nsi yaawe, <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:25">Yoel 2:25</ref>. </char></note> zishwekye ensi, omuntu abure ah'okureeba, zirye ebyatsigaireho, bitaitsirwe rubaare, zirye n'emiti yaanyu yoona erikumera omu misiri; <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />kandi ziijure amaju gaawe n'amaju g'abaheereza baawe boona n'ag'Abanyamisri boona, ezi baasho na baashwenkuru baabaire batakareebaga, okwiha obu baabaho n'okuhitsya hati. Yaakuba, yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Abaheereza ba Faraho baamubuuza bati: Omushaija ogu aryahitsya hi okutubeera omutego? Reka abantu bagyende, baheereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. Tokamanyire ku Misri ecwekyereire? <verse eid="EXO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Baagarura Musa na Arooni omu maisho ga Faraho; Faraho yaabagira ati: Mwirooko, muheereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; beitu shi ni bantu ki abaraagyende? <verse eid="EXO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:21">Ezr 8:21</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagira ati: Turyagyenda n'abaana baitu abakuru, tugyende n'abatabani baitu na bahara baitu hamwe n'amasyo gaitu ag'entaama n'ag'ente; ahakuba tushemereire kukorera MUKAMA obugyenyi n'okumutambira ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Onu yaabagira ati: MUKAMA akinture, ku ndaabe naabaikiriize kugyenda n'abaana baanyu abato; kwonka mumanye ku enaama yaanyu eri mbi. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Ngaaha! Naayanga; abashaija mube niimwe mwagyenda, mukaheereza MUKAMA, ahakuba nikyo murikwenda. Baabingwa omu maisho ga Faraho.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Banga omukono gwawe aha nsi ya Misri, enzigye ziije, zigiteere, zirye ekimeziremu kyona, ekitaraitsirwe rubaare. <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Musa yaabanga enkoni aha nsi ya Misri, MUKAMA yaareeta omuyaga ogurikuruga oburugwa-izooba, gwahuuha ensi eryo izooba ryona n'ekyo kiro kyona; ku bwaseesire, omuyaga ogwo gwareeta enzigye. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Enzigye zaabuga ensi yoona eya Misri, zaagwa omu byanga byayo byona; zikaba ziri enzigye nyingi munonga ez'eihano, ezitakabahoga okwiha ira, kandi ezitaribaho bundi. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:35">Zab 105:35</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba zikashweka ensi yoona, ensi yaagira omwirima; zaarya ebimezire byona n'ebijuma byona eby'emiti yoona etaraitsirwe rubaare; omu nsi ya Misri yoona tihaatsigaramu kintu kyona ekibisi, yaaba kiti nari obunyaatsi eby'omu ishwa. <verse eid="EXO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Ahonaaho Faraho yaatuma Musa na Arooni; yaabagira ati: Ncumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'ahariimwe. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:6">1 Bag 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:31">Yob 34:31</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nimbeeshengyereza munsaasire ekicumuro kyangye omurundi ogu gwonka, muunyeshengyerereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, afe okunyihaho orufu oru rwonka. <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Musa yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho, yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />MUKAMA yaareeta omuyaga mwingi gw'amaani, ogurikuruga oburengyerwa-izooba, gwatuntumura ezo nzigye, gwazinaga omu Nyanja erikutukura; tihaatsigara ruzigye na rumwe omu byanga byona ebya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:20">Yos 11:20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA yagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, tiyaareka Baisraeli kugyenda.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya mwenda, ensi okushwekwa omwirima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Imutsya omukono gwawe, ogworekye eiguru, ensi ya Misri eshwekwe omwirima, omwirima ogubambire ndindindi. <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Musa yaimutsya omukono gwe, yaagworeka omu iguru, haabaho omwirima ndindindi omu nsi yoona eya Misri okumara ebiro bishatu; <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />baamara ebiro bishatu batarikureebana, n'obu yaakuba omuntu okuruga ah'ari; kwonka omu maka g'Abaisraeli boona baaguma nibahweza. <verse eid="EXO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:10">Kur 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaatuma Musa, yaamugira ati: Mwirooko muze kuheereza MUKAMA; kandi n'abaana baanyu abato mugyende nabo; kwonka amasyo gaanyu ag'entaama n'ag'ente go gatsigare. <verse eid="EXO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Musa yaagira ati: Oshemereire kutuha eby'okutamba n'eby'okuhonga by'okwotsya, tubone kutambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebitambo. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />N'amatungo gaitu nago nitwija kugatwara; nangwa n'ekyara tikiritsigara; ahabw'okuba nigo turiba tushemereire kwihamu eby'okuheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; kandi titurikumanya bi turikoresa omu kuheereza MUKAMA, okuhitsya obu turihikayo. <verse eid="EXO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Kwonka MUKAMA yaagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, tiyaabareka kugyenda. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Faraho yaagambira Musa ati: Ruga aha, oyerinde, otaringaruka omu maisho; ahakuba eizooba eri oringaruka omu maisho; oryafa. <verse eid="EXO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:27">Heb 11:27</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagira ati: Eki waagamba nikwo; tindikugaruka mu maisho obundi.<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okugamba eby'okufa kw'emijigaijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Hatsigaire ekibonaboneso kimwe eki ndaabonabonesese Faraho na Misri yoona; bwanyima aryabareka mugyende; okumanya ku aribareka, n'okubabinga aryababingira kimwe. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:35">Kur 12:35</ref>. </char></note> Gambira abantu, buri mushaija ashabe mutaahi we, na buri mukazi ashabe mutaahi we, bashabe ebintu by'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:21">Kur 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:4">Est 9:4</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaha abantu okukundwa Abanyamisri. Kandi na Musa yaaba omushaija orikutiinwa munonga omu nsi ya Misri, omu baheereza ba Faraho, n'omu bantu boona.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Musa yaagira Faraho ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, naagira ati: Nyekiro nk'omu itumbi niinyija kuraba omuri Misri; <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />emijigaijo yoona ey'omu nsi ya Misri efe, okwiha aha mujigaijo gwa Faraho ori aha ngoma okuhitsya aha mujigaijo gw'omuzaana orikusa aha rubengo, n'emijigaijo yoona ey'amatungo.<verse eid="EXO 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:17">Amo 5:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi haryabaho okucura kwingi omu nsi ya Misri yoona, okutakabahoga, kandi okutarigaruka kubaho. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:23">Yob 5:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu Baisraeli embwa terikankamira muntu weena, n'obu ryakuba rimwe aha matungo gaabo, mubone kumanya ku MUKAMA arikworeka omutaano ahagati y'Abanyamisri n'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Kandi abaheereza baawe aba boona nibaija kushuuma, baije, banyinamire, nibagira bati: Irooko, n'abantu boona abarikukukuratira, bwanyima ngyende. Yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho, aine ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="EXO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Faraho tarikwija kubahurira, eby'okutangaaza byangye bibone kukanya omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Musa na Arooni baakora eby'okutangaaza ebyo byona omu maisho ga Faraho; MUKAMA yaagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, tiyaareka Abaisraeli kuruga omu nsi ye.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuragiira eby'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni omu nsi ya Misri, ati: <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:1">Bir 16:1</ref>. </char></note> Okwezi oku kuryababeera obutandikiro bw'ameezi; ahariimwe kuryaba okwezi kw'okubanza omu mwaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Mugambire omutwe gwona ogw'Abaisraeli muti: Aha kiro kya ikumi eky'okwezi oku omuntu weena aryayetwarira omwana gw'entaama, nk'emiryango ya baishebo oku eri, buri ka omwana gw'entaama gumwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Kandi eka ku eriba eri nkye, etarikubaasa kumaraho omwana gw'entaama gwona, nyineeka agukwatanise na mutaahi we ohereraine nawe, nk'obwingi bw'abantu oku buri; mubariirire omwana gw'entaama nk'okurya kwa buri muntu oku kuri. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:19">1 Pet 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Omwana gw'entaama gwanyu ogwo guryaba empaya ehikize omwaka, etaine kamogo; muryagwiha omu ntaama nari omu mbuzi; <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />muryagurinda okuhitsya ha kiro kya ikumi na bina eky'oku kwezi; aha kiro ekyo eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli baryagwita omu mwabazyo beeteeraine. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Baryatwara aha shagama, bagimiisiire aha biti by'omuryango byombi n'aha kisasi ky'enju, ei bariguriiramu. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:11">Kub 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ekyo kiro baryarya enyama yaagwo eyokize hamwe n'omugaati ogutatumbisiibwe; kandi bagirye n'emboga ezirikushaarira. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Mutarigirya mbisi, nari eteekire, kureka mugirye eyokize hamwe n'omutwe n'amaguru n'eby'omunda. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:18">Kur 23:18</ref>. </char></note> Mutarigira eki mwatsigaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe; ekiriba kyatsigaireho kyona, mukyokyeze kimwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Oku nikwo murigirya; muryagirya mwezirikire, mujwaire enkaito, n'enkoni zaanyu muziine omu ngaro; muryagirya n'obwira. Okwo nikwo Kuhinguraho kwa MUKAMA; <verse eid="EXO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:4">Kub 33:4</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ekyo kiro ndyaraba omu nsi ya Misri, nyite emijigaijo yoona ey'omuri egyo nsi, ey'abantu n'ey'amatungo; na baaruhanga boona aba Misri mpikiirize orubanja oru mbacwereire; Nyowe MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:28">Heb 11:28</ref>. </char></note> Egyo shagama eryaba akamanyiso ahariimwe, akatairwe aha maju agu murimu; naanye ku ndireeba egyo shagama, ndyabahinguraho: ku nditeera ensi ya Misri, imwe timurihikwaho rufu rwona kubacwekyereza.<verse eid="EXO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:21">2 Bag 23:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eryo izooba riryaba ery'okubaijutsya; muryaguma muriijukye, ribe obugyenyi ahari MUKAMA; omu busingye bwanyu bwona muryarigira eizooba ry'obugyenyi, gube omugyenzo ogubateereirweho ebiro byona. <verse eid="EXO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:3">Bir 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 5:7">1 Kor 5:7</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 5:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Muryamara ebiro mushanju nimurya emigaati etatumbisiibwe; kwonka aha kiro ky'okubanza mubanze mwihe ekitumbisa omu maka gaanyu; ahakuba omuntu weena orirya omugaati ogutumbisiibwe, okwiha aha kiro ky'okubanza okuhitsya aha kiro kya mushanju, omuntu ogwo aryacuubwa omu ihanga rya Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Ahari ekyo kiro ky'okubanza muryagira okuteerana okurikwera, n'aha kya mushanju muryatwaza mutyo. Omuri ebyo biro hatarigira omurimo gwona ogwakorwa; kureka eby'okurya ebi omuntu ashemereire kurya, nibyo murikora byonka. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:3">Kur 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryaguma mwijukye obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe; ahabw'okuba ahari ekyo kiro nikyo ndikwija kwihiraho amahe gaanyu omu nsi ya Misri; n'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma mwijukye ekyo kiro omu busingye bwanyu bwona, gube omugyenzo ogubateereirweho ebiro byona. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kya ikumi na bina omu mwabazyo, muryarya emigaati etatumbisiibwe, okuhitsya aha kiro kya makumi abiri na kimwe eky'okwo kwezi omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:13">Kub 9:13</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro mushanju ekitumbisa kyona kitarireebwa omu maka gaanyu; ahakuba omuntu weena orirya ekitumbisiibwe aryacuubwa omu ihanga rya Israeli, n'obu ariba ari omunyaihanga obashuhuukiiremu, nari enzaarwa. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Mutarirya ekitumbisiibwe kyona; omu maka gaanyu goona mugume murye emigaati etatumbisiibwe.<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okuragiira Abaisraeli eby'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 5:10">Yos 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7">Luk 22:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Musa yaatuma abakuru boona ab'Abaisraeli, yaabagira ati: Mwetooranire abaana b'entaama, nk'emiryango yaanyu oku eri, mubaite ahabw'obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho; <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />mutware enganda y'enyaweera, mugijabikye omu shagama eri omu rwabya, mugimiisiire aha kisasi n'aha biti by'omuryango; kandi hatarigira n'omwe omuriimwe owaaruga omu nju ye okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3">Kush 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:28">Heb 11:28</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba MUKAMA aryaraba omuriimwe naija kuteera Abanyamisri; ku arireeba eshagama aha kisasi n'aha biti by'emiryango byombi, aryaraba ahaiguru y'orwo rwigi, kandi tariikiriza Muhwerekyerezi kutaaha omu maju gaanyu kubaita. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Kandi muryaguma mwijukye eki, gube omugyenzo ogubateereirweho n'abaana baanyu ebiro byona. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Kandi ku muriba mwahikire omu nsi ei MUKAMA aribaha nk'oku yaaraganiise, muryakora omugyenzo ogu ogurikwera. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:6">Yos 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:6">Zab 78:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abaana baanyu ku baribabuuza bati: Ogu mugyenzo, ogu murikukora, nigumanyisa ki? <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Naimwe muryabagarukamu muti: N'ekitambo ky'Okuhinguraho kwa MUKAMA, ahakuba akahingura ahaiguru y'amaju g'Abaisraeli omuri Misri, obu yaita Abanyamisri, akakiza amaka gaitu. Abantu bainika emitwe yaabo, baaramya. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Abaisraeli baagyenda, baakora batyo; nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa na Arooni, baaba nikwo baatwaza.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibonaboneso kya ikumi, okwita emijigaijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 8:17">Kub 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:36">Isa 37:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwabaire buri omu itumbi, MUKAMA yaita emijigaijo yoona omu nsi ya Misri, okwiha aha mujigaijo gwa Faraho, owaabaire ari aha ngoma okuhika aha mujigaijo gw'enkwatwa, eyaabaire eri omu kihome, kandi n'emijigaijo yoona ey'amatungo. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:13">Yak 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Faraho n'abaheereza be boona n'Abanyamisri boona baimuka nyekiro; haabaho okuborooga kuhango omuri Misri, ahabw'okuba tiharabaireho nju yoona etarafiiremu muntu. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Yaatuma Musa na Arooni ekyo kiro, yaabagira ati: Mwimukye, murugye omu bantu bangye, imwe n'Abaisraeli; mugyende muheereze MUKAMA nk'oku mwagambire. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Kandi mutware amasyo gaanyu ag'entaama n'ag'ente, nk'oku mwagambire, mwegyendere; naanye munshabire omugisha.<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 105:38">Zab 105:38</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:3">Kut 20:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamisri baateera Abaisraeli obwira, ngu babone kubarahutsya kuruga omu nsi; ahakuba bakagira bati: Twena twafiire! <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Abaisraeli baatwara eisyanga ryabo ritakatumbisiibwe, baakoma ebintu byabo eby'okugoyeramu emigaati omu minagiro yaabo, baabyekorera aha mabega. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Baakora nk'oku Musa abaragiire; baashaba Abanyamisri ebintu by'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu n'eby'okujwara. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:14">Kut 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:22">Kur 3:22</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaha abantu okukundwa Abanyamisri, baikiriza kubaha ebi baabaire nibabashaba byona. Okwo nikwo baanyagire Abanyamisri.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okutandika orugyendo rwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Abaisraeli baaruga Rameseesi, baahika Sukoosi, abashaija nk'obusiriira mukaaga nibagyendesa ebigyere, otabariiremu bakazi n'abaana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Kandi omutwe muhango gw'ebijwangye by'abantu bainamuka, baagyenda nabo n'amatungo maingi munonga g'entaama n'ag'ente. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:1">Kur 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Baateeka emigaati etatumbisiibwe omu isyanga eri baihire Misri, ahakuba rikaba ritatumbisiibwe; ahabw'okuba bakabingwa omuri Misri, tibaabaasa kwetwara n'obu kwakuba okwekomera entanda.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:13">Kut 15:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emyaka ei Abaisraeli baamazire omuri Misri bashuhuukire, ekaba eri magana ana na makumi ashatu. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Aha kiro eki egyo myaka magana ana na makumi ashatu yaahikiireho, ahari ekyo kiro kyonka amahe goona aga MUKAMA gakaruga omuri Misri. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Ekyo kiro nikyo MUKAMA yaaraire naareeba abantu be, ngu abone kubaiha omu nsi ya Misri; n'ahabw'ekyo ekiro ekyo kishemereire kwijukwa Abaisraeli boona ahari MUKAMA omu busingye bwabo bwona.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebindi ebiragiro by'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 9:14">Kub 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa na Arooni ati: Ogu nigwo mugyenzo ogutairweho ahabw'Okuhingurwaho. Omunyaihanga tariikirizibwa kukuryaho; <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />kwonka omuhuuku weena oguzirwe empiiha naikirizibwa kukuryaho, mwaherize kumushara. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:10">Lev 22:10</ref>. </char></note> Omushuhuuki n'orikukorera ebihembo tarikwikirizibwa kukuryaho. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:20">Zab 34:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:33">Yoh 19:33</ref>. </char></note> Kuryaguma kuriirwe omu nju emwe; otarishohoza akanyama koona aheeru y'enju; kandi mutarihenda eigufa ryayo. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli riryaguma rikwijukye. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Omunyaihanga ku ariija kutuura naimwe, yaayenda kukwatanisa naimwe omu bugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho ahari MUKAMA, oyetwa omushaija weena omuribo asharwe, abone kwija kubutaaha; obwo aryaba nk'enzaarwa omu nsi yaanyu; kwonka omuntu weena otashazirwe atariburyaho. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref>. </char></note> Enzaarwa n'omunyaihanga obatwiremu baryategyekwa ekiragiro kimwe.<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli boona baakozire; nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa na Arooni, nikwo baatwarize. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Byak 7:36</ref>. </char></note> Ahari ekyo kiro kyonka MUKAMA akaiha Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri, nk'oku amahe gaabo gaabaire gari.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragiira Abaisraeli kumwereza emijigaijo yoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:16">Kub 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:15">18:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:23">Luk 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Munyereze emijigaijo yoona; ekiigura-nda kyona omu Baisareli, yaaba mu bantu nari omu matungo, n'ekyangye. <verse eid="EXO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa yaagambira abantu ati: Muryaguma mwijukye eizooba eri, eri mwarugiireho Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku; ahakuba MUKAMA akabaiha omu mwanya ogwo n'omukono gw'amaani; hatarigira omugaati gwona ogutumbisiibwe ogwariibwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:15">Kur 23:15</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba eri ery'omu kwezi Abibu niryo mwaza kurugiramu. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Kandi MUKAMA ku arikuhitsya omu nsi y'Abanyakanaani, n'Abahiiti n'Abaamori n'Abahiivi n'ey'Abayebusi, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki, ei yaagambiire baashwenkuru naarahira kugikuha, oryaguma oijukye kukora omugyenzo ogu omu kwezi oku. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Oryamara ebiro mushanju noorya emigaati etatumbisiibwe; kandi aha kiro kya mushanju haryabaho obugyenyi bw'ekiro kikuru kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Omuri ebyo biro mushanju muryaguma nimurya emigaati etatumbisiibwe; mutarireebwa mwine omugaati gwona ogutumbisiibwe, n'obu kyakuba ekitumbisa kyona, omu nsi yaanyu yoona. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Kandi ahari eryo izooba oryagambira omwana waawe oti: Eki ninkikora ahabw'eki MUKAMA yankoreire, obu naaruga omuri Misri. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:8">Bir 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat 23:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi kiryakubeera akamanyiso aha mukono gwawe, n'ekiijutsyo ahagati y'amaisho gaawe, ekiragiro kya MUKAMA kirekye kukuruga omu kanwa; ahakuba MUKAMA akakwiha omuri Misri n'omukono gw'amaani. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo oryaguma oijukye omugyenzo ogu omu bunaku bwagwo buri mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Kandi MUKAMA ku arikuhitsya omu nsi ya Kanaani, yaagikuha, nk'oku yaaraganiise na baashwenkuru naarahira, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />oryashoroorera MUKAMA ekiigura-nda kyona. Emijigaijo yoona ey'omu matungo gaawe, ekyetwa ekishaija kyona, kiryaba ekya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Omujigaijo gwona ogw'endogoya oryagucunguza omwana gw'entaama; ku oriba otarikwenda kugucungura, oryaguhenda ebitsya; kandi emijigaijo yoona ey'abantu omu baana baawe oryagicungura.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 4:6">Yos 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 4:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omwana waawe ku arikubuuza omu biro ebiriija naagira ati: Eki nikimanyisa ki? Oryamugarukamu oti: MUKAMA akatwiha omuri Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku, n'omukono gw'amaani; <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />ahakuba Faraho akaba agangaire, ayangire kuturekura, MUKAMA yaita emijigaijo yoona omu nsi ya Misri, ey'abantu n'ey'amatungo. Nikyo ntambirira MUKAMA ebiigura-nda byona, ebyetwa ebishaija; kwonka emijigaijo yoona omuri batabani bangye, nkagicungura. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Eki kiryaba akamanyiso aha mukono gwawe, n'ekiijutsyo aha buso bwawe; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akatwiha omuri Misri n'omukono gw'amaani.<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okugumizamu orugyendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:11">Kur 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:1">Kub 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Faraho ku yaaherize kurekura abantu kugyenda, Ruhanga tiyaabarabya mu muhanda ogurikuraba omu nsi y'Abafilistia, n'obu guraabe gwabaire guri haihi; ahakuba Ruhanga akagira ati: Nyentsya abantu ku barishangayo orugamba, bataryefuuza, bakagaruka Misri. <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Kureka Ruhanga akabakiikuura omu muhanda ogw'omu ihamba aha rubaju rw'Enyanja erikutukura. Abaisraeli baaruga Misri, bahagatiire eby'okurwanisa. <verse eid="EXO 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:25">Kut 50:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24:32</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaatwara amagufa ga Yosefu; ahabw'okuba Yosefu akaba arahiize Abaisraeli naabahamiza ati: Buzimazima Ruhanga aryabataayaayira; naimwe muryaiha amagufa gangye omu nsi egi, mugagyendane. <verse eid="EXO 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Baaruga Sukoosi, baateera amahema Esamu aha munwa gw'eihamba. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:33">Bir 1:33</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 4:5">Isa 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:1">1 Kor 10:1</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akaba abeebembera nyomushana, ari omu nyomyo y'ekicu, ngu abahabure, kandi nyekiro omu nyomyo y'omuriro, ngu abamurikire, babone kugyenda nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Egyo nyomyo y'ekicu nyomushana, kandi ey'omuriro nyekiro, ekaba etabaruga mu maisho.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okuraba omu Nyanja erikutukura, n'Abanyamisri okugicwekyerereramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />Gambira Abaisraeli bagarukye enyima, bateere amahema omu maisho ga Pihahiroosi ahagati ya Migidooli n'enyanja, omu maisho ga Baalizefooni; muteere amahema ahashungaine naho aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 71:11">Zab 71:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Faraho naija kugamba aha Baisraeli ati: Bashobereirwe omu nsi, eihamba ribatangire. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:17-23">Rom 9:17-23</ref>. </char></note> Naanye niinyija kugangaaza omutima gwa Faraho, abakurate; nyetungire ekitiinisa ahari Faraho n'aha ihe rye ryona, Abanyamisri baamanye ku ndi MUKAMA. Abaisraeli baakora batyo.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Baagambira omugabe wa Misri ku Abaisraeli bacwire; omutima gwa Faraho n'ey'abaheereza be yaahinduka, baayefuuza ahabwabo, nibagira bati: Beitu eki, tukozire ki, okwikiriza Abaisraeli kugyenda bakareka kutukorera? <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Yaatebeekanisa ekigaari kye eky'okurwanisa, yaagyenda n'engabo ze; <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />yaatwara ebigaari magana mukaaga ebitoorainwe, n'ebindi bigaari bya Misri byona eby'okurwanisa, buri kimwe n'omukuru waakyo. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />MUKAMA yaagangaaza omutima gwa Faraho omugabe wa Misri, yaakurata Abaisraeli; ahakuba Abaisraeli bakaruga Misri nibeemurika. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:9">Kur 15:9</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamisri baabakurata n'embaraasi n'ebigaari bya Faraho byona, n'ab'aha mbaraasi n'engabo ze, baabahika, baashanga bateire amahema haihi n'enyanja aha rubaju rwa Pihahiroosi, ahashungaine na Baali-zefooni.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:17">Zab 34:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:6">107:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Faraho ku yaahikire haihi, Abaisraeli baanaga amaisho, baareeba Abanyamisri nibaija babakuratiire, baatiina munonga; baatakira MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:7">Zab 106:7</ref>. </char></note> Baagambira Musa bati: Beitu shi, ebituuro bikaba bibuzire omuri Misri, waaza kutureeta kugwa omu ihamba? Eki okatukorera ki, okutwiha omuri Misri? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Eki tikyo twakugambiire, obu twabaire tukiri Misri tuti: Fa okutureka, tugume tukorere Abanyamisri? Haakiri tukorera Abanyamisri okukira okugwa omu ihamba. <verse eid="EXO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:15">2 Bus 20:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:10-14">Isa 41:10-14</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagambira abantu ati: Mutatiina mwemerere muhamire, haza mureebe okujunwa oku MUKAMA araabareetere eri izooba; ahakuba Abanyamisri abu murikureeba eri izooba, timurigaruka kubareeba bundi. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:4">Bir 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 10:14">Yos 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA niwe araabarwanirire; ekyanyu n'okwemerera kwonka.<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Ahabw'enki nontakira? Gambira Abaisraeli bagumizemu bagyende. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Naiwe oyereeze enkoni yaawe, ogorore omukono gwawe aha nyanja, ogibaganise, Abaisraeli barabe ahagati y'enyanja aha itaka ryomire. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 29:1">Enf 29:1</ref>. </char></note> Naanye niinyija kugangaaza emitima y'Abanyamisri bazemu babakurate, nyetungire ekitiinisa ahari Faraho n'aha ihe rye ryona n'aha bigaari bye n'aha bantu be ab'aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Kandi Abanyamisri nibaija kumanya ku ndi MUKAMA, ku ndaaheze kwetungira ekitiinisa ahari Faraho n'ebigaari bye n'aha bantu be ab'aha mbaraasi.<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Bwanyima maraika wa Ruhanga, owaabaire ayebembera eihe ry'Abaisraeli, yaarugayo, yaabaza enyima; n'enyomyo y'ekicu yaabaruga omu maisho, yaabeemerera enyima, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />yaaza ahagati y'eihe ry'Abanyamisri n'ery'Abaisraeli. Aha rubaju rwa bari egyo nyomyo yaaba ekicu n'omwirima, kwonka aha rubaju rwa banu yaabamurikira nyekiro; n'ahabw'ekyo bari tibaabaasa kuhika banu ekyo kiro kyona.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 3:16">Yos 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:9">Zab 106:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Musa yaagorora omukono gwe aha nyanja; MUKAMA yaareeta omuyaga mwingi ogw'oburugwa-izooba ekyo kiro kyona, gwagarura enyanja enyima, amaizi gaabaganisibwamu habiri, ahagati yaayo haaba eitaka ryomire. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:19">Kur 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:1">1 Kor 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baaza ahagati y'enyanja aha itaka ryomire, amaizi gaaba nk'ekisiika aha rubaju rwabo orwa buryo n'orwa bumosho. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Abanyamisri baabakurata; embaraasi za Faraho zoona n'ebigaari bye n'abantu be ab'aha mbaraasi baaza ahagati y'enyanja babakuratiire. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Omu itumbi ahu abarinzi abarikuhitsya omu kasheeshe batandikira, MUKAMA yaayema omu nyomyo y'omuriro n'ekicu, yaareeba eihe ry'Abanyamisri, yaabahahaaza emitima. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Yaashayisa enziga z'ebigaari byabo, byarema eikurura; Abanyamisri nikwo kugira bati: Murekye tuhungye Abaisraeli; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe arikubarwanira n'Abanyamisri.<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Gorora omukono gwawe aha nyanja, amaizi gagarukye, gashwekye Abanyamisri n'ebigaari byabo n'abantu baabo ab'aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:18">Yos 4:18</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagorora omukono gwe aha nyanja; ku bwabaire nibutaagurukana, enyanja yaagaruka omu maani gaayo nk'oku eshangwa etuura; Abanyamisri omu kuhunga baabugabugana nayo; MUKAMA yaabinga Abanyamisri, baakunkumukira omuri egyo nyanja. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:11">Neh 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Amaizi gaagaruka, gaashweka ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi n'eihe ryona erya Faraho, eryagiire omu nyanja ribakuratiire; tihaatsigaraho n'omwe aharibo. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:53">Zab 78:53</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaisraeli bo omu kuraba omuri egyo nyanja bakaraba ahoomire; amaizi gaaba nk'ekisiika aha rubaju rwabo orwa buryo n'orwa bumosho.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:8-10">Zab 106:8-10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaakirize Abaisraeli omu mikono y'Abanyamisri eryo izooba; Abaisraeli baareeba emitumbi y'Abanyamisri aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:9">Kur 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:11">Yoh 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaisraeli baareeba omurimo muhango ogu MUKAMA yaakozire aha Banyamisri; abantu baatiina MUKAMA; kandi baikiriza MUKAMA n'omugaragwa we Musa.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro kya Musa n'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Bwanyima Musa n'Abaisraeli baayeshongorera MUKAMA ekyeshongoro eki, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Niinyeshongorera MUKAMA, ahakuba asingwire n'ekitiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Embaraasi n'ogitembire abinagire omu nyanja.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:1">Bar 5:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />MUKAMA niwe maani gangye n'ekyeshongoro kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Kandi ahindukire okujunwa kwangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Ogu niwe Ruhanga wangye, nimmuhimbisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Ruhanga wa taata; nimmuha ekitiinisa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 12:2">Isa 12:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />MUKAMA n'emanzi omu rugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:3">MUKAMA niryo iziina rye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:11">Kush 19:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Ebigaari bya Faraho n'eihe rye abinagire omu nyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:4">Abakuru b'engabo ze abatoorainwe barohamire omu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">Nyanja erikutukura.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Amaizi g'ahagati y'enyanja gabashwekire; baakyengyera okuzimu nk'eibaare.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />MUKAMA, omukono gwawe gwa buryo gwine ekitiinisa ahabw'obushoboorozi bwagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:6">MUKAMA, omukono gwawe ogwa buryo gusheenyagura abazigu.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Omu bukuru bw'ekitiinisa kyawe otuura ahansi abaimuka kukurwanisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:7">Oyohereza ekiniga kyawe, kibasiriiza nk'ebitsintsi by'embuba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Bir 4:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Omwitsyo gw'amaani ogw'omu nyindo zaawe gutuumire hamwe amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:8">Amaizi agaaba nigagyenda gaayetuuma hamwe omutuumo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:8">Okuzimu omunda y'enyanja haakwata.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Abazigu bagizire bati: Ka tubakurate, tubakwate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Tubagane eminyago, tubeemarireho akaturi aha mutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Nitwija kusyorayo zaarurara zaitu, emikono yaitu ebacwekyereze.<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Waareeta omuyaga gwawe, enyanja yaabashweka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:10">Baarohama nka rusasi omu maizi maingi ag'amaani.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />Ai MUKAMA, omuri baaruhanga orikushushana naiwe n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:11">N'oha ori nkaiwe, iwe orikuhimbisibwa ahabw'okwera kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:11">Ow'okutiinwa ahabw'eby'ekitiinisa n'eby'okutangaaza, ebi okora?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:22">2 Sam 7:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Ogoroire omukono gwawe ogwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:12">Ensi yaabamira.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Iwe ahabw'embabazi zaawe oyebembeire abantu baawe abu ocungwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:13">Waabeebembera n'amaani gaawe kubahitsya omu mwanya gwawe ogurikwera.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Amahanga gakihuriire, gaatetema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:14">Abatwire Filistia baagira obujune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:9">Yos 2:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Hati abatware ba Edomu ni batangaara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">Emanzi za Moabu nizitetema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">Abatwire omuri Kanaani boona emitima ebahweire omunda.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Baitsirwe obwoba n'okutiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Ahabw'obukuru bw'omukono gwawe tibarikwehiga, ni nk'eibaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Okuhitsya obu abantu baawe baraarabeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Okuhitsya obu abantu abu waayeguriire baraarabeho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:25">Bir 2:25</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Oryabahitsya omu nsi egyo, obabyare aha rushozi rw'obuhunguzi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">Omwanya, ogu waayeshemereize kutuuramu, ai MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">Omwanya Ogurikwera, ogu waahamize n'emikono yaawe.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />MUKAMA aryaguma aha ngoma ebiro byona.<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Embaraasi za Faraho ku zaagiire omu nyanja n'ebigaari bye n'abantu be ab'aha mbaraasi, MUKAMA yaagarura amaizi g'enyanja, gaabashweka; kwonka Abaisraeli bo bakaraba ahagati y'enyanja aha itaka ryomire. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:6">1 Sam 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:25">Zab 68:25</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Miriamu nabikazi, munyaanya wa Arooni, yaatwara ekitaasa; n'abakazi boona baagyenda bamukuratiire, baine ebitaasa nibazina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miriamu yaabeebembera, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">Mweshongorere MUKAMA, aha kuba asingwire n'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">Embaraasi n'ogitembire abinagire omu nyanja.<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okushemeza amaizi ga Maara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Musa yaayebembera Abaisraeli okuruga aha Nyanja erikutukura, baagyenda, baahika omu ihamba rya Shuuri, baarimaramu ebiro bishatu nibagyenda, babuzire amaizi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:20">Rus 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikire Maara, tibaabaasa kunywa maizi gaayo, ahakuba gakaba nigashaarira; nikyo haayeteirwe Maara. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Abantu baayetomboitera Musa, nibagira bati: Tunywe ki? <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:21">2 Bag 2:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kur 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaatakira MUKAMA; MUKAMA yaamworeka ekiti, yaakinaga omuri ago maizi, amaizi gaanura.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Aho niho MUKAMA yaabaheereire ekiragiro n'omugyenzo ogu yaataireho; kandi niho yaabagyereize, <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:25">Kur 23:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:3">Zab 103:3</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Ku oryezirika kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, waakora ebihikire omu maisho ge, waatega amatu ebiragiro bye, waarinda byona ebi yaataireho, tindikureetaho ndwara n'emwe ahari ezo ezi naareetsire aha Banyamisri; ahakuba niinye MUKAMA orikukutambira endwara. <verse eid="EXO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Bwanyima baahika Elimu, ahu enshuro z'amaizi ikumi na ibiri n'emikindo makumi mushanju byabaire biri; baateera amahema aha rubaju rw'ago maizi.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuha Abaisraeli emaanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Eihanga ryona ey'Abaisraeli baaruga Elimu, baahika omu ihamba rya Siini, eriri ahagati ya Elimu na Sinai aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi kwa kabiri, baherize kuruga omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:10">1 Kor 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli baayetomboitera Musa na Arooni omu ihamba, <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Kub 11:4</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Nangwa kuri twaitsirwe omukono gwa MUKAMA, tukiri omu nsi ya Misri, obu twabaire tushutama aha nyungu z'enyama, tukarya emigaati, tukahaaga. Mbwenu mukatwihayo, mwatureeta omuri eri ihamba kwitsa eri ihanga ryona enjara.<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:31">Yoh 6:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Niinyija kubagwisiza eby'okurya nk'enjura okuruga omu iguru; ebiro byona abantu nibaija kuguma nibatorotoora omugabo gw'eizooba rimwe, mbone kubagyeza, mmanye ku baraabe nibaija kuguma niboorobera ebiragiro byangye, nari batarikubyorobera. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Kandi ahari buri kiro kya mukaaga baryayeteguura eby'okutwara omuka, biingane n'ebi batorotoora buri izooba kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:28">Kub 16:28</ref>. </char></note> Musa na Arooni baagambira Abaisraeli boona bati: Omu mwabazyo nimwija kumanya ku owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri ari MUKAMA; <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:5">Isa 40:5</ref>. </char></note> kandi omu kasheeshe nibwo murikwija kureeba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ahuriire ebi murikumwetomboitera. Mbwenu itwe turi baahi, abu murikwetomboitera? <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:7">1 Sam 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:8">1 Tes 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagaruka yaabagira ati: MUKAMA ku araabahe enyama y'okurya omu mwabazyo, n'omu kasheeshe yaabaha omugaati mwahaaga; niho muraamanyire ku ahuriire okwetomboita kwanyu oku murikumwetomboitera. Mbwenu itwe turi baahi? Tiitwe murikwetomboitera, kureka nimwetomboitera MUKAMA.<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Musa yaagambira Arooni ati: Gambira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli oti: Mwirire haihi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ahakuba ahuriire ebi murikwetomboita. <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Arooni ku yaabeire nakigambira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli, baanaga amaisho omu ihamba, baareeba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA nikireebekyera omuri kiri kicu. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:27">Kub 14:27</ref>. </char></note> Mpuriire okwetomboita kw'Abaisraeli; bagambire oti: Omu mwabazyo nimwija kurya enyama, kandi omu kasheeshe nimwija kurya eby'okurya muhaagye; haza mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:31">Kub 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:27">Zab 78:27</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwabazyo haija endahi, zaashweka orusiisira; kandi omu kasheeshe baashanga haimukiireho orume rwehinguririize orusiisira. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:40">Zab 105:40</ref>. </char></note> Orume ku rwakyeire, aha nsi omu ihamba haareebeka otuntu tukye twekuringiriire, nk'amatondo g'orume rw'embeho. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:3">1 Kor 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli ku baatureebire, baabuuzana bati: Ebi n'enki? Ahakuba tibarabimanyire. Musa yaabagira ati: Ebyo nibyo by'okurya ebi MUKAMA abahaire kurya. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Eki nikyo MUKAMA arikubaragiira, naagira ati: Mutorotoore, buri muntu nk'okurya kwe oku kuri, omuntu weena homeri emwe nk'omubaro gw'abantu baanyu oku guri; buri muntu abitwarire ab'omu ihema rye. <verse eid="EXO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Abaisraeli baakora batyo, abamwe baatorotoora bingi, n'abandi bikye. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:15">2 Kor 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku baabirengire omuri homeri, owaashangurwize bingi, tiyaashaazyaho; n'owaashangurwize bikye, tiyaakyenire. Buri muntu yaatorotoora nk'okurya kwe oku kwabaire kuri. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Kandi Musa yaabagira ati: Hatagira omuntu owaabiraazaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Beitu kwonka tibaamuhurira; abamwe aharibo baabiraazaho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe, byagiibwamu enyogori, byanuuka. Musa yaabagirira ekiniga. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Okuruga aho baaguma nibatorotoora buri kasheeshe, nk'okurya kwa buri muntu oku kwabaire kuri; omushana gukijwa, bihwerera.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Aha kiro kya mukaaga baatorotoora eby'okurya ebirikwingana na biri kabiri, buri muntu homeri ibiri; abakuru b'eihanga boona baija, baabigambira Musa. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:15">Kur 31:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Okwo nikwo MUKAMA agizire ati: Nyencakare n'eizooba rikuru ry'okuruhuukiraho, sabato eyereziibwe MUKAMA; mwotsye ebi murikwenda kwotsya; muteekye ebi muri kwenda kuteeka; ebiraashaagye byona mubibiikye okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Baabiraaza, byahitsya omu kasheeshe, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire, tibyanuuka, n'obu kwakuba okugiibwamu enyogori n'emwe. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa yaabagira ati: Ebyo mube nibyo mwarya eri izooba, ahakuba eri izooba ni sabato ahari MUKAMA; eri izooba timurikwija kubibona omu ishwa. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9">Kur 20:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Muryaguma nimubitorotoora okumara ebiro mukaaga; kwonka aha kiro kya mushanju, niyo sabato, tibirireebeka. <verse eid="EXO 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Bwanyima aha kiro kya mushanju abantu bamwe baashohora, baaza kutorotoora, tibaabibona. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Muryahitsya hi okwanga kworobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naaragiire? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Mumanye ngu MUKAMA akabaha sabato, n'ahabw'ekyo ahakiro kya mukaaga nikyo abaheera eby'okurya by'okumara amazooba abiri; omuntu weena agume omu mwanya gwe; hatarigira omuntu weena owaaruga omu mwanya gwe aha kiro kya mushanju. <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />N'ahabw'ekyo abantu baaruhuuka aha kiro kya mushanju. <verse eid="EXO 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Eby'okurya ebyo ab'enju ya Israeli baabyeta Emaanu; ekaba neeyera nk'enjuma z'obunyaatsi oburikwetwa gaadi; kandi neenura nk'omugaati ogukoreirwemu obwoki.<verse eid="EXO 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa yaagira ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA arikubaragiira, naagira ati: Encuro ya homeri emwe ebiikwe ahabwa baijukuru baanyu ab'obusingye oburiija, nyentsya bareebe eby'okurya ebi naabaire mbariisiza omu ihamba, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Heb 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagira Arooni ati: Twara orwabya, orutemu homeri y'emaanu, orubiikye omu maisho ga MUKAMA, emaanu egyo ebiikwe ahabwa baijukuru baanyu ab'obusingye oburiija. <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16">Kur 25:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Arooni yaagibiika omu maisho g'Ebirikuhamya, ngu egumeho, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:31">Yoh 6:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 5:12">Yos 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaisraeli bakamara emyaka makumi ana nibarya emaanu, okuhitsya obu baahikire omu nsi etwirwemu abantu; baagumizamu nibarya emaanu okuhitsya obu baahikire aha myatano y'ensi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Kandi homeri emwe ekaba eri ekicweka kya ikumi kya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eefa emwe neingana nka galloni munaana. </char></note>eefa emwe.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s1">Okubura amaizi, Musa akagaiha omu rukiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli ryaruga omu ihamba rya Siini, baagyenda nibaraarira nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaire abaragiira. Ku baahikire Refidimu, baateerayo amahema; kwonka abantu baaburayo amaizi g'okunywa. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:3">Kub 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:41">Zab 78:41</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo abantu baatonganisa Musa nibagira bati: Tuhe amaizi g'okunywa. Musa yaabagira ati: Nimuntonganisiza ki? Ahabw'enki nimugyeza MUKAMA? <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Abantu baagirirayo eiriho, baayetomboitera Musa nibagira bati: Okatwihira ki Misri kutwitsa eiriho, itwe n'abaana baitu n'amatungo gaitu? <verse eid="EXO 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:6">1 Sam 30:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:59">Yoh 8:59</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaatakira MUKAMA, naagira ati: Abantu aba mbagire nta? Bari hakye kunteera amabaare. <verse eid="EXO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Raba omu maisho g'abantu, otware abamwe aha bakuru b'Abaisraeli, otware n'enkoni, ei waateire omugyera guri, ogyende. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:41">Zab 105:41</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kwemerera omu maisho gaawe aha rukiri rw'ahari Horebu; oteere orwo rukiri, harugyemu amaizi, abantu banywe. Musa yaakora atyo omu maisho g'abakuru b'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:8">Heb 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Omwanya ogwo yaagweta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maasa amakuru n'Okugyeza. </char></note>Maasa na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meriba, amakuru n'Okutongana. </char></note>Meriba ahabw'okutongana oku Abaisraeli baamutonganiise, kandi ahabw'okuba bakagyeza MUKAMA nibagira bati: Ebyo MUKAMA ari ahagati omuriitwe, nari tariho?<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaamaleki okurwanisa Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:12">Kut 36:12</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2">1 Sam 15:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haija Abaamaleki, baarwanisiza Abaisraeli ahari Refidimu. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa yaagambira Yoshua ati: Tutooranire engabo, mugyende murwanise Abaamaleki; nyencakare niinyija kwemerera aha mutwe gw'ekibungo, nkwaitse enkoni ya Ruhanga omu ngaro. <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Yoshua yaakora nk'oku Musa amuragiire, yaarwanisa Abaamaleki; Musa na Arooni na Huuri bainamuka, baahika aha mutwe gw'ekyo kibungo. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:16">Yak 5:16</ref>. </char></note> Musa ku yaabaire aimutsya omukono, Abaisraeli babinga; akigugwisa, Abaamaleki babinga. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Kwonka emikono ya Musa yaaruha; baareeta eibaare, baarita ahansi ye, yaarishutamaho; Arooni na Huuri baaramira emikono ye, omwe aha rubaju rumwe n'ondi aha rundi; emikono ye yaahama okuhitsya obu eizooba ryarengire. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Yoshua yaasingura Amaleki n'engabo ze na rurara.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:19">Bir 25:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Ekyo okihandiikye omu kitabo, kibe ekiijutsyo, okiteekyerereze Yoshua, ku ndimariraho kimwe Amaleki, atagarukye kwijukwa ahansi y'eiguru. <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Kandi Musa yaayombeka eitambiro, yaaryeta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yehova-niisi amakuru ngu MUKAMA n'orurango rwangye. </char></note>Yehova-niisi; <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />yaagira ati: MUKAMA yaarahira ku ariguma naarwanisa Abaamaleki, nk'oku obusingye burigyenda nibwihaihana.<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yesero okutaayaayira Musa n'okumuha obwengye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Yesero omunyamurwa wa Midiani, ishezaara wa Musa, akahurira byona ebi Ruhanga yaakoreire Musa n'abantu be Abaisraeli, kandi n'oku yaihire Abaisraeli omuri Misri. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Kandi Yesero, ishezaara wa Musa, akaba atwaire Zipora muka Musa, ou Musa yaabaire ayohereizeyo n'abatabani bombi. <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />Eiziina ry'omwe akaba ari Gereshomu, (ahakuba ishe akagira ati: Nkaba ndi omushuhuuki omu nsi etari yaitu; <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />n'ondiijo akaba naayetwa Eliezeeri, ahakuba ishe akagira ati: Ruhanga wa taata akambeera Omuhwezi, yankiza rurara ya Faraho.) <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Yesero ishezaara wa Musa yaareetera Musa abatabani n'omukazi we, yaamushanga omuri eryo ihamba, ahu yaabaire ari omu rusiisira aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yaagambira Musa ati: Nyowe shozaara Yesero naakureetera omukazi waawe n'abatabani be bombi. <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Musa yaashohora kubugana ishezaara, yainama omu maisho ge, yaamunywegyera; baabuuzana oku barikuraara; baataaha omu ihema. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa yaateekyerereza ishezaara byona ebi MUKAMA yaakozire ahari Faraho n'Abanyamisri ahabw'Abaisraeli, n'enaku zoona ezi baareebire omu muhanda, kandi n'oku MUKAMA yaabakirize. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yesero yaashemererwa ahabw'ebirungi byona ebi MUKAMA yaakoreire Abaisraeli, ahabw'okubajuna omu mikono y'Abanyamisri.<verse eid="EXO 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Yesero yaagira ati: MUKAMA owaabakirize Abanyamisri na Faraho ahimbisibwe! <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:16-20">Isa 37:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:51">Luk 1:51</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu naamanya ku MUKAMA arikukira baaruhanga abandi boona, ahakuba akaiha abantu omu mikono y'Abanyamisri, obu baabaire nibabaita kubi babaineho amaryo. <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Yesero ishezaara wa Musa yaatwara ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo by'okutambira Ruhanga; Arooni n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli boona baija kuriira hamwe na ishezaara wa Musa omu maisho ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Ku bwaseesire, Musa yaashutama kucwera abantu emanja; abantu baayemerera beehinguririize Musa okwiha omu kasheeshe okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Ishezaara wa Musa ku yaareebire byona ebi arikukorera abantu, yaagira ati: Eki eki orikukorera abantu niki? Ahabw'enki nooshutama wenka, abantu boona bakakwehinguririza okwiha omu kasheeshe okuhitsya omu mwabazyo? <verse eid="EXO 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa yaagarukamu ishezaara ati: N'ahabw'okuba abantu nibaija ahariinye, ngu mbabuurize ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Omuntu na mutaahi we ku baba baine eki barikufa, baija ahariinye, mbaramura, kandi mbamanyisa ebiragiro bya Ruhanga n'ebi arikuragiira. <verse eid="EXO 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Ishezaara wa Musa yaamugira ati: Eki eki orikukora ti kirungi. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:14">Kub 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:9">Bir 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 1:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Noija kwomera ahaiguru, iwe n'aba bantu abu oine; ahakuba omurimo ogu nigukukira; torikubaasa kugukora wenka. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Mbwenu hurira eki ndikukugambira, nkuhe obwengye; kandi Ruhanga agume naiwe. Obe niiwe waaguma noohikira abantu ahari Ruhanga, kandi ogume obahikizeyo emanja zaabo; <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:1">Bir 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:5">5</ref>. </char></note> kandi oryabeegyesa ebiragiro n'ebi Ruhanga arikuragiira, oboorekye oku bashemereire kutwaza n'ebi bashemereire kukora. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:3">Byak 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:3">2 Sam 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi otoorane omu bantu boona abashaija b'oburyo, abarikutiina Ruhanga, ab'amazima, kandi abarikwanga enguzi; abantu nk'abo obateho bategyekye abantu, abamwe bategyekye buri omwe rukumi, abandi igana, abandi ataano, n'abandi ikumi; <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:11">Lev 24:11</ref>. </char></note> babe nibo baaguma nibacwera abantu emanja obutoosha. Orubanja orugumire rwona baryarukureetera, kwonka emanja ezoorobi babe nibo baazicwa; obwo nibwo oryanguhirwa, nabo bakaguma nibakwatanisa naiwe oburemeezi. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Ku oraakore ekigambo ekyo, kandi Ruhanga yaaba niwe yaakikuragiira, obwo oryabaasa kugumaho, kandi n'aba bantu baryaguma nibagaruka owaabo n'obusingye.<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa yaahurira ebigambo bya ishezaara, yaakora ebi yaamugambira byona. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:15">Bir 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaatoorana omu Baisraeli boona abashaija b'oburyo, yaabahindura abakuru b'abantu, abamwe kutegyeka buri omwe rukumi, abandi igana, abandi ataano n'abandi ikumi. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:16">Yob 29:16</ref>. </char></note> Baaguma nibacwera abantu emanja obutoosha; emanja ezigumire bazireetera Musa, kwonka ezoorobi zoona bazeemarira. <verse eid="EXO 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:29">Kub 10:29</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Musa yaaraga ishezaara, yaagaruka owaabo.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okweyoreka Abaisraeli aha rushozi Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Omu kwezi kwa kashatu Abaisraeli baherize kuruga omu nsi ya Misri, aha kiro eki okwezi okwo kwabonekyeireho, bakahika omu ihamba rya Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Ku baarugire Refidimu, baahika omu ihamba rya Sinai, baateera amahema omuri eryo ihamba; kandi Abaisraeli baaguma omu rusiisira omu maisho g'orushozi. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Musa yainamuka ahari Ruhanga, MUKAMA yaamweta naayema aha rushozi, yaagira ati: Oku nikwo oraagambire enju ya Yakobo, noogambira Abaisraeli, oti: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:11">Bir 32:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:9">Isa 63:9</ref>. </char></note> Mukareeba ebi naakozire Abanyamisri, kandi naimwe oku naabatwariire aha mapapa nk'empungu, nkabareeta ahariinye. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:8">Bir 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:4">Zab 135:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ku murihurira eiraka ryangye, mwarinda endagaano yangye, muryaba abantu bangye ahabwangye abatoorainwe omu mahanga goona; ahakuba ensi yoona n'eyangye; <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi muryambeera obukama bw'abanyamurwa n'eihanga eririkwera. Ebyo nibyo bigambo ebi oraagambire Abaisraeli.<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Musa yaija, yaayeta abakuru b'abantu, yaata omu maisho gaabo ebigambo ebyo byona ebi MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:16-18">Yos 24:16-18</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona baagarukiramu hamwe, nibagira bati: Byona ebi MUKAMA yaagamba, nitwija kubikora. Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ebigambo ebyo ebi abantu baagamba. <verse eid="EXO 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:2">Zab 97:2</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Reeba, niinyija ahariiwe omu kicu kikwaitse, ngu abantu bahurire ningamba naiwe, babone kukwikiriza ebiro byona. Bwanyima Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ebigambo by'abantu. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Irooko oze omu bantu, obeeze eri izooba na nyencakare, boozye ebijwaro byabo, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />aha kiro kya kashatu bashangwe beeteekateekire; ahakuba ahari ekyo kiro kya kashatu MUKAMA naija kushuuma aha rushozi Sinai omu maisho g'abantu boona. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:20">Heb 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Oteereho abantu obugarukiro okwehinguririza orushozi, obagire oti: Mwerinde, mutainamuka aha rushozi, n'obu kwakuba okukora aha bugarukiro bwarwo; omuntu weena oraakore aha rushozi, buzimazima naija kwitwa; <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />kandi hatagira omuntu weena owaamukoraho, kureka bamwitse amabaare, nari bamurashe; n'obu eraabe enyamaishwa nari omuntu, atagumaho. Enzamba ku eraagambe akasirikiriro, bainamukye, bahikye aha rushozi. <verse eid="EXO 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Bwanyima Musa yaashuuma orushozi, yaaza omu bantu, yaabeeza, baayozya ebijwaro byabo; <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:5">1 Kor 7:5</ref>. </char></note> yaagambira abantu ati: Ekiro kya kashatu kishangye mweteekateekire; mutagira obu muhikire abakazi baanyu. <verse eid="EXO 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Ku bwaseesire aha kiro kya kashatu, enkuba zaahinda, emirabyo yaatyankana, ekicu kikwaitse kyaija ahari orwo rushozi, eiraka ry'enzamba ryagamba munonga, abantu boona, abaabaire bari omu rusiisira, baatetema. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Musa yaashohoza abantu omu rusiisira kubugana Ruhanga, baayemerera ahansi y'orushozi. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:7">Zab 68:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 68:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Orwo rushozi Sinai rwona rwacumba omwika, ahakuba MUKAMA akarushuumaho naizira omu muriro; omwika gwagwo gwacumbuuka nk'ogw'ekikoomi, orushozi rwona rwatengyeta munonga. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Eiraka ry'enzamba ku ryayeyongyeire kugamba munonga, Musa yaagamba, MUKAMA yaamugarukamu n'eiraka. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />MUKAMA yaashuuma aha rushozi Sinai, aha mutwe gwarwo, yaayeta Musa kwinamuka aha mutwe gw'orwo rushozi; Musa yainamuka. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:19">1 Sam 6:19</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Irooko oshuume, oyehanangirize abantu, batakaayoga aha bugarukiro kuhika ahu MUKAMA ari kumushamaarira, baingi omuribo bakacwekyerera. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:7">2 Sam 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abanyamurwa abairira haihi MUKAMA beeyeze, MUKAMA atakaabagwaho. <verse eid="EXO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ati: Abantu tibarikubaasa kwinamuka ahari oru rushozi Sinai; ahakuba okaturagiira oti: Oteho obugarukiro okwehinguririza orushozi, orweze. <verse eid="EXO 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Irooko oshuume, haza oinamukye na Arooni; kwonka abanyamurwa n'abantu barekye kwoga aha bugarukiro kuhika ahu MUKAMA ari, atakaabagwaho. <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Musa nikwo kushuuma, akaza ahu abantu bari, akabibagambira.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro ikumi bya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Ruhanga akagamba ebigambo ebi byona, naagira ati:<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:2-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 5:6-21">Bir 5:6-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku. <verse eid="EXO 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />Otarigira baaruhanga abandi, nyowe ndiho.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />Otaryekorera ekishushani kyona ekibaizire, n'obu kyakuba ekishushani ky'ekintu kyona ekiri ahaiguru omu iguru, nari ekiri omu nsi ahansi, nari ekiri omu maizi okuzimu.<verse eid="EXO 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:19">Yos 24:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:15">Isa 44:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:19">Ezk 18:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaribiinamira, kandi otaribiheereza; ahakuba nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ndi Ruhanga ow'eihato, ntura abaana eby'okushiisha bya baishebo abarikuunyanga, okuhitsya aha b'obusingye bwa kashatu n'obwa kana; <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Bir 7:9</ref>. </char></note> kwonka abaana b'abarikunkunda bakoorobera ebiragiro byangye, mbagirira embabazi okuhitsya obusingye enkumi n'enkumi.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat 5:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarizaanisa eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; ahakuba MUKAMA tarimubara nk'otaine rubanja orikuzaanisa eiziina rye. <verse eid="EXO 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />Ijuka kweza ekiro kya sabato; <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:14">Luk 13:14</ref>. </char></note> omu biro mukaaga ogume okore; obe nimwo waakorera emirimo yaawe yoona; <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:15">Neh 13:15</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ekiro kya mushanju niyo sabato ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; otarikoreraho omurimo gwona, iwe nari mutabani waawe, nari muhara waawe, nari omuhuuku waawe, nari omuzaana waawe, nari amatungo gaawe, nari omunyaihanga ori omu ka yaawe; <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />ahabw'okuba omu biro mukaaga nimwo MUKAMA yaahangiire eiguru n'ensi, enyanja n'ebirimu byona, akahuumura aha kiro kya mushanju; nikyo MUKAMA yaaheereire omugisha ekiro kya mushanju, akakyeza.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:4-6">Mat 15:4-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otiine sho na nyoko, obone kumara ebiro bingi omu nsi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:21-22">Mat 5:21-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:27-28">Mat 5:27-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarishambana.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />Otariiba.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />Otaribeiherera mutaahi waawe.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 2:2">Mik 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:3">Efe 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaryetenga enju ya mutaahi waawe; otaryetenga muka mutaahi waawe, n'obu yaakuba omuhuuku we, nari omuzaana we, nari ente ye, nari endogoya ye, n'obu kyakuba ekintu kyona ekya mutaahi waawe.<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb 12:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu boona ku baahuriire okuhinda kw'enkuba, baareeba okutyankana kw'emirabyo, baahurira eiraka ry'enzamba, kandi baareeba orushozi nirucumba omwika, baatetema, baayemerera hare munonga. <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Baagira Musa bati: Obe niiwe waagamba naitwe, nitwija kuhurira; kwonka Ruhanga arekye kugamba naitwe, tutakaafa. <verse eid="EXO 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Enf 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaagarukamu abantu ati: Mutatiina; ahakuba Ruhanga yaija kubagyeza, ngu okutiinwa kwe kubagume omu maisho, murekye kushiisha. <verse eid="EXO 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Abantu baayemerera hare munonga; reero Musa we yairira haihi omwirima ndindindi, ahu Ruhanga yaabaire ari.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Oku nikwo orangambirire Abaisraeli ebi ndikubagambira nti: Imwe ahabwanyu mwayereebera oku naagamba naimwe niinyema omu iguru. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Mutaryekorera baaruhanga abandi kubamparika; baaruhanga b'efeeza nari ab'ezaabu mutaribeekorera. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">2 Bus 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Ombumbire eitambiro ry'eitaka, otambireho ebitambo byawe eby'okwotsya, n'empongano zaawe ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, entaama zaawe n'ente zaawe; omu mwanya gwona ogu eiziina ryangye ririijukirwaho, ndyaija ah'ori, nkuhe omugisha. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:31">Yos 8:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku orinkorera eitambiro ry'amabaare, otaririkoresa amabaare gabaizire; ahakuba ku oriribaizisaho oti ekyoma kyawe, oryaba orihagaire. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Otarita amatembero aha itambiro ryangye kutemberaho, orekye kureebwa ojwariireho busha.<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro bya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />Ebi nibyo biragiro ebi oraate omu maisho gaabo. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:12">Bir 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:14">Yer 34:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku origura Omuheburaayo kuba omuhuuku waawe, akuheereze emyaka mukaaga; omu mwaka gwa mushanju agyende n'obusingye, ataine ki ayecungwize. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ku ariba aizire wenka, agyende wenka; ku ariba aizire n'omukazi, omukazi we agyende nawe. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Mukama we ku arimushwererera omukazi, yaamuzaarira abaana b'aboojo nari ab'abaishiki, ogwo mukazi n'abaana be baryaba aba mukama we; we agyende wenka. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:16">Bir 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ogwo muhuuku ku aryegambira butunu ati: Ninkunda mukama wangye n'omukazi wangye kandi n'abaana bangye; tindikwenda kugyenda kuruga omu buhuuku; <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6">Zab 40:6</ref>. </char></note> mukama we aryamutwara omu maisho ga Ruhanga, amwemereze aha rwigi nari aha kiti ky'omuryango, amufumure okutu n'empindu; omuhuuku ogwo agume naamukorera ebiro byona.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 5:5">Neh 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku aritunda muhara we kuba omuzaana, atariruga omu buzaana, nk'oku abahuuku batwazibwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Ku ariba atashemeize mukama we, owaabaire amwereeteire kumushwera, amurekye acungurwe; tarigira bushoboorozi bw'okumutunza abanyamahanga, ahabw'okuba niwe ariba amureebize. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Kandi ku arimushwererera omutabani, amutwaze nka muhara we. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Ku arimuharika, atarituubya aha by'okurya bye, nari aha bijwaro bye, n'obu kwakuba okumwitira embu. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ku ariba atamuhikiize ebyo byonshatu, aryagyenda atazimuuriirwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:6">Kut 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:52">Mat 26:52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oriteera omuntu, akamwita, nawe aitwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:11">Kub 35:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:2">Yos 20:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omuntu ku ariita ondi atamugwereire, beitu kyaruga ahari Ruhanga kumugwa omu mikono, ndyakuteeraho omwanya, ogu ashemereire kuhungiramu. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:28-34">1 Bag 2:28-34</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku aritaahirira mutaahi we, yaamureebya, yaamwita nkana, omwihe aha itambiro ryangye, aitwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />Oriteera ishe nari nyina, aitwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Kut 37:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oriiba omuntu, akamutunda, nari bakamukwata akimwine, aitwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mak 7:10</ref>. </char></note> Orijuma ishe nari nyina, aitwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />Abantu ku baritongana, omwe yaateera mugyenzi we eibaare nari entomi, ataafa, kwonka yaaguma aha kishegu arwaire, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />ku ariimuka, yaashotookyera aha kibango, owaamuteire atarigiibwaho orubanja, kureka arihe ebiro ebi amazire arwaire, kandi amuragurize okuhitsya obu arikira gye.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku ariteera omuhuuku we nari omuzaana we enkoni, yaamugwisaho, aryaheebwa ekiheneso; <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:45">Lev 25:45</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ogwo muhuuku ku arimaraho ekiro kimwe nari bibiri, tariheebwa kiheneso ahakuba ogwo muhuuku n'empiiha ze.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />Abashaija ku barirwana, baasaasa omukazi oine enda, enda yaarugamu, kwonka ataagira kundi oku yaaba, owaamusaasa aryariha iba w'ogwo mukazi, nk'oku arimurihisa; kandi aryariha, nk'oku abaramuzi barisiima. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Kwonka ku arigira okundi oku yaaba, obwo amagara garyarihwa agandi, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5:38</ref>. </char></note> eriisho ririhwe erindi, eriino ririhwe erindi, ekiganja kirihwe ekindi, ekigyere kirihwe ekindi, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />okwotsya kuhoorerwe okundi, obuhuta buhoorerwe obundi, n'okuteerwa kuhoorerwe okundi. <verse eid="EXO 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />Omuntu ku ariteera omuhuuku we nari omuzaana we, yaamwata eriisho, aryamurekura, arugye omu buhuuku ahabw'eryo riisho. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Kandi ku ariteera omuhuuku we nari omuzaana we, yaamuhigura eriino, aryamurekura, arugye omu buhuuku ahabw'eryo riino.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />Ente ku ericumita omushaija nari omukazi, yaamwita, egyo nte baryagiitsa amabaare, kandi etaririibwa; kwonka mukama waayo atarigiibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Kwonka egyo nte ku eraabe yaabaire neecumita abantu, baagambira mukama waayo, yaayanga kugirinda, bwanyima yaita omushaija nari omukazi, egyo nte baryagiitsa amabaare, na mukama waayo bamwite. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ku barimucwa eby'okwecunguza, ahe ebi barimucwa byona ahabw'okucungura amagara ge. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />N'obu ericumita mutabani w'omuntu nari muhara w'omuntu, mukama w'ente aryatwazibwa, nk'ekiragiro ekyo oku kiri. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Kandi egyo nte ku ericumita omuhuuku nari omuzaana, mukama waayo aryariha mukama waabo shekeli makumi ashatu z'efeeza, n'egyo nte bagiitse amabaare.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />Omuntu ku aritsiga ekiina kyashami, nari yaarima ekiina, ataakitinda, ente nari endogoya yaakigwamu, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />mukama w'ekyo kiina aryagiriha, ahe mukama waayo empiiha, kandi omutumbi gwayo guryaba ogwa mukama w'ekiina.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ente y'omuntu ku ericumita ey'ondiijo, yaagiita, baryatunda egyo ehuriire, babagane empiiha zaayo, kandi bagarukye babagane n'eyaitwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Nari ku kirimanywa ngu ente egyo eshangwa ecumita, kandi mukama waayo tagirinda, aryariha endi omu mwanya gwayo, kandi omutumbi guryaba ogwa kiriha.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:6">2 Sam 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:25">Mat 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:28">Efe 4:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku ariiba ente nari entaama, yaagiita nari yaagitunda, egyo nte aryagiriha ente itaano, kandi egyo ntaama agirihe entaama ina. Aryariha; kwonka ku ariba ataine kantu, aryatundwa ahabw'obushuma bwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Omushuma ku arishangwa naafumura enju, baamuteera, yaafa, tihaine origiibwaho orubanja ahabw'eshagama ye; <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />kwonka ku barimwita bwaseesire, baryagiibwaho orubanja ahabw'eshagama ye. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:31">Enf 6:31</ref>. </char></note> Ekiibirwe ku barishanga akiine kikihuriire, yaaba nte, nari endogoya nari entaama, aryagiriha ibiri.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />Omuntu ku aryonesa nkana omusiri gw'ondi, nari omusiri gwe ogw'emizaabibu; nari ku aritsibura amatungo ge, gaayona omusiri gw'ondiijo, aryamuriha aha bi ahingire ebirikukira oburungi, nari amurihe aha byana by'emizaabibu eby'omu musiri gwe ebirikukira oburungi. <verse eid="EXO 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />Omuriro ku guryaka, gwakwata amahwa, gwayotsya ebiba by'engano, nari ezikyemereire, nari omusiri gwona, owaatweka ogwo muriro aryariha byona ebyasya.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />Omuntu ku aribiitsya mutaahi we empiiha nari ebindi bintu, byaibirwa omu nju ye, obiibire ku ariboneka, amurihe kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Kwonka obiibire ku aribura, mukama w'enju aryairira Ruhanga haihi, kimanywe ku atarakwatsire ha bintu bya mutaahi we. <verse eid="EXO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:10">2 Bus 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba okuryangatanisa ekintu kyona, yaaba nte nari endogoya nari entaama, nari ekijwaro nari ekintu kyona ekibuzire, eki nyinakyo yaahamya ati: Nikyo eki; orubanja rwabo bombi ruryatonganirwa omu maisho ga Ruhanga; ou Ruhanga aricwera orubanja rukamusinga, aryariha mutaahi we kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />Omuntu ku arihereka mutaahi we endogoya nari ente nari entaama, nari ekitungirwe kyona ngu akiriise, kyafa, nari kyagira oku kyaba, nari kyatwarwa hataine okireebire, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:16">Heb 6:16</ref>. </char></note> habeho okurahira MUKAMA ahagati yaabo bombi, kiherekwa ku atarakwatsire ha kintu kya mutaahi we; mukama waakyo aryaikiriza okwo kurahira, onu arekye kuriha. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Kwonka ku kiriibirwa owa kiherekwa, aryariha mukama waakyo. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Ku kiritaanyagurwa enyamaishwa, areete ekiriira kyakyo kibe eky'okuhamya ku kiri ekye; obwo taririha kitaanyagwirwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />Omuntu ku aritiiza ekintu kyona ekya mutaahi we, kyasiisikara, nari kyafa, mukama waakyo atariho, buzimazima nyakukitiizibwa aryakiriha. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Kwonka mukama waakyo ku ariba ariho, tarikiriha. Kandi ku kiriba kiguririirwe, kiryagwana n'eki baakiguririire.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 22:28">Bir 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku aribeihabeiha omwishiki otakamanyaga mushaija, kandi otarikugambwa bugyenyi, yaabyama nawe, aryamujuga, amushwere. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Kwonka ishe ku aryangira kimwe kumumuhingira, aryariha enjugano nk'ezi bajuga omwishiki.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />Otariikiriza omurogikazi kugumaho.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />Oribyama n'enyamaishwa weena, aitwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:2">Kub 25:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oritambira Ruhanga ondiijo weena ekitambo, atari MUKAMA, acwekyererezibwe kimwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:33">Lev 19:33</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyaihanga otarimukora kubi, n'obu kwakuba okumuhata; ahakuba naimwe mukaba muri abanyaihanga omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:17">Isa 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Mutaribonabonesa omufaakazi weena nari efuuzi. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:9">Bir 15:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Ku murigira eki mwabaitsa, bantakira, buzimazima ndyahurira okutaka kwabo, <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />ngirire imwe ekiniga kingi, mbaitse rurara; abakazi baanyu babe abafaakazi, n'abaana baanyu babe efuuzi.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 5:7">Neh 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:8">Ezk 18:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku origuza omworo weena omu bantu bangye empiiha, otarimutwaza nk'abaihuza boona oku bagira, kandi otarimushaba enshaagi. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:8">Amo 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriba waakwatiriziibwe omwenda gwa mutaahi waawe, otarirenzya eizooba otagumugaruriire; <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />ahabw'okuba nigwo ayeshweka gwonka; nikyo kijwaro ky'omubiri gwe. Noogira ngu aryayeshweka ki? Kandi ku arintakira, ndyamuhurira; ahakuba ndi omunyambabazi.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 10:20">Mub 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:10">2 Pet 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarijuma Ruhanga, n'obu kwakuba okukyeena omutegyeki w'eihanga ryawe.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarikyerererwa kuntoijera ahari byona ebi oshaarwire, kandi n'aha by'okunywa ebirugire omu manyuukiro gaawe. Omujigaijo omuri batabani baawe oryamumpa. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Kandi nikwo oritwaza ente zaawe n'entaama zaawe; omujigaijo gwayo guryamara ebiro mushanju na nyinagwo; aha kiro kya munaana oryaguntoijera. <verse eid="EXO 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ezk 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Muryaba abantu abaanyereziibwe; n'ahabw'ekyo mutarirya enyama n'ekintu kyona eki enyamaishwa eriire, ekatsiga omu ishwa; muryaguma mukitambikire embwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 21:10">1 Bag 21:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 19:5">Enf 19:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaritwara enkuru z'ebishuba; otarikwatanisa n'omubi okuba mushinja w'eitima. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:34">Yob 31:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:23">Luk 23:23</ref>. </char></note> Otarikurata abaingi kukora ebibi; ku oryetwa kuba mushinja, otarigwera orubaju rw'abaingi okajurira eby'okusingisiriza orubanja; <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />kandi otarigwera orubaju rw'omuntu, ngu ahabw'okuba n'omworo.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 25:21">Enf 25:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oribugana ente y'omuzigu waawe, nari endogoya ye ehabire, ogimutangire. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Ku orishanga endogoya y'orikukwanga egwire n'omutwaro, otaryehuzya, okatsiga naafa kubi atyo, kureka omuhwere kugiimutsya.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:13">Yob 31:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita orubanja rw'omworo w'owaanyu, yaaba naatongana. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Oyetantare ekigambo kyona eky'ebishuba; kandi otariita otaine rubanja kandi ohikiriire; ahabw'okuba omubi tindimwihaho rubanja. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Otarirya enguzi, ahakuba enguzi eita amaisho g'abarikureeba, kandi ekiikamya ebigambo by'abataine rubanja.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />Otariita kubi omunyaihanga, haza kunu noomanya omutima gw'omunyaihanga; ahabw'okuba naimwe mukaba muri abanyaihanga omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />Oryamara emyaka mukaaga noohinga emisiri yaawe, kandi nooshaaruura ebi oyerizemu; <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />kwonka omu mwaka gwa mushanju ogirekye eraare, abooro barye ebyemerizemu; kandi ebiritsigaramu biriibwe enyamaishwa. Okwo nikwo oritwaza omusiri gwawe ogw'emizaabibu, n'ogw'emizeituuni.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 13:14">Luk 13:14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro mukaaga obe nimwo waakorera emirimo yaawe; aha kiro kya mushanju ohuumure, ente yaawe n'endogoya yaawe zihuumure, mutabani w'omuzaana waawe n'omunyaihanga bagarukwemu amaani. <verse eid="EXO 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />Mute omutima aha bi mbagambiire byona; mutarigira obu mugambire aha maziina ga baaruhanga abandi, kandi gatarihurirwa omu kanwa kaanyu.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'amagyenyi makuru ashatu omu mwaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Bir 16:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryaguma ogire obugyenyi bw'ebiro bikuru ahabwangye kashatu omu mwaka. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Oryagira obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe; omare ebiro mushanju noorya emigaati etatumbisiibwe, nk'oku naakuragiire, omu bunaku obwatairweho omu kwezi Abibu, ahakuba nikwo waarugiiremu Misri; hatarigira owaija omu maisho gangye engaro nsha. <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />Kandi oryagira obugyenyi bw'eigyesha ry'ebi waahingire omu misiri, nigwo muganuro gw'ebi waahendekyeire; kandi ku oriheza kushaaruura byona eby'omu misiri yaawe ebi waahendekyeire aha muheru gw'omwaka, oryagira obugyenyi bw'eishaaruura. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Oyetwa omushaija weena aryaija areebwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga kashatu omu mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />Otarihonga eshagama y'ekitambo, eki ntambiirwe, hamwe n'omugaati ogutumbisiibwe; kandi ebishaju by'obugyenyi bwangye otaribiraaza okuhitsya omu kasheeshe.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuganuro gw'ebirikubanza kwera omu misiri yaawe, oryaguma ogureete omu nju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. Otariteeka omwana gw'embuzi omu mahenehene ga nyinagwo.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukama okubaha maraika w'okubeebembera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />Reeba, nintuma maraika okukwebembera, n'okukurinda omu muhanda, akakuhitsya omu mwanya ogu naakuteekateekyeire. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:30">Efe 4:30</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:16">1 Yoh 5:16</ref>. </char></note> Omworobere, ohurire eiraka rye, otamugwisa kubi; ahakuba tarisaasira bicumuro byanyu; ahabw'okuba eiziina ryangye riri omuriwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Kwonka ku orihurira eiraka rye, otaireho omutima, waakora byona ebi ndikugamba, obwo ndyaba omuzigu w'abazigu baawe, n'omubisha w'ababisha baawe. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:8">Yos 24:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba maraika wangye aryakwebembera, akuhitsye omu Baamori, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abanyakanaani, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi, mbamareho. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Otariramya baaruhanga baabo, otaribaheereza, n'obu kwakuba okutwaza nkabo; kureka oryabahwerekyerereza kimwe, n'enyomyo zaabo ez'amabaare ozisheenyagure. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:15">Bir 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Muryaheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nawe aryaha eby'okurya byawe n'amaizi gaawe omugisha; kandi ndyaiha endwara omuriimwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Tihaine orirugwamu enda, nari oriba engumba omu nsi yaawe; kandi ndyahitsya omubaro gw'ebiro byawe.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 2:25">Bir 2:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:9">Yos 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 2:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyayohereza okutiinisa kwangye kukwebembere, mpahaaze emitima y'abantu boona abu orihikamu, ndeetere abazigu baawe boona kukuhunga. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Kandi ndyayohereza enwa, zikwebembere, nizo ziribinga Abahiivi n'Abanyakanaani n'Abahiiti omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:22">Bir 7:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tindibabinga mu maisho gaawe kuruga omu nsi omu mwaka gumwe gwonka, ensi etakaaba ekifurukwa, n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba zikakanya, zikakunyangaraza. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Kureka ndyababinga mporampora omu maisho gaawe, okuhitsya obu orikanya, okahungura ensi. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Bag 4:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyakuteeraho omwatano okuruga aha Nyanja erikutukura okuhika aha Nyanja y'Abafilistia, n'okuruga aha ihamba okuhika aha mugyera Furaati; ahakuba ndyahayo abantu abatwire omu nsi egyo omu mikono yaawe, obabingye barugye omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Otariragaana nabo endagaano n'obu kwakuba okuragaana na baaruhanga baabo. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:30">Bir 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:13">Yos 23:13</ref>. </char></note> Batariguma omu nsi yaawe, nyentsya bakakuncumuzaho; ahabw'okuba ku oriheereza baaruhanga baabo, buzimazima kiryakubeera omutego.<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuhamya endagaano n'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:16">Kub 11:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaagambira Musa ati: Inamuka, iwe na Arooni na Nadabu na Abihu n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli makumi mushanju, muze ei MUKAMA ari, mumuramize hangahari. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Musa wenka abe niwe yairira haihi MUKAMA, kwonka abandi batamwirira haihi; kandi abandi boona batainamuka nawe.<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa yaaza omu bantu, yaabagambira ebigambo bya MUKAMA byona n'ebiragiro byona; abantu boona baagarukiramu hamwe, nibagira bati: Ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA yaagamba, nitwija kubikora. <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Musa yaahandika ebigambo bya MUKAMA byona; kandi yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe, yaayombeka eitambiro ahansi y'orushozi, n'enyomyo ikumi na ibiri, nk'enganda za Israeli ikumi na ibiri oku zaabaire ziri. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Yaatuma abatsigazi b'omu Baisraeli, baahongyera MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, baamutambira ebitambo by'ente eby'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa yaabaganisa eshagama omu bicweka bibiri ebirikwingana; kimwe yaakita omu nyabya, ekindi yaakimiisiira aha itambiro. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Bwanyima yaakwata ekitabo ky'endagaano, yaakishomera abantu; nabo baagarukamu bati: Byona ebi MUKAMA yaagamba, nitwija kuguma nitubikora, kandi tubyorobere. <verse eid="EXO 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:20">Heb 9:20</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaatwara eshagama, yaagimiisiira abantu, naagira ati: Mureebe eshagama y'endagaano, ei MUKAMA yaaragaana naimwe, nk'ebigambo ebyo byona oku biri.<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Bwanyima Musa yainamuka na Arooni na Nadabu na Abihu n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli makumi mushanju; <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:20">Kur 33:20</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 33:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yoh 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:26">Ezk 1:26</ref>. </char></note> baareeba Ruhanga wa Israeli; ahansi y'ebigyere bye nihashusha nk'amabaare ga safiro agaariire, agarikumurinkana nk'eiguru. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:33">Bir 4:33</ref>. </char></note> Abo bakuru b'Abaisraeli Ruhanga tiyaagira ku yaabagira; kureka baamureeba, baarya, baanywa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okumara ebiro makumi ana ahari Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Inamuka, onshangye aha rushozi, ogumeyo; Nyowe niinyija kukuha ebishate by'amabaare, ebiriho ebiragiro n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi mpandiikire ngu obyegyese. <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Kur 33:11</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaimuka na Yoshua omuheereza we, yainamuka aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Ku yaabaire atakagyenzire, yaagambira abo bakuru ati: Mututegyerereze aha, okuhitsya obu turigaruka, tukabashanga aha; kandi reeba, mwatsigara na Arooni na Huuri; omuntu weena oriba aine eki arikufa, abe nibo yaareeba. <verse eid="EXO 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">Mat 17:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Musa yainamuka aha rushozi, ekicu kyarushweka. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaza aha rushozi Sinai, n'ekicu kyarushweka okumara ebiro mukaaga; aha kiro kya mushanju MUKAMA yaayeta Musa, naayema omuri ekyo kicu. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb 12:18</ref>. </char></note> Ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikaba nikishusha nk'omuriro ogurikurya busha aha mutwe gw'orushozi omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa yaataaha omu kicu, yainamuka aha rushozi; Musa yaamara ahari orwo rushozi ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okugambira Musa oku araakore Eihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:7">2 Kor 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Gambira Abaisraeli bandeetere emitoijo; mwakiire omutoijo ogu omuntu weena arantoijere, ayekundiire. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Egi niyo mitoijo yaabo ei muryakiira: ezaabu, efeeza, emiringa, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />emyenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari n'eya bafuta, obwoya bw'embuzi, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />empu z'empaya z'entaama zizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, empu z'engongi, embaaho z'eminyinya, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />amajuta g'etabaaza, eby'emigaju eby'okuta omu majuta ag'okushukaho, n'eby'okukoramu obubaane oburikutaamirana, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:15">Kur 28:15</ref>. </char></note> amabaare agarikwetwa shohamu, n'agandi mabaare ag'okuhundisa efodi n'eky'aha kifuba. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bankorere Omwanya ogurikwera, mbone kutuura ahagati omuribo. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Nk'ebi ndikwija kukworeka byona oku biri, omuringo gw'eihema n'ogw'ebintu byaryo byona, mube nikwo mwabikora.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eshanduukye y'endagaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />Baryakora eshanduukye omu munyinya; oburaingwa bwayo mikono eibiri n'ekicweka, obuhango bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka, n'obwemi bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Ogishwekye n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, ogishwekye omunda n'enyima, kandi ogyehinguririze omuguno gw'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Oyazye ezaabu, ogikoremu ebifunga bina, obite aha maguru gaayo ana, bibiri aha rubaju rumwe, kandi bibiri aha rundi. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Okore n'emigamba omu munyinya, ogishwekye n'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Ote egyo migamba omu bifunga by'omu mbaju z'eshanduukye, bagume bagiheekyese. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:8">1 Bag 8:8</ref>. </char></note> Emigamba egyo egume omu bifunga by'eshanduukye, etariihwamu.<verse eid="EXO 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:26">Bir 31:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuri egyo shanduukye oryatamu Ebirikuhamya ebi ndikuha. <verse eid="EXO 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:25">Rom 3:25</ref>. </char></note> Okore ekitebe ky'okusaasira omu zaabu eshemeziibwe; oburaingwa bwakyo mikono ebiri n'ekicweka, n'obuhango bwakyo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Kandi okore ebishushani bya baakerubi babiri omu zaabu; omu kubikora obiheeshe aha mitwe yombi ey'ekyo kitebe ky'okusaasira. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Okore ekya kerubi omwe aha mutwe gumwe, n'eky'ondi aha gundi; mubiheesherane n'ekitebe ky'okusaasira aha mitwe yaakyo yombi. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Baakerubi bashashaanure amapapa gaabo ahaiguru, bagasangize ekitebe ky'okusaasira, boorekyeraine nibareeba ekyo kitebe. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Ekitebe ky'okusaasira okite aha shanduukye, kandi omu shanduukye otemu Ebirikuhamya ebi ndikuha. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:4">Kub 17:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:1">Zab 80:1</ref>. </char></note> Aho niho ndiguma nimbugaabuganira naimwe, nkagamba naiwe ahari byona, ebi ndikugambira kuragiira Abaisraeli, niinyema ahaiguru y'ekitebe ky'okusaasira, ahagati ya baakerubi abari aha shanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'Emeeza y'emigaati y'okumurika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:48">1 Bag 7:48</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryabaija emeeza omu munyinya; oburaingwa bwayo mikono ebiri, obuhango bwayo mukono gumwe, n'obwemi bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Ogishwekye n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, ogiteho omuguno gw'ezaabu gugyehinguririze. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Ogikorere ebizingiti okugyehinguririza, obuhango bwabyo ekita kimwe, nabyo obiteho omuguno gw'ezaabu, gubyehinguririze. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Ogikorere ebifunga bina by'ezaabu, obite aha maguru gaayo, aha nkokora zaayo ina. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Ebifunga ebyo bize haihi n'ebizingiti, bibe eby'okutamu emigamba ey'okuheeka emeeza. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Egyo migamba ogibaije omu munyinya, ogishwekye n'ezaabu, ebe ey'okuheekyesa emeeza. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Okore enyabya zaayo n'ebikopo byayo, kandi okore emidumo yaayo n'ebakuri zaayo eby'okushukisibwa empongano; obiheeshe omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5">Lev 24:5</ref>. </char></note> Ogume ote ahari egyo meeza emigaati ey'okumurika, ebe omu maisho gangye obutoosha.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'ekikondo ky'etabaaza y'ezaabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:12">Kush 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora ekikondo ky'etabaaza omu zaabu eshemeziibwe; omu kukikora okiheeshere hamwe; ekibunu kyakyo n'omukono gwakyo n'ebikopo byakyo n'ebintu ebyebumburikire byakyo n'ebirabyo byakyo, biheesheranwe nakyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Kigire amataagi mukaaga agarikuruga ahari ogwo mukono, ashatu aha rubaju rumwe, n'ashatu aha rundi; <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />aha itaagi rimwe habeho ebikopo bishatu ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, hamwe n'ekintu ekyebumburikire n'ekirabyo kyakyo; aha itaagi erindi habeho ebikopo bishatu ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, hamwe n'ekintu ekyebumburikire n'ekirabyo kyakyo; goona omukaaga nk'oku garikuruga aha mukono gw'etabaaza gabe nikwo gaaba. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Ogwo mukono gw'etabaaza gugire ebikopo bina ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, n'ebintu ebyebumburikire n'ebirabyo byabyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Ekintu ekyebumburikire kiheesheranwe n'omukono gw'etabaaza ahansi ya buri mataagi abiri agarikugurugaho; goona omukaaga gabe nikwo gaaba. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Ebyebumburikire n'amataagi eby'ogwo mukono bibe biheesherainwe nagwo omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:3">Lev 24:3</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 24:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Oheeshe amatabaaza gaakyo mushanju; bagume bagate ahu garikubaasa kwakira, gakahwezesa omwanya ogugari omu maisho. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Empana zaago n'otusohaani twago biryaba biheesirwe omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Ekikondo ky'amatabaaza n'ebintu byago byona biryakorwa omu zaabu eshemeziibwe ey'oburemeezi bw'etalanta emwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:5">Heb 8:5</ref>. </char></note> Oteho omutima kubiheesha, nooreebera aha ky'okureeberaho kyabyo, eki oyorekyeirwe aha rushozi oru.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okukora Eihema n'Obutaaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:2-5">Heb 8:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora Obutaaho n'emikingo ikumi; ogikore n'emyenda ya kitaani n'eya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari; ogitemu ebishushani bya baakerubi ebikozirwe abanyamwoga baabyo. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Oburaingwa bwa buri mukingo bube mikono makumi abiri na munaana, n'obuhango bwagwo mikono ena; emikingo ebe ey'orugyero rumwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Emikingo etaano eteeranwe hamwe, n'endiijo etaano eteeranwe okwayo. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:2">Kol 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="COL 2:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Obaziire obufunga bwa bururu aha mukugiro ogw'aharubaju rw'emikingo etaano ey'okubanza, n'aha mukugiro gw'aha rubaju rw'emikingo endiijo etaano. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Ote obufunga makumi ataano aha mukingo gumwe oguteeraine, n'obundi makumi ataano aha mukugiro gw'omukingo ogwa kabiri; obwo bufunga bureebane. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Kandi okore ebikwatsi by'ezaabu makumi ataano, obikwatanisise egyo mikingo; obutaaho bube bumwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />Kandi oryakora emikingo y'obwoya bw'embuzi ey'okushakaara; okore emikingo ikumi na gumwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Oburaingwa bwa buri mukingo bube mikono makumi ashatu, n'obuhango bwagwo mikono ena; egyo mikingo yoona ikumi na gumwe ebe ey'orugyero rumwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Emikingo etaano ogiteerane okwayo; n'emikingo mukaaga okwayo ogwa mukaaga ogukube, gureereetere omu maisho g'eihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Kandi okore obufunga makumi ataano aha mukugiro gw'omukingo ogurikuheererukayo omu y'okubanza, n'obundi makumi ataano aha mukugiro ogw'omukingo ogurikuheererukayo omu ya kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Okore ebikwatsi by'emiringa makumi ataano, obite omu bufunga, oteerane eihema, ribe rimwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Ekicweka ky'omukingo ekiraatsigare aha mikingo y'eihema, nikyo kicweka ky'omukingo ekirikushaagaho, kireereetere enyima y'obutaaho. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Mukono gumwe ogw'emikingo y'obwoya bw'embuzi ogurikushaaga aha rubaju oru n'oru aha buraingwa bw'emikingo y'eihema ereereetere aha mbaju zombi ez'obutaaho, erishwekye. <verse eid="EXO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Kandi okore eby'okushweka Eihema omu mpu z'empaya z'entaama ezizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, kandi otungikyeho eky'okushakaara ekindi ekikozirwe omu mpu z'engongi.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />Kandi oryabaija embaaho z'obutaaho omu munyinya, ozeemereze; <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />oburaingwa bwa buri rubaaho rube mikono ikumi, obuhango bwarwo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka; <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />okore endimi ibiri omuri buri rubaaho okuruteerana na rugyenzi rwarwo; obe nikwo waakora embaaho zoona ez'obutaaho. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo oteho embaaho z'obutaaho makumi abiri, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:27">Kur 38:27</ref>. </char></note> kandi okore ebiina makumi ana omu feeza eby'okubyaramu ezo mbaaho makumi abiri; ebiina bibiri ahansi y'orubaaho rumwe ahabw'endimi zaarwo zombi, n'ebindi biina bibiri ahansi y'orundi rubaaho ahabw'endimi zaarwo. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Aha rubaju rw'obutaaho orwa kabiri, oruri aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, habeho embaaho makumi abiri, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />n'ebiina byazo by'efeeza makumi ana, ebiina bibiri ahansi y'orubaaho rumwe, n'ebindi bibiri ahansi y'orundi. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Kandi okore embaaho mukaaga ahabw'orubaju rw'obutaaho orw'enyima orurikureeba oburengyerwa-izooba; <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />okore n'embaaho ibiri ez'enshonda z'obutaaho aha mbaju zombi ez'enyima. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Ezo mbaaho ahansi zitaane, kwonka ahaiguru ziteeranire aha mpeta ey'okubanza; zombi zibe nikwo zaaba; zibe ez'okuhamya ezo nshonda zombi. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Aho habeho embaaho munaana n'ebiina byazo by'efeeza, ebiina byona ikumi na mukaaga; ahansi y'orubaaho rumwe ebiina bibiri, n'ahansi y'orundi bibiri.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:1">Rom 15:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi okore embazi itaano omu munyinya ahabw'embaaho z'orubaju rumwe rw'obutaaho, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />ezindi itaano ahabw'embaaho z'orundi rubaju; n'ezindi itaano ahabw'embaaho z'orubaju rw'obutaaho orw'enyima orurikureeba oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Orubazi rw'ahagati y'ezindi rwogyemu, ruhikye oku n'oku. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Ezo mbaaho ozishwekye n'ezaabu, oheeshe empeta z'ezaabu ez'okurabyamu ezo mbazi; nazo ozishwekye n'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Oryayemereza obutaaho bushushane n'eky'okureeberaho eki oyorekirwe aha rushozi oru.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'Omukingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:45">Luk 23:45</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:3">Heb 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora omukingo gwa bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani, ogutemu ebishushani bya baakerubi ebikozirwe abanyamwoga baabyo. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Oguhanikye aha nyomyo ez'eminyinya ina ezishwekirwe n'ezaabu, n'eby'okuhanikaho by'ezaabu; ezo nyomyo ina zibyarwe omu biina by'efeeza bina. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:11">Yos 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Kush 11:19</ref>. </char></note> Omukingo ogwo oguhanikye ahansi y'ebikwatsi biri. Bwanyima ote eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya omunda y'omukingo; omukingo ogwo guryaba ogw'okutaanisa Omwanya ogurikwera n'Omwanya ogurikwera munonga; <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:5">Heb 9:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ote ekitebe kiri ky'okusaasira aha shanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya omu Mwanya ogurikwera munonga. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Kandi emeeza eri ogite kunu y'omukingo; aharikureebana nayo omu butaaho oteho ekikondo ky'etabaaza, kize aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, kandi emeeza eze aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa bumosho.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />Kandi oryakora omukingo gw'okukinga aha muryango gw'eihema, ogukore omu myenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, gutariizemu amabara gacwereraine. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Kandi ogwo mukingo ogukorere enyomyo z'eminyinya itaano, ozishwekye n'ezaabu; eby'okuhanikaho byazo bibe eby'ezaabu; kandi oyazye omuringa, ogukoremu ebiina byazo bitaano.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s1">Eitambiro ry'ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebintu byaryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 43:13">Ezk 43:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora eitambiro omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwaryo mikono etaano, obuhango bwaryo mikono etaano, embaju zoona zingaingane; obwemi bwaryo bube mikono eshatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:50">1 Bag 1:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:27">Zab 118:27</ref>. </char></note> Aha nshonda zaaryo ina oribaijeho amahembe ana; ago mahembe gabaiziranwe naryo; orishwekye n'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Oriheeshere eby'okuyooreraho eiju ryaryo n'eby'okuriyooresa n'enyabya n'eby'okwihuza enyama n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro; ebyo bintu byaryo byona obiheeshe omu miringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Oriheeshere ekintu ekishobeekaine nk'ekigoye, okiheeshe omu muringa; okiheeshere ebifunga by'emiringa bina, obite aha nshonda zaakyo ina; <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />okite ahansi y'omuguno ogwehinguririize eitambiro, kirugye ahansi, kihikye rwagati y'eitambiro. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Kandi obaijere eitambiro emigamba omu munyinya, ogishwekye n'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Egyo migamba yaaryo ogite omu bifunga, eze embaju zombi z'eitambiro, ebe ey'okuriheekyesa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Oribaije omu mbaaho, omunda ribe omurangara; barikore nk'oku oryorekirwe aha rushozi oru.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'orugo rw'Obutaaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />Kandi oryakora ekibuga ky'Obutaaho; aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo orugo rube orw'emikingo ya kitaani, oburaingwa bwayo mikono igana aha rubaju rumwe; <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />orwo rugo rugire enyomyo makumi abiri, n'ebiina by'okuzitamu makumi abiri; bibe eby'emiringa; eby'okuhanikaho eby'ahari ezo nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo bibe eby'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Kandi n'aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho orugo rube orw'emikingo, oburaingwa bwayo mikono igana; enyomyo zaarwo makumi abiri n'ebiina byazo makumi abiri bibe eby'emiringa, kandi eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo bibe eby'efeeza.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba narwo habeyo emikingo, obuhango bwayo mikono makumi ataano; enyomyo zaayo zibe ikumi, n'ebiina byazo nabyo ikumi. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Orubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba narwo obuhango bwarwo bube mikono etaano. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Emikingo y'orugo rw'aha rubaju rumwe rw'eirembo ebe mikono ikumi n'etaano, enyomyo zaayo zibe ishatu, n'ebiina byazo nabyo bibe bishatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Orundi rubaju rwaryo narwo rugire orugo rw'emikingo ya mikono ikumi n'etaano; enyomyo zaayo zibe ishatu, n'ebiina byazo nabyo bibe bishatu.<verse eid="EXO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Kandi eirembo ry'orwo rugo rigire omukingo gwa mikono makumi abiri obuhango, ogukozirwe omu myenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, gutariizemu amabara gacwereraine; enyomyo zaagwo zibe ina, n'ebiina byazo bibe bina. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Enyomyo zoona ez'orwo rugo ziteebweho obufunga bw'efeeza; eby'okuhanikaho byazo bibe eby'efeeza, n'ebiina byazo bibe eby'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Oburaingwa bw'ekibuga kyona bube mikono igana n'obukiika bwakyo mikono makumi ataano embaju zoona, n'obwemi bw'orugo bube mikono etaano; rube orw'emyenda ya kitaani, kandi ebiina by'enyomyo zaarwo bibe eby'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Ebintu byona eby'Obutaaho n'eby'okubukoresa byona n'enkondo zaabwo zoona n'enkondo z'orugo zoona bibe eby'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />Kandi oryaragiira Abaisraeli bakureetere amajuta marungi agashekwirwe omu mizeituuni ahabw'okuhemba, gabe ag'okwatsya etabaaza obutoosha. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:8">Kur 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:11">2 Bus 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu enyima y'omukingo ogukingiire Ebirikuhamya Arooni n'abatabani babe niho baaguma nibashemereza etabaaza, egume neeyakira omu maisho ga MUKAMA, okuruga omu mwabazyo okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. Kibe ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona eki Abaisraeli bashemereire kworobera omu busingye bwabo bwona.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ebijwaro by'Abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:1-3">Kub 16:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:1-4">Heb 5:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oyeirize Arooni mukuru waawe n'abatabani, Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazaari na Itamaari, obaihe omu Baisraeli, bankorere omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:26-28">Kub 20:26-28</ref>. </char></note> Okorere Arooni mukuru waawe ebijwaro birikwera, bimuhaise ekitiinisa n'okureebeka gye. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:7-11">1 Kor 12:7-11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ogambire boona abarikumanya munonga kubaziira, abu nyijwize omwoyo gw'obwengye, bakore ebijwaro bya Arooni okumushoroora, abone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Ebijwaro ebi baraakore nibyo ebi eky'aha kifuba, efodi, ekanzu yaayo, n'ekooti y'akatimba, ekikwemba n'eky'okwezirikisa; kandi bakorere Arooni mukuru waawe n'abatabani ebijwaro birikwera, babone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Batware eby'okukoresa, ezaabu, emyenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya bafuta.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Efodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 39:2">Kur 39:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efodi baryagikoresa ezaabu n'emyenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, abahangu baabyo babe nibo baagikora. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Egire ebiremu bibiri aha mabega, biteerane emikugiro yaayo yombi, efodi ebone kuteeranwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Eky'okwezirikisa ekigikoreirweho, ekirukirwe abanyamwoga, kikorwe nkayo, kandi kirukwe omu bintu bimwe n'ebyayo, ezaabu, emyenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Kandi ogire amabaare abiri agarikwetwa shohamu, ogasharureho amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli; <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />amaziina gaabo mukaaga ogahandiikye aha ibaare rimwe, n'amaziina g'abandi mukaaga ogahandiikye aha rindi, nk'oku barikukuratana omu bukuru bwabo. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Nk'oku omusharuzi asharura aha ibaare akamanyiso, obe nikwo waasharura ahari ago mabaare gombi amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli; ogahamise ezaabu ekwegire. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Ago mabaare ogate aha biremu bya efodi eby'aha mabega, gabe ag'okwijukiraho abaana ba Israeli; kandi Arooni aryaguma atware amaziina gaabo aha mabega ge gombi omu maisho ga MUKAMA kuba ekiijutsyo.<verse eid="EXO 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Okore omu zaabu ekwegire eby'okuhamya amabaare, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />n'emikuufu y'ezaabu eshemeziibwe ebiri, ogikore omu zaabu ehotoire nk'omugoye guhotoire. <verse eid="EXO 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref>. </char></note> Okore n'eky'aha kifuba eky'okumanyisa eby'oburyo, ekikozirwe omunyamwoga; okikore nk'oku efodi ekozirwe, okikore omu zaabu, omu myenda ya bururu, omu ya bujwa, omu ya karari, n'omu ya kitaani, <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />kingane embaju zoona kikubiraine, oburaingwa bwakyo bube ekita, n'obuhango bwakyo nabwo ekita. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Okiteho emishorongo y'amabaare ena; omushorongo ogw'okubanza gubemu amabaare aga sarudio, topazi na barekesi, <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />omushorongo gwa kabiri simaragido, safiro na arimasi, <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />omushorongo gwa kashatu huwakinto, kalukedoni na amesuusito, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />n'omushorongo ogwa kana berulo, shohamu na yasipi; goona gahamibwe omu zaabu ekwegire. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Ago mabaare garyaba ikumi n'abiri, nk'amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli oku gari; gahandiikwe nk'oku basharura akamanyiso, buri rimwe rihandiikweho eiziina ryaryo, ahabw'enganda ikumi na ibiri. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Kandi okorere eky'aha kifuba emikuufu ehotoire nk'emigoye ekozire omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Oheeshere eky'aha kifuba empeta z'ezaabu ibiri, ozite aha nshonda zombi ez'aha mutwe gwakyo, <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />orabye emikuufu y'ezaabu yombi omuri ezo mpeta ez'aha nshonda zombi ez'eky'aha kifuba; <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />emitwe yombi ey'emikuufu yombi ogikome aha by'okuhamya amabaare, obone kukikwatsa aha biremu bya efodi eby'aha mabega aha rubaju rwabyo orw'omumaisho. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Kandi okore ezindi mpeta z'ezaabu ibiri, ozite aha nshonda ibiri ez'omukugiro gw'eky'aha kifuba ogw'omunda, aha rubaju oruri haihi na efodi. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Kandi okore empeta z'ezaabu ibiri, ozite aha mukugiro gw'ahansi ogw'ebiremu bibiri eby'aha mabega omu maisho, ahu birikuteeranira n'eky'okwezirikisa efodi ekirukirwe abanyamwoga. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Kandi eky'aha kifuba bakikome aha mpeta za efodi, bakikomese otwenda twa bururu nibaturabya omu mpeta zaakyo, kibone kuza aha ky'okwezirikisa kya efodi, ekirukirwe abanyamwoga, eky'aha kifuba kirekye kuyuga kikataana na efodi. <verse eid="EXO 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 8:6">Kyesh 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:24">Heb 9:24</ref>. </char></note> Arooni aryaguma ajware aha mutima gwe amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli agahandiikirwe aha ky'aha kifuba eky'okumanyisa eby'oburyo, yaaba naataaha omu Mwanya ogurikwera, kuba ekiijutsyo omu maisho ga MUKAMA obutoosha. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Sam 28:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:63">Ezr 2:63</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu ky'aha kifuba eky'okumanyisa eby'oburyo oryatamu Urimu na Tumimu, bibe biri aha mutima gwa Arooni yaaba naaza omu maisho ga MUKAMA; Arooni aryatwara orubanja rw'Abaisraeli aha mutima gwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA obutoosha.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:14">2 Sam 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora ekanzu ya efodi, yoona ebe bururu. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Egire ebitsya by'okurabyamu omutwe; egire n'omutarizo ogurukire okwehinguririza ebitsya byayo, nk'oku bakora ebitsya by'ekijwaro kya kitaani, ngu etataaguka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Aha mukugiro gwayo ogw'ahansi obaziireho ebirikushusha amakoma-mahanga ebirukire omu huuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari, bigwehinguririze; ohundemu amajugo g'ezaabu, gagyende nigaza ahagati yaabyo, <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />eijugo ry'ezaabu rikuratwe eikoma-mahanga, eijugo ry'ezaabu eikoma-mahanga, bityo bityo, okwehinguririza omukugiro gw'ekanzu gwona. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Arooni agume agijware, yaaba naaza kuheereza; ago majugo gagambe, yaaba naaza omu Mwanya ogurikwera omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kandi naarugayo, atakaafa.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:20">Zek 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:26">Heb 7:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora ekipande ky'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, okisharureho enyuguta, ezirikushusha nk'akamanyiso kasharwirwe aha ibaare, ezihandiikirwe ngu: Oyereziibwe MUKAMA; <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />okite aha kikwemba, obikwatanise n'otwenda twa bururu, kize omu maisho g'ekyo kikwemba. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:11">Isa 53:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kipande kigume aha buso bwa Arooni, kandi Arooni aryayekorera okutahikiirira kw'Abaisraeli oku barishiisha bareetsire empongano zaabo ezirikwera; kigume aha buso bwe obutoosha, zibone kwikirizibwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />Ekooti oryagiruka omuri bafuta, n'ekyo kikwemba nakyo okikore omuri bafuta, kandi eky'okwezirikisa ekyo okitarizemu amabara gacwereraine. <verse eid="EXO 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:17">Ezk 44:17</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 44:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Batabani ba Arooni obakorere ekooti n'eby'okwezirikisa n'enkofiira, okubahaisa ekitiinisa n'okureebeka gye. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:30">Kur 30:30</ref>. </char></note> Obijwekye Arooni mukuru waawe hamwe n'abatabani; kandi obashukyeho amajuta, obashoroore, obeeze, babone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Kandi obakorere empare za kitaani, bazijware, barekye kujwara busha; ezo mpare zirugye omu bwezirikiro zihikye omu bibero; <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />zijwarwe Arooni n'abatabani, baaba nibaza omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, nari baaba nibaza aha itambiro kuheereza omu Mwanya ogurikwera, batakaayereetaho orubanja, bakafa. Ekyo kiryaba ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona ahariwe n'aha baijukuru abarimukurata.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s1">Okushoroorwa kw'Abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />Oku nikwo oritwaza noobeeza kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamura. Oryatwara enimi nto, empaya z'entaama ibiri ezitaine kamogo, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:20-22">Lev 6:20-22</ref>. </char></note> emigaati etatumbisiibwe, otugaati twa keeki otutatumbisiibwe oturimu amajuta g'emizeituuni, na capati ezitatumbisiibwe ezisiigirweho amajuta; obikore omu saano y'engano ey'obunono; <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />obite omu kiibo kimwe, obireete hamwe n'egyo nimi n'ezo mpaya ibiri. <verse eid="EXO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:12">Kur 40:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Arooni n'abatabani obareete aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, oboozye n'amaizi. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Bwanyima oiheyo ebijwaro, ojwekye Arooni ekooti n'ekanzu ya efodi, na efodi, n'eky'aha kifuba; omuzirikye n'eky'okwezirikisa ekirukirwe abanyamwoga eky'ahari efodi; <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />omujwekye ekikwemba omu mutwe; aha kikwemba oteho ekirunga kirikwera. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima oiheyo amajuta ag'okushukaho, ogamushukye aha mutwe, ogamushoroorese. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Kandi oreete n'abatabani, obajwekye ekooti; <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Arooni n'abatabani obazirikye n'eby'okwezirikisa, kandi obajwekye enkofiira, obunyamurwa bube obwabo, buhamibwe ekiragiro ekitarihwaho. Okwo nikwo orishoroora Arooni n'abatabani.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 8:14">Lev 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima oryareeta enimi omu maisho g'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, Arooni n'abatabani bate engaro zaabo aha mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Oitire enimi omu maisho ga MUKAMA aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />otware aha shagama y'enimi, ogisiigye aha mahembe g'eitambiro n'orukumu rwawe; eshagama eraatsigareho ogishukye ahansi aha kibunu ky'eitambiro; <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:3">Lev 3:3</ref>. </char></note> otware ebishaju byona ebishwekire amara, ekishaabo ky'aha kitugu, entsigo zombi n'ebishaju ebiziriho, obyokyeze aha itambiro. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:11">Heb 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka enyama z'egyo nimi, oruhu rwayo n'efa yaayo, obyokyeze kimwe aheeru y'orusiisira; ekyo n'ekitambo ky'ekibi. <verse eid="EXO 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oryareeta emwe ahari ezo mpaya z'entaama; Arooni n'abatabani bate engaro zaabo aha mutwe gwayo; <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />bwanyima ogiite, otware eshagama yaayo, ogishukyere embaju zoona ez'eitambiro; <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />omutumbi gwayo ogucwemu ebicweka, oyozye amara gaayo n'amaguru gaayo, obiteerane n'ebindi bicweka byayo n'omutwe gwayo. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:21">Kut 8:21</ref>. </char></note> Egyo mpaya yoona ogyokyeze kimwe aha itambiro; ekyo n'ekitambo ekyokize ahari MUKAMA; kandi n'empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA, ey'ekisooroora kirungi.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />Oryatwara endiijo mpaya, Arooni n'abatabani bate engaro zaabo aha mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Bwanyima ogiite, otware aha shagama yaayo, ogisiigye aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kwa Arooni n'aha nshonga z'amatu ga buryo ag'abatabani, n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'engaro zaabo eza buryo, n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'ebigyere byabo ebya buryo; eshagama eraatsigareho ogishukyere embaju zoona ez'eitambiro. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:26-30">Lev 8:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:22">Heb 9:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi otware aha shagama ey'aha itambiro n'aha majuta ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, obimiisiire Arooni n'ebijwaro bye, n'abatabani n'ebijwaro byabo, abe oyeziibwe n'ebijwaro bye, n'abatabani n'ebijwaro byabo.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />Kandi oryatwara ebishaju by'egyo mpaya n'omukira gwayo ogw'ebishaju, n'ebishaju byayo ebishwekire eby'omunda, n'ekishaabo ky'ekitugu kyayo, n'entsigo zombi n'ebishaju ebiziriho, n'ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo; ahakuba egyo n'empaya y'entaama ey'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa; <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />otware n'omugaati gumwe, n'akagaati kamwe ka keeki akarimu amajuta na capati emwe, obiihe omu kiibo ky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe etuura omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Ebyo byona obite omu ngaro za Arooni n'abatabani, babizongazongye, ebe empongano ezongazongiibwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />bwanyima obiihe omu ngaro zaabo, obyotsye n'ekitambo ekirikwokibwa aha itambiro, kibe ekisooroora kirungi omu maisho ga MUKAMA; egyo n'empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro ehongyeirwe MUKAMA.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />Kandi oryatwara enkoro y'egyo mpaya y'entaama ey'okushoroorwa kwa Arooni, ogizongazongyeze omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ebe empongano ezongazongiibwe; enkoro egyo eryaba omugabo gwawe. <verse eid="EXO 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:3">Bir 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oyeze egyo nkoro y'empongano ezongazongiibwe, n'ekivune ky'empongano erikwihwaho ahari egyo mpaya y'entaama ey'okushoroorwa, kibe ekya Arooni n'abatabani. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ekivune ekyo kiryaguma kibe ekya Arooni n'abatabani eki Abaisraeli bashemereire kubaha ebiro byona, ahakuba n'empongano erikwihwa omu mpongano z'Abaisraeli ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; niyo mpongano yaabo ei baihaho ahabwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />Kandi ebijwaro ebirikwera ebya Arooni biryaba eby'abatabani abarimukurata, babe nibyo baashukirwamu amajuta, kandi babe nibyo baashoroorerwamu. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Omutabani oriba omunyamurwa omu mwanya gwe, aryamara ebiro mushanju naabijwara, yaaba naaza omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, okuheereza omu Mwanya ogurikwera.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />Kandi oryatwara empaya y'entaama ey'okushoroorwa kw'omunyamurwa, oteekyere enyama yaayo omu mwanya gwona ogurikwera; <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:4">Mat 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Arooni n'abatabani barye egyo nyama y'empaya y'entaama n'omugaati oguri omu kiibo, babiriire aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:40">Kub 16:40</ref>. </char></note> Kandi barye ebyo bintu ebihongirwe ahabw'okubashoroora n'okubeeza; kwonka otari munyamurwa ataribiryaho, ahakuba n'ebirikwera. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Ku harigira enyama nari omugaati ebyatsigara aha by'okushoroora okuhitsya omu kasheeshe, oryabyotsya omu muriro; tibiririibwa, ahakuba n'ebirikwera. <verse eid="EXO 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />Okwo nikwo oritwaza Arooni n'abatabani nka byona ebi nkuragiire oku biri; oryamara ebiro mushanju noobeeza. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:11">Heb 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Buri izooba oryahayo enimi ey'okuhonga ahabw'ekibi, ebe empongano; kandi oryayeza eitambiro, ku oriba noorihongyerera; kandi orishukyeho amajuta ahabw'okuryeza. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:29">Kur 30:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:19">Mat 23:19</ref>. </char></note> Oryamara ebiro mushanju noohongyerera eitambiro, nooryeza; ribe eririkwera munonga; kyona ekirikora ahari eryo itambiro kiryaba ekirikwera.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 3:3">Ezr 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nibyo origuma noohongyera aha itambiro; buri izooba oryaguma nootamba abaana b'entaama babiri abahikize omwaka; <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />omu kasheeshe ohongye omwana gw'entaama gumwe, n'omu mwabazyo ohongye ogundi; <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />kandi hamwe n'ogwo mwana gw'entaama ohe ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi ekya eefa y'esaano y'obunono ejwangize n'ekicweka kimwe kya kana kya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiini n'endengo erikwingana galloni emwe. </char></note>hiini y'amajuta g'emizeituuni agashekwirwe, kandi ekicweka kimwe kya kana kya hiini ya viinyo, kuba empongano y'eky'okunywa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Zab 141:2</ref>. </char></note> Ogundi mwana gw'entaama oryaguhonga omu mwabazyo, nagwo oguhongye n'empongano y'esaano n'ey'eky'okunywa, nk'eby'omu kasheeshe, kuba ekisooroora ekirungi, empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Omu busingye bwanyu bwona kiryaguma kibe ekitambo ky'okwotsya, nikitambirwa aha muryango gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ahu ndibugaabuganira naimwe, nkagamba naiwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:7">Hag 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Aho niho ndibugaabuganira n'Abaisraeli; kandi eryo Ihema riryayezibwa ekitiinisa kyangye. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Ndyayeza eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'eitambiro; kandi Arooni n'abatabani ndyabeeza, babone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:10">Zek 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyaguma omu Baisraeli, mbe Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nabo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, ngu ngume omuribo. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyoterero ky'obubaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 8:3">Kush 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryakora ekyoterero ky'obubaane, okibaije omu munyinya; <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />oburaingwa bwakyo kibe mukono gumwe, obuhango bwakyo nabwo mukono gumwe, kiingaingane embaju zoona, obwemi bwakyo kibe mikono ebiri, kandi amahembe gaakyo gabaiziranwe nakyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Okishwekye n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, ahaiguru n'omu mbaju zaakyo n'aha mahembe gaakyo; kandi okiteho omuguno gw'ezaabu gukyehinguririze. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Okiheeshere ebifunga bibiri by'ezaabu, obite ahansi y'omuguno gwakyo aha mbaju zaakyo zombi, bibe eby'okutamu emigamba y'okukiheekyesa. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Egyo migamba ogibaije omu minyinya, ogishwekye n'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Okite omu maisho g'omukingo ogukingiire eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'okusaasira ekiri ahaiguru y'Ebirikuhamya, ahu ndiguma nimbugaabuganira naiwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Arooni aryayotereraho obubaane obw'emigaju erikutaamirana, abwotere buri kasheeshe, yaaba naashemeza amatabaaza; <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />kandi n'omu mwabazyo, Arooni yaaba naahemba amatabaaza, abwotere, bube obubaane oburiguma nibwoterwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA obutoosha omu busingye bwanyu bwona. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1">Lev 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Mutarikyotereraho obubaane obw'ogundi muringo, n'obu kyakuba ekitambo ekyokize, nari empongano y'esaano; kandi mutarikishukaho empongano yoona ey'ebyokunywa. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Rimwe omu mwaka Arooni aheere aha mahembe gaakyo eky'okurihiirira; eshagama y'empongano ey'okurihiirira ekibi abe niyo yaarihiirira eryo itambiro rimwe omu mwaka omu busingye bwanyu bwona; n'ekirikwera munonga ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:2">2 Sam 24:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:24">Yob 33:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:45">Mak 10:45</ref>. </char></note> Ku oribara Abaisraeli, buri muntu areetere MUKAMA eky'okucungura amagara ge omuri orwo rubaro, abantu batakaateerwa rufu noobabara. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:24">Mat 17:24</ref>. </char></note> Eki nikyo omuntu weena, ohikire kuza omu barikubarwa, ariha; ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri kya shekeli, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku erikwingana, (shekeli emwe neingana geera makumi abiri); ekyo kicweka kya shekeli kibe eky'okuhongyera MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Buri muntu weena ohikire kuza omu barikubarwa, ohikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, aryaha MUKAMA eky'okuhonga ekyo; <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Byak 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18">1 Pet 1:18</ref>. </char></note> abatungi batarirenzya aha kicweka kya shekeli, n'abooro batarikicwaho, mwaba nimuha MUKAMA eky'okurihiirira amagara gaanyu. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Oryaiha aha Baisraeli efeeza ez'okubarihiirira, ozite aha murimo gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, zibeere Abaisraeli ekiijutsyo ky'okubaijukiraho omu maisho ga MUKAMA, okurihiirira amagara gaanyu.<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'ekinaabiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />Oryaheesha ekinaabiro omu miringa, n'ekibunu kyakyo obe nimwo waakiheesha, kibe eky'okunaabiramu; okite ahagati y'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu n'eitambiro; kandi okitemu amaizi. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Omwo nimwo Arooni n'abatabani bariguma nibanaabira engaro zaabo n'ebigyere byabo; <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />baaba nibaza kutaaha omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, bagume banaabe amaizi batakaafa, nari baaba nibaza aha itambiro okukora omurimo gwabo gw'okwotsya empongano ey'okwotsya omu muriro ey'okuhongyera MUKAMA; <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />banaabe engaro zaabo n'ebigyere byabo batakaafa; kibabeere ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona, we n'oruzaaro rwe omu busingye bwabo bwona.<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:8">Zab 45:8</ref>. </char></note> Otware eby'emigaju erikuhita endiijo yoona, shekeli magana ataano za sumuruna y'amaizi, shekeli magana abiri na makumi ataano z'omudarasiini ogurikutaamirana, shekeli magana abiri na makumi ataano za kaane erikutaamirana, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na shekeli magana ataano za kasiya, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri; kandi na hiini emwe y'amajuta g'emizeituuni. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Obijwanzye, bibe amajuta agarikwera ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, emigaju ejwangiibwe abanyamwoga; gabe amajuta agarikwera ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:10">Lev 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Ogashukye aha ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'aha shanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />n'aha meeza n'ebintu byayo byona, n'aha kikondo ky'etabaaza n'ebintu byakyo, n'aha kyoterero ky'obubaane, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />n'aha itambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo n'ebintu byaryo byona, n'aha kinaabiro n'ekibunu kyakyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Obyeze, bibe ebirikwera munonga. Ekiribikoraho kyona kiryaba ekirikwera. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Kandi ogashukye ahari Arooni n'abatabani, obeeze, babone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Kandi ogambire Abaisraeli oti: Aga garyaba amajuta aganyereziibwe ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora omu busingye bwanyu bwona. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Gatarishukwa aha mubiri gw'omuntu weena otari munyamurwa kandi mutarikora agandi agajwangize nkago; n'agarikwera, naimwe garyababeera agarikwera. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Orijwanzya amajuta agarikushushana nago, nari origashuka aha muntu otari munyamurwa, aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Otware eby'emigaju egi erikutaamirana, natafi, shekelesi, na kelibena, eby'emigaju ebyo hamwe n'ogundi ogurikwetwa lebona; byona bibe nibinganisa oburemeezi. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Obikoremu obubaane, nk'oku abanyamwoga baabwo babijwanzya, otemu omwonyo, bube obushemeire kandi oburikwera; <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />otwareho bukye, obuhonde, obunozye, obute omu maisho g'Ebirikuhamya omu ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ahu ndibugaabuganira naiwe; naimwe buryababeera oburikwera munonga. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Kandi obubaane obu orikora bujwangire nk'obwo, otaribwejwangiza; buryakubeera obwereziibwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Orijwanzya obubaane oburikushushana nabwo, kubukoresa nk'omugaju, acuubwe omu ihanga rye.<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okutoorana ab'okukora eihema n'ebintu byaryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 35:30">Kur 35:30</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, naayeta Bezaleeli omu iziina mutabani wa Uuri, mwene Huuri, ow'omuruganda rwa Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 35:31">Kur 35:31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:14">1 Bag 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:4-8">1 Kor 12:4-8</ref>. </char></note> Naamwijuza Omwoyo wa Ruhanga n'obwengye n'okwetegyereza n'okumanya n'obuhangu bwona obw'okukora; <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />okugunja emirimo y'obuhangu, okuheesha ezaabu n'efeeza n'emiringa, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />okubaija amabaare ag'okuhunda omu bintu, okusharura ebibaizirwe omu miti, n'okukora emirimo y'emiringo yoona. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 35:34">Kur 35:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, naamutaho Oholiabu, mwene Ahisamaaki, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani. Kandi boona abaine omutima ogurikwetegyereza, naabaha obwengye, ngu bakore ebi naakuragiira byona, <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya, ekitebe ky'okusaasira ekigifundikiire, n'ebintu byona eby'Eihema, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />n'emeeza n'ebintu byayo, n'ekikondo ky'etabaaza eky'ezaabu eshemeziibwe n'ebintu byakyo byona, n'ekyoterero ky'obubaane, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />n'eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo n'ebintu byaryo byona, n'ekinaabiro n'ekibunu kyakyo, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />n'ebijwaro ebibaziirwe gye, n'ebijwaro ebirikwera ebya Arooni omunyamurwa n'eby'abatabani, eby'okujwara nibakora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />n'amajuta ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'obubaane bw'emigaju erikutaamirana ahabw'Omwanya Ogurikwera. Nkebi naakuragiira byona oku biri, babe nikwo baabikora.<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro kya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:12">Ezk 20:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ogambire Abaisraeli oti: Buzimazima mutaribura kurinda sabato zangye; ahabw'okuba niko kamanyiso ahagati yangye naimwe omu busingye bwanyu bwona, mubone kumanya ku niinye MUKAMA orikubeeza. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:12">Ezk 20:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma murinde sabato; ahabw'okuba n'erikwera ahariimwe; omuntu weena origishiisha, aryaitwa; omuntu weena origikoreraho omurimo gwona, acuubwe omu ihanga rye. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Omu biro mukaaga emirimo ebe nimwo yaakorerwa; kwonka ekiro kya mushanju niyo sabato ey'okuruhuukiriraho kimwe, eyereziibwe MUKAMA. Orikora omurimo gwona aha izooba rya sabato, buzimazima aitwe. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baryarinda sabato, bagume nibahitsya emigyenzo yaayo omu busingye bwabo bwona, ebe endagaano etarihwaho. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Ako n'akamanyiso ahagati yangye n'Abaisraeli akarigumaho ebiro byona; ahabw'okuba omu biro mukaaga nimwo MUKAMA yaahangiire eiguru n'ensi, akahuumura aha kiro kya mushanju, akaruhuuka.<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:15">Kur 32:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:13">Bir 4:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:3">2 Kor 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ku yaaherize kugambira na Musa aha rushozi Sinai, yaamuha ebishate by'amabaare bibiri ebiriho Ebirikuhamya, ebihandiikirwe orukumu rwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s1">Arooni okuheeshera Abaisraeli ekishushani ky'enimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:18">Kur 24:18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:40">Byak 7:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu ku baareebire Musa yaatuura aha rushozi atagarukire, baayeteeranira ahari Arooni, baamugira bati: Imuka, otukorere ruhanga w'okutwebembera; ahabw'okuba omushaija ori Musa, owaatwihire omu nsi ya Misri, titurikumanya oku abaire. <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:24">Bar 8:24</ref>. </char></note> Arooni yaabagira ati: Mujuure empeta z'ezaabu eziri aha matu g'abakazi baanyu n'aga batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu, muzindeetere. <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Abantu boona baajuura empeta ezaabaire ziri aha matu gaabo, baazitwarira Arooni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:23">Kur 20:23</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:20">1 Bag 12:20</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:18">Neh 9:18</ref>. </char></note> Yaaziiha omu ngaro zaabo; ku yaaherize kuziheeshamu ekishushani ky'enimi, yaakishemeza n'ekyoma ekirikusharura. Baagira bati: Iwe Israeli, ogu niwe ruhanga waawe owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Arooni ku yaakireebire, yaayombeka eitambiro omu maisho gaakyo; yaaranga, naagira ati: Nyencakare nihaija kubaho obugyenyi bw'ekiro kikuru kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:7">1 Kor 10:7</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, baimuka kare, baatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya, baahonga empongano y'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. Abantu baashutama kurya n'okunywa, baimuka kuzaana.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:16">Bir 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:19">Bar 2:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Irooko, oshuume; ahabw'okuba abantu baawe abu waihire omu nsi ya Misri beesiisire, <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:16">Bir 9:16</ref>. </char></note> baarahuka kuteishuka omuhanda ogu naabaragiire; baayeheeshera ekishushani ky'enimi, baakiramya, baakitambira ebitambo nibagira bati: Iwe Israeli, ogu niwe ruhanga waawe, owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Naayetegyereza abantu aba; n'abantu b'ebitsya bigangaire. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo ndeka, ekiniga kyangye kibaakyeho, mbamareho; haza iwe ndyakuhindura eihanga rihango. <verse eid="EXO 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:18">Bir 9:18</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 9:26-29">26-29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:23">Zab 106:23</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA Ruhanga we, naagira ati: MUKAMA, ahabw'enki ekiniga kyawe nikyaka aha bantu baawe, abu waihire omu nsi ya Misri n'obushoboorozi bwingi n'omukono gw'amaani? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Ahabw'enki nooyenda kureetera Abanyamisri kwesiima nibagira bati: Akabaihayo kubakora kubi, ngu abaitire omu nshozi, abamare omu nsi? Reka ekiniga kyawe kingi, oyegarukyemu, orekye kureeta akabi ako aha bantu baawe. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Kut 22:16</ref>. </char></note> Ijuka Abrahamu, Isaaka na Israeli abairu baawe, abu waagambiire noorahira oti: Ndyakanyisa oruzaaro rwanyu, rube nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, kandi ensi egi yoona ei naagambaho ndyagiha oruzaaro rwanyu, ebe obuhunguzi bwarwo ebiro byona. <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:16">2 Sam 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:13">Yoel 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:10">Yon 3:10</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaayegarukamu, yaareka akabi aku yaabaire naayenda kureeta aha bantu be.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Musa yaahinduka, yaashuuma naaruga aha rushozi, aine omu ngaro ze ebishate bibiri ebiriho Ebirikuhamya, ebihandiikire embaju zaabyo zombi omunda n'enyima. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Kur 31:18</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bishate bikaba bikozirwe Ruhanga okuhandiika okwo kukaba kuri okwa Ruhanga kusharwirwe aha bishate. <verse eid="EXO 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshua ku yaahuriire orwari rw'abantu nibayomba, yaagambira Musa ati: Orwo rwari oruri omu rusiisira n'orw'okurwana. <verse eid="EXO 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Musa yaagira ati: Orwo rwari ti rwari rw'abarikuteera akaari ahabw'okubinga, nari orw'abarikuyomba ahabw'okubingwa; kureka oru ndikuhurira, n'orw'abarikweshongora. <verse eid="EXO 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Musa ku yaahikire haihi n'orusiisira, yaareeba ekishushani ky'enimi n'abarikuzina, yaagira ekiniga kingi, yaatambika ebishate ebi yaabaire aine omu ngaro, yaabyatira ahansi y'orushozi. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Yaatwara ekishushani eki babaire baheesire, yaakyotsya omu muriro, yaakihondahonda, yaakicwa eiju, yaarinaganaga omu maizi, yaaganywaisa Abaisraeli.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa yaabuza Arooni ati: Aba bantu bakugizire bata, waaza kubareetera kukora ekibi kihango ekirikwingana kiti? <verse eid="EXO 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Arooni yaagarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, reka kungirira ekiniga; noomanya aba bantu ku bamaririire kukora kubi; <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />ahakuba bangizire bati: Tukorere ruhanga oraatwebembere, ahakuba omushaija ori Musa owaatwihire omu nsi ya Misri, titurikumanya oku abaire. <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Naanye naabagarukamu nti: Oine ezaabu weena, agijuure; nabo baazimpa naazinaga omu muriro, zaarugamu egyo nimi.<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 33:4">Kur 33:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 33:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa ku yaareebire abantu bagomire, (ahakuba Arooni akabaikiriza kugoma, baahinduka eky'okugaaniiza omu bazigu baabo), <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />yaayemerera omu irembo ry'orusiisira, yaagira ati: Weena ori aha rubaju rwa MUKAMA, aije ahi ndi. Abaleevi boona bateeranira ah'ari. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:9">Bir 33:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:11">Kub 25:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba, naagira ati: Buri muntu ahagatire rurara ye, mugyendagyende hoonahoona omu rusiisira nimuruga aha irembo nimuza aha rindi, buri muntu aite mwene ishe, na mugyenzi we, na mutaahi we. <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Abaleevi baakora nk'oku Musa yaabaragiira; aha izooba eryo omu Baisraeli haafa abashaija nk'enkumi ishatu. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Musa yaagira ati: Eri izooba mweyeze ahari MUKAMA, ahakuba buri muntu arwaniise omutabani na mwene ishe, MUKAMA abone kubaha omugisha eri izooba.<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:15">Amo 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaseesire, Musa yaagambira abantu ati: Mukozire ekibi kihango; mbwenu naaza kwinamuka ahari MUKAMA; obundi nkaabaasa kukora eky'okurihiirira ekibi kyanyu. <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Musa yaagaruka ahari MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Ai bambe, abantu aba bakozire ekibi kihango, baayekorera ruhanga omu zaabu. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:14">Bir 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:3">Rom 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">Kush 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati, ku oraabe noikiriza kubasaasira ekibi kyabo, obasaasire; kwonka ku oraabe otarikubasaasira, naakweshengyereza onyihe omu kitabo eki waahandiikire. <verse eid="EXO 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:4">Ezk 18:4</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagarukamu Musa ati: Weena oncumwireho, niwe ndaihe omu kitabo kyangye. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:5">Rom 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu irooko otware abantu abo omu mwanya ogu naakugambiire; reeba, maraika wangye naija kukwebembera. Kwonka aha izooba ry'okuhoora, ndyabatura ekibi kyabo. <verse eid="EXO 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />MUKAMA yaitsa abantu orufu, ahakuba bakakoresa ekishushani ky'enimi eki Arooni yaakozire.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s1">Eihema rya MUKAMA okwihwa omu Baisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Irooko orugye aha, iwe n'abantu abu waihire omu nsi ya Misri, muze omu nsi ei naarahiire Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo, ningira nti: Ndyagiha oruzaaro rwawe. <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Naanye ndyayohereza maraika akwebembere, kandi ndyabinga Abanyakanaani, Abaamori, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi; <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:6">Bir 9:6</ref>. </char></note> mutaahe omu nsi y'amate n'obwoki; kwonka Nyowe tindigyenda naimwe, ntakaabaitira omu muhanda; ahabw'okuba muri abantu b'ebitsya bigangaire. <verse eid="EXO 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Abantu ku baahuriire ebyo bigambo bibi, baashaasha munonga, tihaagira n'omwe owaajwara eby'okweshemeza. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Ahakuba MUKAMA akaba yaagambiire Musa ati: Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Muri abantu b'ebitsya bigangaire; ku naakugyenda naimwe nangwa n'akaanya kakye, nkaabamaraho. Mbwenu nu, mujuure eby'okweshemeza byanyu, mbone kumanya oku ndaabagire. <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baajuura eby'okweshemeza, okutandikira aha rushozi Horebu n'okweyongyerayo.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Kandi okuruga obwo Musa yaaguma naatwara Eihema naariteera aheeru y'orusiisira hare narwo; yaaryeta Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. Kandi omuntu weena owaabaire aba naasherura MUKAMA, akaba ashohora aza aha Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eryabaire riri aheeru y'orusiisira. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Musa ku yaabaire aruga omu rusiisira, naaza aha Ihema, abantu boona baimuka, buri muntu ayemerera aha muryango gw'eihema rye, baguma nibamureeba okuhitsya obu araataahe omu Ihema. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 99:7">Zab 99:7</ref>. </char></note> Musa ku yaabaire aheza kutaahamu, enyomyo eri ey'ekicu eshuuma, eyemerera aha muryango gw'Eihema, MUKAMA agamba nawe. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Abantu boona bakireeba enyomyo y'ekicu eyemereire aha muryango gw'Eihema, baimuka, baramya, buri muntu ari aha muryango gw'eihema rye. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:10">Bir 34:10</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaabaire agamba na Musa nibareebana, nk'oku omuntu agamba na mugyenzi we. Bwanyima Musa agaruka omu rusiisira; kwonka omuheereza we Yoshua mwene Nuuni, omutsigazi, akaba ataruga omuri eryo Hema.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okworekwa ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:5">Yer 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:19">2 Tim 2:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ati: Reeba, nongira oti: Twara abantu aba; kwonka tiwammanyisa u orantume nawe. Kandi okagira oti: Ninkumanya eiziina, kandi ogiriirwe embabazi omu maisho gangye. <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:9">Kur 34:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:11">Zab 27:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nu, ninkweshengyereza, ku ndaabe ngiriirwe embabazi omu maisho gaawe, hati onyorekye enaama zaawe, nkumanye, mbone kuguma ningirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe; kandi oijukye eihanga eri ku riri eihanga ryawe. <verse eid="EXO 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:9">Isa 63:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:44">Yos 21:44</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Nyowe nyenka ndyagyenda naiwe, kandi ndyakuha obuhuumure. <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa yaamugira ati: Iwe wenka ku oraabe otarikugyenda naanye, otatwiha aha. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:14">Kub 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu kiryamanywa kita, nyowe n'abantu baawe ku tugiriirwe embabazi omu maisho gaawe? Tiiwe kugyenda naitwe, kikareetera nyowe n'abantu baawe kugira omutaano n'amahanga goona agari omu nsi?<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Ekigambo eki eki waagamba nakyo niinyija kukikora; ahabw'okuba ogiriirwe embabazi omu maisho gangye, kandi ninkumanya eiziina. <verse eid="EXO 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Musa yaagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nyoreka ekitiinisa kyawe. <verse eid="EXO 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Niinyija kurabya oburungi bwangye bwona omu maisho gaawe, ndangye eiziina ryangye YEHOVA omu maisho gaawe; ndyagirira embabazi ou ndigirira embabazi, kandi nsaasire, ou ndisaasira. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:5">Isa 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaamugira ati: Torikubaasa kundeeba hamaisho; ahakuba tihariho muntu orindeeba, akagumaho. <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, aha rubaju rwangye hariho omwanya, ahu orikwija kwemerera aha rukiri. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:1">Zab 91:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 91:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ekitiinisa kyangye ku kiraabe nikihinguraho, niinyija kukuta omu bwatika bwarwo, nkusangire n'ekiganja kyangye, okuhitsya obu ndaarabeho; <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yoh 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:2">1 Yoh 1:2</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima nyiheho omukono gwangye, ondeebe omugongo; kwonka aha maisho gangye tiharikwija kureebwa.<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuha Musa ebindi bishate by'amabaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Shatura ebishate bibiri by'amabaare nk'eby'okubanza; naanye niinyija kubihandiikaho ebigambo ebyabaire biri aha by'okubanza ebi waayatsire. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Nyencakare omu kasheeshe obe oyeteekateekire, oinamukye aha rushozi Sinai, oyeyorekye omu maisho gangye aha mutwe gwarwo. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Hatagira omuntu owainamuka naiwe, kandi otaikiriza omuntu weena kureebwa aha rushozi rwona, n'obu gaakuba amasyo g'entaama nari ag'ente kuriira omu maisho gaarwo. <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Musa yaashatura ebishate bibiri by'amabaare nk'eby'okubanza, yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe, yainamuka aha rushozi Sinai nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire, aine omu ngaro ebyo bishate byombi by'amabaare. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />MUKAMA yaashuumira omu kicu, yaayemererayo nawe, yaaranga eiziina rye YEHOVA. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:17">Neh 9:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:4">Rom 2:4</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaraba omu maisho ga Musa, yaaranga naagira ati: MUKAMA, MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'okusaasira n'embabazi, otarahuka kugira ekiniga, oijwire embabazi n'amazima, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:18">Yer 32:18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:9">1 Yoh 1:9</ref>. </char></note> ogirira embabazi abantu enkumi n'enkumi, osaasira okutahikiirira n'okushiisha n'ekibi; otasingisiriza na kakye abaine orubanja; ohoora abaana ahabw'eby'okushiisha bya baishebo, n'abaijukuru baabo okuhitsya aha busingye bwa kashatu n'obwa kana. <verse eid="EXO 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Musa yaarahuka, yainika omutwe ahansi, yaaramya; <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, mbwenu ku ndaabe naagirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, ninkweshengyereza, MUKAMA, ogyende ahagati yaitu, n'obu turaabe turi eihanga ry'ebitsya bigangaire, osaasire okutahikiirira kwaitu n'ekibi kyaitu, otwakiire tube obuhunguzi bwawe.<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, nindagaana endagaano; omu maisho g'abantu baawe boona ndyakora eby'okutangaaza ebitakakorwaga mu nsi yoona nari omu ihanga ryona; kandi abantu boona, abu orimu, baryareeba eki MUKAMA arikora, ahakuba eki ndikora, kiryaba eky'okutiinisa. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Ogume oyorobere eki ndikukuragiira eri izooba. Reeba, ndyabinga Abaamori omu maisho gaawe, n'Abanyakanaani, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Oyerinde, otariragaana endagaano n'abatwire omu nsi ei orikuzamu, ekaba omutego omuriimwe; <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>. </char></note> kureka musheenye amatambiro gaabo, muhigure enyomyo zaabo, mutemagure na Ashera zaabo. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Bir 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:22">1 Bag 14:22</ref>. </char></note> (Mumanye ngu timuriramya ruhanga ondiijo weena; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA, ou eiziina rye ririkwetwa Ow'eihato, ni Ruhanga ow'eihato.) <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Ezk 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Otariragaana endagaano n'abatwire omuri egyo nsi; ahakuba ku barikurata baaruhanga baabo nk'abarikuraaya, baabatambira ebitambo, nyentsya omwe aharibo akaakweta, orya aha kitambo kye, <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Kub 25:1</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:2">2</ref>. </char></note> oshwererera batabani baawe bahara baabo, bwanyima bahara baabo bakurata baaruhanga baabo nk'abarikuraaya, bareetera batabani baawe kukurata baaruhanga baabo omu muringo ogwo.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />Otaryekorera ebishushani bya baaruhanga ebiheesirwe.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'amagyenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />Oryaguma orinde obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe. Omu bunaku obwatairweho omu kwezi Abibu oryamara ebiro mushanju noorya emigaati etatumbisiibwe, nk'oku naakuragiire; ahabw'okuba omuri okwo kwezi Abibu nimwo waarugiire omuri Misri. <verse eid="EXO 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />Ekiigura-nda kyona n'ekyangye, ekyetwa ekishaija ky'omu matungo gaawe goona ag'ente n'ag'entaama. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Kwonka omujigaijo gw'endogoya oryagucunguza omwana gw'entaama; ku oriba otarikwenda kugucungura, oguhende ebitsya. Emijigaijo ya batabani baanyu yoona muryagicungura. Hatarigira owaija omu maisho gangye engaro nsha.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />Omu biro mukaaga oryakora, kwonka aha kiro kya mushanju oryahuumura; omu ibiba n'omu igyesha oryahuumura. <verse eid="EXO 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Kur 23:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oryarinda obugyenyi bwa saabiiti mushanju, ez'omuganuro gw'eigyesha ry'engano, kandi n'obugyenyi bw'eishaaruura ry'aha muheru gw'omwaka. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />Kashatu omu mwaka abeetwa abashaija boona baryaguma baije, bareebwe omu maisho ga Mukama RUHANGA, Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:55">Zab 78:55</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:10">2 Bus 17:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ndyabinga amahanga, garugye omu maisho gaawe, nyirizeyo emyatano yaawe; ku oriba ogiire kureebwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA kashatu omu mwaka, tihaine muntu weena oryetenga ensi yaawe. <verse eid="EXO 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />Otarihayo eshagama y'ekitambo ekintambiirwe hamwe n'omugaati ogutumbisiibwe, kandi ekitambo ky'obugyenyi bw'ekiro kikuru ky'Okuhingurwaho kitaritsigaraho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="EXO 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>. </char></note>Emiganuro y'ebirikubanza kwera omu misiri yaawe oryagireeta omu nju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. Otariteeka omwana gw'embuzi omu mahenahene ga nyinagwo. <verse eid="EXO 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Handiika ebigambo ebyo; ahakuba endagaano ei ndagaine naiwe n'Abaisraeli neehamira aha bigambo ebyo. <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa yaamarayo ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro, ari hamwe na MUKAMA; omu biro ebyo tarariire by'okurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi. Yaahandiika ahari ebyo bishate by'amabaare ebigambo by'endagaano egyo, nibyo biragiro ikumi.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musa okuruga aha rushozi Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:2">Mat 17:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaashuuma, yaaruga aha rushozi Sinai, aine ebishate bibiri eby'Ebirikuhamya omu ngaro; ku yaabaire naashuuma, tiyaamanya aha maisho ge ku harikumurinkana, ahakuba akaba naagaaniira na Ruhanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Arooni n'Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire Musa, reeba aha maisho ge hakaba nihamurinkana; baatiina kumuhika haihi. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Musa yaabeeta, Arooni n'abategyeki boona ab'eihanga eryo baagaruka ah'ari; Musa yaagaaniira nabo. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli boona bairira haihi; yaabamanyisa ebiragiro byona oku biri, ebi MUKAMA amugambiriire aha rushozi Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:13-16">2 Kor 3:13-16</ref>. </char></note> Musa ku yaaherize kugamba nabo, yaata eky'okwetwekyerera aha maisho ge. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Kwonka ku yaabaire aza omu maisho ga MUKAMA kugamba nawe, akiihaho okuhitsya ahu araashohorere; kandi ku yaabaire ashohora kugambira Abaisraeli ebi yaaragiirwa, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />Abaisraeli bareeba aha maisho ge nihamurinkana; Musa agaruka ayeta eky'okwetwekyerera aha maisho, okuhitsya obu yaabaire agarukayo kugaaniira na MUKAMA.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s1">Emitoijo y'okukoresa Obutaaho bwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa yaateerana eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli, yaabagira ati: Ebi nibyo MUKAMA abaragiire kukora. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lev 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro mukaaga emirimo ebe nimwo yaakorerwa, kwonka ekiro kya mushanju kiryaba ekiro ekirikwera ahariimwe, sabato ey'okuhuumuririraho kimwe, eyereziibwe MUKAMA; origikoreraho omurimo gwona, aryaitwa. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Mutarihemba omuriro gwona omu maka gaanyu aha izooba rya sabato.<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa yaagambira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli ati: Eki nikyo MUKAMA aragiire kukora. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:7">2 Kor 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Mwihe omuriimwe emitoijo y'okutoijera MUKAMA; omuntu weena oine omutima ogurikukunda kuha, areete omutoijo gwa MUKAMA; ezaabu, efeeza, emiringa, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />emyenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari, eya bafuta, n'obwoya bw'embuzi, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />empu z'empaya z'entaama ezizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, empu z'engongi, embaaho z'eminyinya, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />amajuta g'etabaaza, eby'emigaju eby'okuta omu majuta ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'eby'okujwanzya n'obubaane oburikutaamirana, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />amabaare agarikwetwa shohamu, n'agandi mabaare ag'okuhundisa efodi n'eky'aha kifuba. <verse eid="EXO 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />Omu nyamwoga weena omuriimwe aije akore ebi MUKAMA aragiire byona; <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:2-11">Heb 9:2-11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>. </char></note> obutaaho n'Eihema ryabwo n'eby'okubushweka n'ebikwatsi byabwo n'embaaho zaabwo n'embazi zaabwo n'enyomyo zaabwo n'ebiina byabwo; <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />eshanduukye y'endagaano n'emigamba yaayo, n'ekitebe ky'okusaasira, n'omukingo gw'okukingira Aharikwera munonga; <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />n'emeeza n'emigamba yaayo n'ebintu byayo byona, n'emigaati y'okumurika; <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />n'ekikondo ky'etabaaza y'okuhwezesa n'ebintu byakyo, n'amatabaaza gaakyo n'amajuta g'okuhemba; <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />n'ekyoterero ky'obubaane n'emigamba yaakyo n'amajuta g'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'obubaane oburikutaamirana, n'omukingo gw'okukinga aha muryango gw'obwo butaaho; <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />n'eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo n'ekintu kyaryo ky'emiringa ekishobeekaine nk'ekigoye, n'emigamba yaaryo n'ebintu byaryo byona, n'ekinaabiro n'ekibunu kyakyo; <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />n'emikingo y'orugo rw'ekibuga n'enyomyo zaarwo n'ebiina byazo n'emikingo y'eirembo ry'ekibuga; <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />n'enkondo z'obwo butaaho n'ez'orugo rwabwo n'emigoye yaazo; <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />n'ebijwaro ebibaziirwe gye eby'okukoresa omu Mwanya ogurikwera, nibyo bijwaro ebirikwera eby'okujwarwa Arooni omunyamurwa n'eby'abatabani, nibakora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa.<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli ryaruga omu maisho ga Musa. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:9">1 Bus 29:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baagaruka, buri muntu owaagyemirwe omutima gwe, na buri muntu ou omutima gwe gwayekundiire, baareeta emitoijo ya MUKAMA ey'okukoresa Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'emirimo yaaryo yoona n'ey'okukoresa ebijwaro ebirikwera. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Haija abashaija n'abakazi, boona abaabaire baine emitima eyekundiire, baareeta empeta z'aha nyindo n'ez'omu matu, empeta eziriho obumanyiso n'enkwanzi, byona biri eby'ezaabu; buri muntu weena owaatoijiire, MUKAMA yaareeta omutoijo gw'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Kandi buri muntu owaashangirwe aine emyenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya bafuta, n'obwoya bw'embuzi, n'empu z'empaya z'entaama ezizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, n'empu z'engongi, yaabireeta. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Buri muntu owaabaasize kureeta omutoijo gw'efeeza nari ogw'emiringa, yaagutoijera MUKAMA; kandi n'omuntu weena owaabaire aine embaaho z'omunyinya ezaakubaasa kukorwamu ekintu kyona omuri ogwo murimo, yaazireeta. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 31:19-24">Enf 31:19-24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abakazi boona abanyamyoga baakaraga n'engaro zaabo, baareeta ebi baakaragire ebya bururu, ebya bujwa, ebya karari n'ebya bafuta. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Kandi abakazi boona abanyamwoga omu kukaraga abaagyemirwe emitima yaabo, baakaraga obwoshe bw'embuzi. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />N'abategyeki baareeta amabaare agarikwetwa shohamu n'amabaare ag'okuhundisa efodi n'eky'aha kifuba, <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />n'eby'emigaju, n'amajuta ag'okuhemba n'ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'ahabw'obubaane oburikutaamirana. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Abaisraeli baareetera MUKAMA emitoijo n'emitima eyekundiire, omushaija weena n'omukazi weena, abaagyemirwe emitima yaabo kureeta ekintu kyona ahabw'omurimo ogu MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa kukora.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Musa yaagambira Abaisraeli ati: Reeba, MUKAMA ayetsire Bezaleeli omu iziina, mutabani wa Uuri, mwene Huuri, ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:38">Kut 41:38</ref>. </char></note> yaamwijuza Omwoyo wa Ruhanga n'obwengye n'okwetegyereza n'okumanya n'obuhangu bwona obw'okukora emirimo, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />okugunja emirimo y'emyoga, okuheesha ezaabu n'efeeza n'emiringa, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />okubaija amabaare ag'okuhunda omu bintu, okusharura ebibaizirwe omu miti, n'okukora emirimo y'emiringo yoona. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Kandi yaata omu mutima gwe okwegyesa abandi, we na Oholiabu mwene Ahisamaaki, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Bombi yaijuza emitima yaabo obuhangu bw'okukora emirimo ya buri muringo, erikukorwa abasharuzi n'ababaziizi b'ebicwererane by'ehuuzi za bururu n'eza bujwa n'eza karari aha mwenda gwa bafuta, n'abaruki, ebirikukorwa omukozi w'omuringo gwona n'omugunji w'obwengye.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />Bezaleeli na Oholiabu n'omuntu weena omunyamwoga, ou MUKAMA yaahaire obwengye n'okwetegyereza okumanya kukora omurimo gwona ahabw'okukora Omwanya ogurikwera, baryakora nk'ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire byona oku biri.<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu okureeta emitoijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Bwanyima Musa yaayeta Bezaleeli na Oholiabu n'omunyamwoga weena, ou MUKAMA yaataire obwengye omu mutima gwe, na weena owaagyemirwe omutima gwe kwija kukora omurimo ogwo; <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Musa yaabaha emitoijo ei Abaisraeli baareetsire ey'okukoresa omurimo gw'omwanya ogurikwera n'okuguhereza kimwe. Kandi buri kasheeshe abantu baaguma nibamureetera emitoijo n'emitima eyekundiire. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />N'ahabw'ekyo abanyamwoga boona abaabaire nibakora omurimo gwona ogw'Omwanya ogurikwera, buri omwe yaaruga aha murimo gwe ogu yaabaire naakora, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:2">2 Kor 8:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 8:3">3</ref>. </char></note> yaagira Musa ati: Abantu nibareeta bingi munonga okukira ebirikwetengwa ahabw'omurimo, ogu MUKAMA yaaturagiire kukora. <verse eid="EXO 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Musa yaaragiira, eki yaaragiira kyarangirirwa omu rusiisira rwona, nibagira bati: Hatagira omushaija nari omukazi owaagaruka kukora ogundi murimo ahabw'emitoijo y'Omwanya ogurikwera. Okwo nikwo abantu baazibiirwe kureeta endiijo mitoijo; <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />ahakuba ebintu ebi baabaire baine bikaba nibimara okukora omurimo gwona, kandi nibishaaga.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:8">Yob 32:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamyoga boona ab'omu bakozi baakora obwo butaaho n'emikingo ikumi; egyo mikingo baagikoresa emyenda ya kitaani n'eya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari, baagitamu ebishushani bya baakerubi ebikozirwe abanyamwoga baabyo. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Oburaingwa bwa buri mukingo bukaba buri mikono makumi abiri na munaana, n'obuhango bwagwo mikono ena; emikingo yoona ekaba eri ey'orugyero rumwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Emikingo etaano yaagiteerana okwayo, n'endiijo etaano okwayo. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Yaakora obufunga bwa bururu aha mukugiro ogw'aha rubaju rw'emikingo etaano ey'okubanza, n'aha mukugiro gw'aha rubaju rw'emikingo endiijo etaano; <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />yaakora obufunga makumi ataano aha mukingo gumwe oguteeraine, n'obundi makumi ataano aha mukugiro gw'omukingo gwa kabiri; obwo bufunga bwareebana. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Kandi yaakora ebikwatsi by'ezaabu makumi ataano, yaabikwatanisisa egyo mikingo; obutaaho bwaba bumwe.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Kandi yaakora emikingo y'obwoshe bw'embuzi kuba eihema ry'okushweka obutaaho; yaakora emikingo ikumi na gumwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Oburaingwa bwa buri mukingo bukaba buri mikono makumi ashatu, n'obuhango bwagwo mikono ena; egyo mikingo ikumi na gumwe ekaba eri ey'orugyero rumwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Emikingo etaano yaagiteerana okwayo, n'emikingo mukaaga okwayo. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Yaakora obufunga makumi ataano aha mukugiro gw'omukingo ogurikuheererukayo omu y'okubanza, n'obundi makumi ataano aha mukugiro ogw'omukingo ogurikuheererukayo omu ya kabiri. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Yaakora ebikwatsi makumi ataano by'emiringa okukwatanisa eihema ku riba rimwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Kandi yaakora eky'okushweka eihema ky'empu z'empaya z'entaama ezizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, yaatungikaho eky'empu z'engongi.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Kandi yaakora embaaho z'obutaaho omu munyinya ez'okwemereza; <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />oburaingwa bwa buri rubaaho mikono ikumi, n'obuhango bwarwo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Buri rubaaho rwagira endimi ibiri ez'okuruteerana na rugyenzi rwarwo. Okwo nikwo yaakozire embaaho zoona ez'obutaaho. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo yaakora embaaho makumi abiri, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />yaakora n'ebiina by'efeeza makumi ana, yaabita ahansi y'ezo mbaaho makumi abiri, ebiina bibiri ahansi y'orubaaho rumwe ahabw'endimi zaarwo ibiri, n'ebindi biina bibiri ahansi y'orundi rubaaho ahabw'endimi zaarwo ibiri. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Aha rubaju rw'obutaaho orwa kabiri, oruri aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, yaakoraho embaaho makumi abiri, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />n'ebiina byazo by'efeeza makumi ana, ebiina bibiri ahansi y'orubaaho rumwe n'ebindi bibiri ahansi y'orundi. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Aha rubaju rw'obutaaho orw'enyima orurikureeba oburengyerwa-izooba, yaakoraho embaaho mukaaga; <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />yaakora n'embaaho ibiri ez'enshonda z'obutaaho aha mbaju zombi ez'enyima. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Ezo mbaaho ahansi zaataana, kwonka ahaiguru zaateeranira aha mpeta ey'okubanza; nikwo zombi yaazikozire atyo aha nshonda zombi. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />N'ahabw'ekyo haabaho embaaho munaana n'ebiina byazo by'efeeza; byona byaba ikumi na mukaaga, ebiina bibiri ahansi ya buri rubaaho.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Kandi yaakora embazi omu munyinya; itaano ahabw'embaaho z'orubaju rumwe orw'obutaaho, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />n'itaano ahabw'embaaho z'orubaju orundi orw'obutaaho, n'ezindi itaano ahabw'embaaho z'obutaaho ez'orubaju orw'enyima orurikureeba oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Orubazi orw'ahagati y'ezindi yaarwozyamu, rwahika oku n'oku. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Embaaho zoona yaazishweka n'ezaabu, yaaheesha empeta z'ezaabu ez'okurabyamu ezo mbazi; nazo yaazishweka n'ezaabu.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:51">Mat 27:51</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:20">Heb 10:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaakora omukingo gwa bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani; yaagutamu ebishushani bya baakerubi ebikozirwe abanyamwoga baabyo. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Omukingo ogwo yaagukorera enyomyo ina z'eminyinya, yaazishweka n'ezaabu; eby'okuhanikaho byazo byaba eby'ezaabu; yaaziheeshera ebiina by'efeeza bina. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Kandi yaakora omukingo gw'okukinga aha muryango gw'Eihema, yaagukora omu myenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, ebaziirwemu amabara gacwereraine; <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />yaakora n'enyomyo zaagwo itaano n'eby'okuhanikaho byazo. Yaashweka emitwe yaazo n'obufunga bwazo n'ezaabu; kwonka ebiina byazo ebitaano byaba eby'emiringa.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ebintu by'omu Butaaho oburikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Kandi Bezaleeli yaakora eshanduukye omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwayo mikono ebiri n'ekicweka, obuhango bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka, n'obwemi bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Yaagishweka n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe omunda n'enyima, yaagitaho omuguno gw'ezaabu kugyehinguririza. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Yaayazya ezaabu, yaagiheeshamu ebifunga bina, yaabita aha nshonda zaayo ina, bibiri aha rubaju rumwe, n'ebindi bibiri aha rundi. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Yaakora emigamba omu munyinya, yaagishweka n'ezaabu; <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:3">2 Sam 6:3</ref>. </char></note> yaata egyo migamba omu bifunga eby'omu mbaju z'eshanduukye, ngu bagume bagiheekyese. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Yaakora ekitebe ky'okusaasira omu zaabu eshemeziibwe, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono ebiri n'ekicweka, n'obuhango bwakyo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Kandi yaakora baakerubi babiri omu zaabu; omu kubakora yaabaheeshera aha mitwe yombi ey'ekyo kitebe ky'okusaasira; <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />kerubi omwe aha mutwe gumwe, n'ondi aha gundi; yaabaheesherana n'ekitebe ky'okusaasira aha mitwe yaakyo yombi. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kur 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:10">2 Bus 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Baakerubi baashashaanura amapapa gaabo ahaiguru, baagasangiza ekitebe ky'okusaasira, boorekyeraine nibareeba ekyo kitebe.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 1:7">Mal 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 1:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaabaija emeeza omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwayo mikono ebiri, obuhango bwayo mukono gumwe n'obwemi bwayo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Yaagishweka n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, yaagitaho omuguno gw'ezaabu kugyehinguririza. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Yaagikorera ebizingiti kugyehinguririza, obuhango bwabyo ekita kimwe; nabyo yaabitaho omuguno gw'ezaabu kugyehinguririza. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Yaagiheeshera ebifunga bina by'ezaabu, yaabita aha maguru gaayo aha nshonda zaayo ina. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Ebifunga ebyo byaza haihi n'ebizingiti, kuba eby'okutamu emigamba y'okuheekyesa emeeza. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Egyo migamba y'okuheekyesa emeeza, yaagibaija omu munyinya, yaagishweka n'ezaabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Kandi yaakora ebintu by'okuta ahari egyo meeza omu zaabu eshemeziibwe, enyabya zaayo n'ebikopo byayo, kandi emidumo n'ebakuri byayo eby'okushukisa empongano z'eby'okunywa.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:20">Kush 1:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaakora ekikondo ky'amatabaaza omu zaabu eshemeziibwe; ekibunu kyakyo, omukono gwakyo, ebikopo byakyo, ebintu byakyo ebyebumburikire, n'ebirabyo byakyo byaheesheranwa nakyo. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Kyagira amataagi mukaaga agarikuruga ahari ogwo mukono, ashatu aha rubaju rumwe, n'ashatu aha rundi, <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />aha itaagi rimwe ebikopo bishatu ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, hamwe n'ekintu ekyebumburikire n'ekirabyo kyakyo; aha itaagi erindi ebikopo bishatu ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, hamwe n'ekintu ekyebumburikire n'ekirabyo kyakyo; goona mukaaga nk'oku garikuruga aha mukono gumwe gaaba nikwo gaaba gatyo. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Ahari ogwo mukono gw'ekikondo ky'etabaaza haabaho ebikopo bina ebirikushusha nk'ebirabyo by'endozi, n'ebintu ebyebumburikire n'ebirabyo byabyo; <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />ekintu ekyebumburikire kyaheesheranwa n'omukono gw'etabaaza ahansi ya buri mataagi abiri agarikugurugaho; goona mukaaga gaaba nikwo gaaba. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Ebyebumburikire n'amataagi gaabyo byaheesheranwa nagwo omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Yaaheesha amatabaaza gaakyo mushanju n'empana zaago n'otusohaani twago omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Ekikondo ky'amatabaaza n'ebintu byakyo byona, yaabikora omu zaabu eshemeziibwe ey'oburemeezi bw'etalanta emwe.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 40:26">Kur 40:26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:25">Heb 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:3">Kush 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 8:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaabaija ekyoterero ky'obubaane omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwakyo mukono gumwe, n'obuhango bwakyo mukono gumwe, kyaingaingana embaju zoona; kandi obwemi bwakyo bwaba mikono ebiri; amahembe gaakyo gaabaijeranwa nakyo. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Yaakishweka n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, aha mutwe gwakyo n'embaju zaakyo n'amahembe gaakyo; kandi yaakitaho omuguno gw'ezaabu kukyehinguririza. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Yaakiheeshera ebifunga bibiri by'ezaabu, yaabita ahansi y'omuguno gwakyo aha mbaju zaakyo zombi, kuba eby'okutamu emigamba y'okukiheekyesa; <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />egyo migamba yaagikora omu munyinya, yaagishweka n'ezaabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Kandi yaakora amajuta garikwera ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, n'obubaane burungi obw'eby'emigaju erikutaamirana, nk'oku abanyamwoga baabwo babujwanzya.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi bintu by'obutaaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:16-19">Zab 51:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:10">Heb 13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaabaija eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo omu munyinya, oburaingwa bwaryo mikono etaano, obuhango bwaryo mikono etaano, ryaingaingana embaju zoona, n'obwemi bwaryo mikono eshatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Aha nshonda zaaryo ina yaabaijaho amahembe ana; ago mahembe gaabaijeranwa naryo; yaarishweka n'emiringa. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Kandi yaariheeshera ebintu byaryo byona, eby'okuyooreraho eiju, n'eby'okuriyooresa, n'enyabya, n'eby'okwihuza enyama, n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro; ebintu byaryo byona yaabikora omu miringa. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Kandi yaariheeshera ekintu ekishobeekaine nk'ekigoye omu miringa, yaakita ahansi y'omuguno ogwehinguririize eitambiro, kyaruga ahansi, kyahika rwagati y'eitambiro. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Yaaheesha ebifunga bina, yaabita aha nshonda ina z'ekyo kintu ky'emiringa ekishobeekaine kuba eby'okutamu emigamba. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Yaabaija emigamba omu munyinya, yaagishweka n'emiringa; <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />egyo migamba yaagita omu bifunga aha mbaju z'eitambiro kuba ey'okuriheekyesa. Yaaribaija omu mbaaho, omunda ryaba omurangara.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 26:6">Zab 26:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaaheesha ekinaabiro omu miringa, n'ekibunu kyakyo nakyo omu miringa; yaabiheesha omu miringa y'endeeberwamu z'abakazi, abaabaire bateerana kuheereza aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Kandi yaakora ekibuga; aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo orugo rwakyo rukaba ruri orw'emikingo y'emyenda ya kitaani, oburaingwa bwarwo mikono igana, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />enyomyo zaayo ziri makumi abiri, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa nabyo makumi abiri; kwonka eby'okuhanikaho eby'ahari ezo nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa bumosho oburaingwa bwarwo buri mikono igana, enyomyo zaarwo ziri makumi abiri, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa makumi abiri, kwonka eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba oburaingwa bw'emikingo bwaba mikono makumi ataano, n'enyomyo zaakyo ikumi, n'ebiina byazo ikumi; eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Kandi omu maisho aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba obuhango bwarwo bukaba buri mikono makumi ataano. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Obuhango bw'emikingo ey'aha rubaju rumwe rw'eirembo buri mikono ikumi n'etaano, enyomyo zaayo ishatu, n'ebiina byazo bishatu; <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />byaba bityo n'aha rubaju; aha rundi rubaju rw'eirembo oru na ruriya obuhango bw'emikingo bukaba buri mikono ikumi n'etaano, enyomyo zaayo ishatu, n'ebiina byazo bishatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Emikingo yoona eyaabaire eyehinguririize ekibuga ekaba ekozirwe omu myenda ya kitaani; <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />ebiina by'okutamu enyomyo bikaba biri eby'emiringa; eby'okuhanikaho by'enyomyo n'obufunga bwazo biri eby'efeeza; n'emitwe yaazo eshwekirwe efeeza; n'enyomyo zoona ez'orugo rw'ekibuga zikaba ziine obufunga bw'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Kandi omukingo gw'eirembo ry'ekibuga gukaba gubaziirwemu ebicwererane by'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani; obuhango bwagwo bukaba buri mikono makumi abiri, n'obwemi bwagwo buri mikono etaano, nibwingana n'emikingo y'orwo rugo rwona. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Enyomyo zaagwo ziri ina, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa bina; eby'okuhanikaho byazo biri eby'efeeza; emitwe yaazo eshwekirwe n'efeeza, n'obufunga bwazo buri obw'efeeza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Kandi enkondo zoona ez'obutaaho n'ez'orugo orwabaire rwehinguririize ekibuga zikaba ziri ez'emiringa.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Ogu nigwo mubaro gw'ebintu byona ebyakozirwe ahabw'obutaaho, nibwo butaaho bw'Ebirikuhamya, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire ku bibarwa Abaleevi, abaabaire nibabibara, nibareebererwa Itamaari mwene Arooni omunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleeli mutabani wa Uuri mwene Huuri ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda akakora byona, ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa, <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />naakwatanisa na Oholiabu mwene Ahisamaaki, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani, omusharuzi w'amabaare, omu nyamwoga omu by'emirimo, omubaziizi w'ebicwererane by'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na bafuta.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Oburemeezi bw'ezaabu zoona ezi baatoizire ahabw'okukora omurimo gwona ogw'Omwanya ogurikwera bukaba buri talanta makumi abiri na mwenda, na shekeli magana mushanju na makumi ashatu, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Kandi oburemeezi bw'efeeza ezaahairwe ab'omu ihanga eryo abaabazirwe bukaba buri etalanta igana na shekeli rukumi na magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na itaano, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri; <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />nizo zaahairwe abashaija obusiriira mukaaga n'enkumi ishatu na magana ataano na makumi ataano; buri mushaija owaagiire omu baabazirwe ahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho akaba aha beeka emwe, nikyo kicweka kimwe kya kabiri kya shekeli nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Ezo talanta z'efeeza igana zikaba ziri ez'okuheeshamu ebiina by'embaaho z'Omwanya ogurikwera, n'eby'enyomyo z'omukingo, etalanta igana zirugwamu ebiina igana, ekiina kimwe etalanta emwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Kandi ezo shekeli rukumi na magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na itaano yaaziheeshamu eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwazo, yaagaruka yaazishwekyesa emitwe y'ezo nyomyo. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Kandi oburemeezi bw'emiringa ei baatoizire bukaba buri etalanta makumi mushanju na shekeli enkumi ibiri na magana ana. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Egyo miringa yaagiheeshamu ebiina by'enyomyo z'omuryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'eitambiro ry'omuringa hamwe n'ekintu ky'emiringa ekishobeekaine nk'ekigoye, n'ebintu byaryo byona, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:23">Isa 22:23</ref>. </char></note> n'ebiina by'enyomyo z'orugo orwehinguririize ekibuga, n'eby'ez'eirembo ryakyo, n'enkondo zoona ez'obutaaho, n'ez'orugo orwehinguririize ekibuga.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s1">Ebijwaro by'abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Kandi egyo myenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari baagikoramu ebijwaro ebikozirwe gye eby'okukoresa omu Mwanya ogurikwera, kandi baakorera Arooni ebijwaro birikwera, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Yaakora efodi n'emikwegye y'ezaabu n'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Ezaabu baagiheesha, yaaba akahwahwari, baagisharamu emikwegye y'okucwererana amabara omu myenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari n'eya bafuta, omurimo ogurikukorwa abanyamyoga b'obwengye. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Baakorera efodi ebiremu by'aha mabega biteerainwe nayo aha mikugiro yaayo yombi; <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />eky'okwezirikisa ekigikoreirweho, ekirukirwe abahangu, kyakorwa nkayo, kandi kyarukwa omu bintu bimwe n'ebyayo, emikwegye y'ezaabu, ehuuzi za bururu n'eza bujwa, n'eza karari, n'eza kitaani, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:16">Isa 49:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:17">Kush 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baashemeza amabaare agarikwetwa shohamu, baagahamisa ezaabu ekwegire, baagasharuraho amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli, nk'oku basharura akamanyiso aha ibaare. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Yaagata aha biremu bya efodi eby'aha mabega kuba amabaare g'okwijukiraho abaana ba Israeli, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaakora eky'aha kifuba, kyakorwa abanyamwoga, nk'oku baakozire efodi, baakikoresa emikwegye y'ezaabu, n'ehuuzi za bururu, n'eza bujwa, n'eza karari, n'eza kitaani. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Kikaba nikiingaingana embaju zoona; baakikora kikubiremu; oburaingwa bwakyo bwaba ekita kimwe, n'obuhango bwakyo nabwo bwaba ekita, waaba okikubiremu. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Baakitaho emishorongo y'amabaare ena; omushorongo ogw'okubanza gwabamu amabaare aga sarudio, topazi na barekesi, <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />omushorongo ogwa kabiri, samaragido, safiro na arimaasi, <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />omushorongo gwa kashatu huwakinto, kalukedoni na amesuusto, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />n'omushorongo ogwa kana berulo, shohamu na yasipi; goona gaahamibwa omu zaabu ekwegire. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Amabaare ago gaaba ikumi n'abiri, nk'amaziina g'abaana ba Israeli oku gari; gaahandiikwa nk'oku basharura akamanyiso, buri rimwe ryahandiikwaho eiziina ryaryo ahabw'enganda ikumi na ibiri. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Kandi baakorera eky'aha kifuba emikuufu ehotoire nk'omugoye, ekozire omu zaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Kandi baaheesha eby'okuhamya amabaare bibiri n'empeta ibiri omu zaabu; ezo mpeta baazita aha nshonda zombi ez'aha mutwe gw'eky'aha kifuba, <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />baarabya egyo mikuufu yombi ey'ezaabu ehotoire omuri ezo mpeta ez'aha nshonda zaakyo zombi. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Emitwe yombi ey'egyo mikuufu ehotoire baagikoma aha by'okuhamya amabaare byombi, baabikwatsa aha biremu by'efodi eby'aha mabega aha rubaju rwabyo orw'omumaisho. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Kandi baakora ezindi mpeta z'ezaabu ibiri, baazita aha nshonda ibiri ez'omukugiro gw'eky'aha kifuba ogw'omunda aha rubaju oruri haihi na efodi. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Kandi baakora empeta z'ezaabu ibiri, baazita aha mukugiro gw'ahansi ogw'ebiremu bibiri eby'aha mabega omu maisho, ahu birikuteeranira n'eky'okwezirikisa kya efodi ekirukirwe abanyamwoga. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Kandi eky'aha kifuba baakikoma aha mpeta za efodi, bakikomesa otwenda twa bururu, nibaturabya omu mpeta zaakyo, ngu eky'aha kifuba kirekye kuyuga kikataana na efodi, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Kandi yaakora ekanzu ya efodi, erukirwe omu mwenda gwa bururu gwonka; <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />yaagira ebitsya by'okurabyamu omutwe, nk'oku bakora ebijwaro bya kitaani, ebikugiire n'omutarizo, ngu etataaguka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Aha mukugiro gwayo ogw'ahansi baabaziiraho ebirikushusha amakoma-mahanga ebirukire omu huuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Baaheesha amajugo omu zaabu eshemeziibwe, baagahunda ahagati y'ago makoma-mahanga aha mukugiro gw'egyo kanzu okugyehinguririza, <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />eijugo ryakuratwa eikoma-mahanga, eijugo eikoma mahanga, bityo bityo byayehinguririza omukugiro gw'egyo kanzu, ngu ebe ey'okujwarwa orikukora omurimo gw'obuheereza, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:22">Rom 3:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baakorera Arooni n'abatabani ekooti ezirukire omuri bafuta, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:17">Ezk 44:17</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 44:18">18</ref>. </char></note> n'ekikwemba kya bafuta, n'enkofiira nungi eza bafuta, n'empare za kitaani, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />n'eky'okwezirikisa kya kitaani n'emyenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa n'eya karari, ebaziirwemu ebicwererane, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 93:5">Zab 93:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baakora ekipande ky'ekirunga kirikwera omu zaabu eshemeziibwe, baakihandiikaho ekihandiiko ekirikushusha nk'akamanyiso akasharwirwe aha ibaare, ekirikugira kiti: Oyereziibwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Baakikomaho otwenda twa bururu, kukikwatanisa n'ekyo kikwemba aharuguru, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Okwo nikwo omurimo gwona gw'okukora obutaaho bw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu gwahweire, Abaisraeli bakakora byona nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. Nikwo baakozire batyo. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:1-28">Heb 9:1-28</ref>. </char></note> Baareetera Musa obutaaho n'Eihema n'ebintu byaryo byona, ebikwatsi byaryo, embaaho zaaryo, embazi zaaryo, enyomyo zaaryo, ebiina byaryo, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />eky'okushweka ky'empu z'empaya z'entaama ezizigirwe n'erangi erikutukura, eky'okushweka ky'empu z'engongi, omukingo gw'okukingira Aharikwera munonga, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya n'emigamba yaayo n'ekitebe ky'okusaasira, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />emeeza n'ebintu byayo byona n'emigaati y'okumurika, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:15">Fil 2:15</ref>. </char></note> ekikondo ky'etabaaza ky'ezaabu eshemeziibwe n'amatabaaza gaakyo g'okukitaho n'ebintu byakyo byona n'amajuta g'okuhemba, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />ekyoterero ky'ezaabu, amajuta g'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, obubaane oburikutaamirana, omukingo gw'aha muryango gw'Eihema, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />eitambiro ry'emiringa n'ekintu kyaryo ky'emiringa ekishobeekaine, n'emigamba yaaryo n'ebintu byaryo byona, ekinaabiro n'ekibunu kyakyo, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:12">Kush 3:12</ref>. </char></note> emikingo y'orugo rw'ekibuga n'enyomyo zaayo n'ebiina byazo, omukingo gw'eirembo ry'ekibuga, emiguha yaarwo n'enkondo zaarwo, kandi n'ebintu byona eby'okukoresa omu butaaho, niryo Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />n'eby'okujwara ebibaziirwe gye eby'okukoresa omu Mwanya ogurikwera, n'ebijwaro ebirikwera ebya Arooni omunyamurwa n'eby'abatabani eby'okukoresa omurimo gw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Abaisraeli baakora omurimo gwona, nibakuratira byona ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:6">Yos 22:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:27">2 Bus 30:27</ref>. </char></note> Musa yaayetegyereza emirimo yoona, yaareeba bagiherize; nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire, nikwo baabaire bagikozire. Musa yaabashabira omugisha.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s1">Okwimutsya Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />Aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwezi kw'okubanza oryaimutsya obutaaho bw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />obutemu eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya, oteho omukingo gw'okugikingira, <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />otemu emeeza, otebeekanise ebintu ebigiriho, otemu ekikondo ky'etabaaza, okiteho amatabaaza gaakyo, <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />ekyoterero ky'ezaabu eky'okwotereraho obubaane okite omu maisho g'eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya, ote omukingo aha muryango gw'obutaaho, <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />ote eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo omu maisho g'omuryango gw'obutaaho bw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />ote ekinaabiro ahagati y'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu n'eitambiro, kandi okishukyemu amaizi, <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />oimutsye orugo, rwehinguririze ekibuga, ote omukingo aha irembo ryakyo, <verse eid="EXO 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />otware amajuta g'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, ogashukye aha butaaho n'aha bintu byona ebirimu, obweze n'ebintu byabwo byona, bube oburikwera; <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />ogashukye n'aha itambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo, n'ebintu byaryo byona, oryeze; eryo itambiro ribe eririkwera munonga, <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />kandi ogashukye n'aha kinaabiro n'aha kibunu kyakyo, okyeze. <verse eid="EXO 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:1-13">Lev 8:1-13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima oreete Arooni n'abatabani aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, oboozye n'amaizi, <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />ojwekye Arooni ebijwaro birikwera, omushukyeho amajuta, omweze, abone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa; <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:23">Heb 7:23</ref>. </char></note> oreete n'abatabani, obajwekye ekooti, <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />obashukyeho amajuta, nk'oku oriba waagashukire ahari ishebo, babone kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa; okwo kushukwaho kwabo kuryabahaisa obunyamurwa bw'ebiro byona omu busingye bwabo bwona.<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Musa yaakora atyo; nk'ebi MUKAMA yaamuragiire byona oku byabaire biri, nikwo Musa yaakozire. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Omu kwezi kw'okubanza okw'omu mwaka gwa kabiri, aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwo kwezi obutaaho bwaimukibwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Musa yaimutsya obwo butaaho, yaataho ebiina byabwo, yaimutsya embaaho zaabwo, yaatamu embazi zaabwo, yaabyara n'enyomyo zaabwo. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Bwanyima yaashakaaza obutaaho eihema, yaaritaho eky'okurishweka, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Yaatwara Ebirikuhamya, yaabita omu shanduukye, yaata emigamba omu bifunga byayo, ahaiguru yaayo yaataho ekitebe ky'okusaasira; <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />yaataasya egyo shanduukye omu butaaho, yaataho omukingo gw'okukingira eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Bwanyima yaata emeeza omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu enyima y'omukingo aha rubaju rw'obutaaho orurikureeba obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />yaagitebeekanisaho emigaati omu maisho ga MUKAMA, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Kandi yaata ekikondo ky'etabaaza omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, kyareebana n'emeeza, aha rubaju rw'obutaaho aharikureeba obukiizi-bwa-buryo, <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />yaakitaho amatabaaza omu maisho ga MUKAMA, nk'oku yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Yaata ekyoterero ky'ezaabu omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu omu maisho g'omukingo, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />yaakyotereraho obubaane bw'eby'emigaju ebirikutaamirana, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Yaata omukingo aha muryango gw'obutaaho; <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />yaata eitambiro ry'okwokyezaho ebitambo omu maisho g'omuryango gw'obutaaho bw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, yaaritambiraho ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'eky'esaano, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Kandi yaata ekinaabiro ahagati y'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu n'eryo itambiro, yaakishukamu amaizi g'okunaaba, <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />eki Musa na Arooni n'abatabani baabaire banaabiramu engaro zaabo n'ebigyere byabo; <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />ku baabaire baba nibataaha omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, kandi nibaza aha itambiro, banaaba, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Bwanyima yaimutsya orugo kwehinguririza obutaaho n'eitambiro, yaataho omukingo gw'eirembo ry'ekibuga. Atyo Musa yaaheza omurimo.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:7">Hag 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ekicu kyashweka Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaijura obwo butaaho. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:14">2 Bus 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Musa tiyaabaasa kutaaha omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ahabw'okuba ekyo kicu kikaba kiririho, kandi ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kiijwire obwo butaaho. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:19">Neh 9:19</ref>. </char></note> Omu ngyendo zaabo zoona ekyo kicu ku kyabaire kiihwa ahari obwo butaaho, Abaisraeli baimuka, bagyenda; <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />kwonka ku kyabaire kiba kitaihirweho, bakaba batagyenda, okuhitsya aha izooba eri kyabaire kiihirwaho. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:15">Kub 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ekicu kya MUKAMA kikaba kiguma ahari obwo butaaho nyomushana, kandi kibamu omuriro nyekiro omu maisho g'ab'enju ya Israeli boona omu ngyendo zaabo zoona.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>